<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="ACT" style="id">- Kwere Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Sang'hano</para>
  <para style="toc1">Sang'hano za Watumigwa</para>
  <para style="toc2">Sang'hano</para>
  <para style="toc3">Sang'h</para>
  <para style="mt1">SANG'HANO ZA WATUMIGWA</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongozi</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Sang'hano za Watumigwa ni simo za mwanduso wa bumbila da wahuwila wa Chilisito na viya viyenele Mbuli Inogile kwandusila Yelusalemu na Yudeya na Samaliya hata kugendelela, fana viya Yesu viyawalongele wanahina wake yang'hali kusoligwa kuulanga muna Sang'hano za Watumigwa 1:8. Chitabu chino chandikigwa na Luka ija yandike Mbuli Inogile ya Luka. Yeye kakala mganga na iviya kaiteganya ng'hani muna ukwika vinogile vinhu. Luka kasang'hanila Mbuli Inogile ya Luka na chitabu cha Sang'hano za Watumigwa kwa kumwandikila mwenevale Tofili yoyakalile Muyunani muna 1:1, mbali vitabu vino vosonhela kwa wanhu wa bumbila da wahuwila wa Chilisito na Wagiliki na Wayahudi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Sang'hano za Watumigwa yodahika chandikigwa hagati ya mwaka 60-64 kwandusila viyelekigwe Yesu, kwaviya chitabu chokomelezela yang'hali Paulo hanalavigwa bule muna ichifungo. Iviya Luka kagenda miyanza mingi na Mtumigwa Paulo na yodahika kandika Sang'hano za Watumigwa muna dibululu da Amtiokiya. Sanghano za Watumigwa ni magendelelo ya Mbuli Inogile yandikigwe na Luka yokwandusa na Yesu kwiita mchanyha kuulanga. Lungilo da Luka kwandika ni fana viya da Mbuli yake Inogile. Kalonda Tofili na Wachilisito wowakalile wokongezeka wavimanye kuwa yaja yowafundizigwe na ivo kandika simo ya kweli ya ugima wa Yesu na kwenela kwa bumbila da wahuwila wa Chilisito.</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Sang'hano za Watumigwa choching'ha masimwe ya wanhu wa bumbila da wahuwila wa mwanduso na chochilagusa vochilondeka kukala kwa kumuhuwila Yesu. Masimwe ya Watumigwa yochilagusa viya kutegemeya ludabwa wa Muhe Yelile muna ukweneza usenga wa Mbuli Inogile kwa wanhu wamwenga.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yeliumo</para>
  <para style="ili">1. Kwiza kwa Muhe Yelile kwa Wanahina na mwanduso wa kukula kwa bumbila da wahuwila wa Chilisito muna 1:1-8:1.</para>
  <para style="ili">2. Kaidi yolonga magayo ng'hani ya bumbila na yokwenela Yelusalemu muna 8:2-12:23.</para>
  <para style="ili">3. Maabaho yolonga Paulo kokwandusa mwanza wake wa mwanduso muna 12:24-14:28.</para>
  <para style="ili">4. Iviya lundo doiting'hana Yelusalemu kuitogolela chilihi chochilondeka kwa wahuwila wa sambi muna 15:1-35.</para>
  <para style="ili">5. Hamwande yolonga Paulo kohita mwanza wake wekaidi muna 15:36 - 18:22.</para>
  <para style="ili">6. Maabaho Paulo kohita mwana wake weketatu muna 18:23-20:38.</para>
  <para style="ili">7. Kaidi Paulo kogwiligwa uko Yelusalemu muna isula ya 21-26.</para>
  <para style="ili">8. Kuhelelo Paulo kogaligwa isi ya Loma muna isula ya 27-28.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="ACT 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 1:1" />Mwenevale Tofili. Muna ichitabu changu cha mwanduso, nyandika mbuli zose Yesu ziyatendile na kufundiza kusongela viyanduse usang'hano wake, <verse eid="ACT 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 1:2" />mbaka siku diya diyasoligwe kuhita kuulanga. Yang'hali hanasoligwa, kaweng'ha malagilizo kwa udaho wa Muhe Yelile watumigwa waja woyawasagule. <verse eid="ACT 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 1:3" />Kwa lusita lwa siku malongo mane hamwande ya ifa yake, Yesu kawalawilila miyanza mingi na kwa nzila nyingi kulagusa kuwa kweli kakala mgima. Wamuwona, nayo kalonga nawo mbuli za Ufalume wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 1:4" />Viyaiting'hane nawo, kawalagiliza vino, “Sekemulawe Yelusalemu, mbali mugozele chitumetume chonimulongeleni, chitumetume chiya choyawalaganile Tati yangu. <verse eid="ACT 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 1:5" />Yohana kabatiza kwa mazi, mbali mweye siku ndodo hamwande mwizabatizigwa kwa Muhe Yelile.”<verse eid="ACT 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu kosoligwa kuulanga</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MRK 16:19-20">Maliki 16:19-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:50-53">Luka 24:50-53</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 1:6" />Watumigwa viwaiting'hane na Yesu, wamuuza, “Mndewa, vino lusita luno kwizawabwelezela Waisilaeli Ufalume?”<verse eid="ACT 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 1:7" />Yesu kawalongela, “Lusita hebu msimu vikigwa kwa udaho wa Tati yangu, mweye siyo sang'hano yenu kuvimanya izakuwa zuwaki. <verse eid="ACT 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 1:8" />Mbali Muhe Yelile yahamwizilani, mwizahokela ludabwa, na mweye mwizakuwa wakalangama wangu uko Yelusalemu na muna isi ya Yudeya na muna isi ya Samaliya, na muna isi yose.”<verse eid="ACT 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 1:9" />Viyakomeleze kulonga yayo kasoligwa kuulanga, wose wakala womulola, maabaho wingu dingubika muna yameso yawo.<verse eid="ACT 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 1:10" />Viwakalile wang'hali wobunhula yameso yawo kuulanga Yesu viyakalile kosoligwa, bahobaho wanhu waidi wakalile wayawale viwalo vizelu chwee wema habehi yawo, <verse eid="ACT 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 1:11" />walonga, “Mweye wanhu wa Galilaya! Habali mwima hano mobunhula meso kuulanga? Yesu ino yoyasoligwe kumwenu kuhita kuulanga, kezabwela kaidi fana viyaviya vimumuwonile kohita kuulanga.”<verse eid="ACT 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matiyasi kosaguligwa yasole nyafasi ya Yuda</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="MAT 27:3-10">Masayo 27:3-10</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 1:12" />Maabaho watumigwa wabwela Yelusalemu kulawa kuna Ulugongo lwa Mizaituni, utali wa chilomita imwe kulawa kuna dibululu. <verse eid="ACT 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 1:13" />Viwafikile kuna dibululu, wengila muna ichiheleto cha uchanyha chiwakalile wokala. Nawo wakala Petili na Yohana na Yakobo na Andeleya na Filipo na Tomasi na Batulomayo na Masayo na Yakobo mwana wa Alufayo na Saimoni Zeloti na Yuda mwana wa Yakobo. <verse eid="ACT 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 1:14" />Wawo wose wagendelela kuiting'hana hamwe kutosa hamwe na wanaake waja na Maliya, mami yake Yesu, na wadodo zake Yesu wa chilume.<verse eid="ACT 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 1:15" />Siku dimwe muna zisiku izo, kukala na mting'hano wa wahuwila. Wahuwila wawo wakala gana na malongo maidi. Petili kema hagati yawo, kalonga, <verse eid="ACT 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 1:16" />“Ndugu zangu, ilondeka Maandiko Yelile yatimiye, Muhe Yelile kalonga kufosela Daudi na kalotela mbuli za Yuda, yoyawalongoze wanhu waja wowamgwilile Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 1:17" />Yuda kakala miyetu kwaviya kasaguligwa muladi chisang'hane nayo sang'hano ino.”<verse eid="ACT 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 1:18" />Yeye kagula mgunda kwa zihela ziyapatile kwa sang'hano yake ihile, kagwa muna umgunda uwo, katulika na utumbo wake wose ulawa kunze. <verse eid="ACT 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 1:19" />Wanhu wose wa Yelusalemu wahulika mbuli izo, ivo muna uulonzi wawo wautanga mgunda uwo Akelidana, fambulo jake “Mgunda wa damu.” <verse eid="ACT 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 1:20" />“Kwaviya yandikigwa muna Izabuli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Kaye yake ikale bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">munhu yoyose sekeyakale muna ikaye iyo.’ Iviya yandikigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 1:20">‘Munhu imwenga yamhe sang'hano yake.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 1:21" />Ivo yolondeka kumsagula munhu imwe kulawa muna iwanhu wailongoze na cheye siku zose Mndewa Yesu viyakalile hamwe na cheye, <verse eid="ACT 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 1:22" />kwandusila siku ziya Yohana viyakalile yang'hali kobatiza, mbaka siku diya Yesu viyasoligwe kulawa kumwetu kuhita kuulanga. Munhu iyo kolondeka yawe mkalangama miyetu wa kuzilibuka kwa Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 1:23" />Ivo wasagula mazina maidi, Yosefu yoyatangigwe Balisaba, iviya katangigwa Yusito, na imwenga Matiyasi. <verse eid="ACT 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 1:24" />Maabaho watosa, “Mndewa, weye koimanya mizoyo ya wanhu wose. Lelo uchilaguse munhu yelihi youmsagula muna iwanhu wano waidi <verse eid="ACT 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 1:25" />yamhe sang'hano ya utumigwa yoyailekile Yuda, ija yoyahitile hanhu hake mwenyewo.” <verse eid="ACT 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 1:26" />Maabaho wasagula imwe mwa wawo waidi kwa kuwatowela mhiya, na mhiya imgwila Matiyasi, nayo kongezigwa muna iwatumigwa longo na imwe.<verse eid="ACT 1:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="ACT 2" />
  <para style="s">Kwiza kwa Muhe Yelile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 2:1" />Isiku ya Pentekosite vidifikile, wahuwila wose wakala waiting'hana hanhu hamwe. <verse eid="ACT 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 2:2" />Bahaja, wanhu wahulika mbumo kulawa kuulanga fana mbumo wa mbeho wobuma kwa ludabwa, nawo umemeza ikaye yose yowakalile wanhu wawo. <verse eid="ACT 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 2:3" />Maabaho vilawilila vinhu voviwoneka fana milambi ya moto, navo vipwililika na kukala mchanyha ya chila munhu. <verse eid="ACT 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 2:4" />Wose wamemezigwa Muhe Yelile, wasonga kulonga kwa ulonzi umwenga fana Muhe Yelile viyawadahize kulonga.<verse eid="ACT 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 2:5" />Uko Yelusalemu kukala na Wayahudi womnogeza Mulungu wowalawile chila isi hasi ya ulanga. <verse eid="ACT 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 2:6" />Viwahulike mbumo uwo, lung'husesa lukulu lwa wanhu waitingana hamwe. Wose weduka kwaviya chila munhu kawahulika walonga kwa ulonzi wake mwenyewo. <verse eid="ACT 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 2:7" />Wazaganyika ng'hani, walonga, “Vino wanhu wano wose wochiwahulika wolonga vino si Wagalilaya? <verse eid="ACT 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 2:8" />Lelo yokuwaze chila imwe wetu kowahulika wolonga kwa ulonzi wake mwenyewo? <verse eid="ACT 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 2:9" />Wamwenga chilawilila uko Palitiya na Midiya na Elamu, wamwenga chilawilila uko Mesopotaniya na Yudeya na Kapokiya na Ponto na Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 2:10" />Filigiya na Pamfiliya, Misili, na banzi za Libiya habehi na Chilene, wamwenga walawilila Loma, <verse eid="ACT 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 2:11" />Wayahudi na wanhu wamwenga weli siyo Wayahudi wowengile muna inzila ya kumsondelela Mulungu ya Chiyahudi, wamwenga chilawilila Chilete na Alabiya. Mbali cheye chose chiwahulika wolonga kwa ulonzi wetu wenyewo vinhu vikulu viyatendile Mulungu.” <verse eid="ACT 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 2:12" />Wose wazanywa na wengilwa na mkangagile, waiuzagiza, “Vino mbuli ino fambulo jake choni?”<verse eid="ACT 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 2:13" />Mbali wanhu wamwenga wawazeha, walonga, “Wanhu wano wakoligwa na divai!”<verse eid="ACT 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usenga wa Petili kwa wanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 2:14" />Maabaho Petili kema hamwe na waja watumigwa longo na imwe, kandusa kululandulila lung'husesa, kalonga, “Wayahudi wayangu, na mweye mose womukalile hano Yelusalemu, lekeni niwalongele na mweye mutegeleze goya chinilonga. <verse eid="ACT 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 2:15" />Wanhu wano hawakoligwe bule fana vimulonga. Sambi saa nhatu imitondo! <verse eid="ACT 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 2:16" />Chino chochilawilile icho chiyalongile Yoweli, mulotezi wa Mulugu,<verse eid="ACT 2:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 2:17" />‘Mulungu kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">Muna zisiku za uhelelo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">nizawetilila Muhe wangu wanhu wose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">Wana wenu wa chilume na wa chike</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">wezagong'onda usenga wangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">Wabwanga zenu wezawona malaguso</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:17">na walala wezalota nzozi.<verse eid="ACT 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 2:18" />Na wasang'hani wangu iviya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">wose wa chike na wa chilume</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">nizawetilila Muhe wangu muna zisiku izo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:18">nawo wezagong'onda usenga wangu.<verse eid="ACT 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 2:19" />Nizatenda mawewedeka kuulanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">na vilaguso muna isi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:19">kwizakuwa na damu na moto na mvuke wa mosi.<verse eid="ACT 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 2:20" />Zua dizagalusigwa kuwa ziza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">na mwezi wizagalusigwa kuwa mdung'hu fana damu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:20">ing'hali hainafika Isiku ija ng'hulu na da utunhizo da Mndewa.<verse eid="ACT 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 2:21" />Chila munhu yonda yaditange zina da Mndewa kezalopoligwa.’<verse eid="ACT 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 2:22" />“Tegelezeni wanhu wa Isilaeli! Yesu wa Nazaleti kakala munhu yeli na udaho, yoyalagusigwe na Mulungu kumwenu kwa nzila ya mawewedeka na vilaguso na mauzauza yoyatendile Mulungu mgati mmwenu kufosela yeye, fana mweye wenyewo vimmanyile. <verse eid="ACT 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 2:23" />Kulawa mwanduso, Mulungu mwenyewo kwa lungilo jake kalamula kuwa Yesu kezakwikigwa muna yamakono yenu, mwizamkoma kwa kuwaleka wanhu weli na uhasanyi wamuwambe mumsalaba. <verse eid="ACT 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 2:24" />Mbali Mulungu kamtenda Yesu yazilibuke kulawa kwa wanhu wadanganike, kamkombola kulawa muna usungu wa ifa kwaviya haidahike bule ifa kumfunga. <verse eid="ACT 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 2:25" />Kwaviya Daudi kalonga mbuli za Yesu vino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">‘Nimuwona Mndewa haulongozi hangu siku zose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">kwaviya yeye kahamwe na niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:25">na niye sizadumba bule.<verse eid="ACT 2:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 2:26" />Ivo moyo wangu wodeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">lulimi lwangu lolonga kwa kudeng'helela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:26">na lukuli lwangu lwizakala kwa kulolela,<verse eid="ACT 2:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 2:27" />kwaviya hwizanileka kuzimu bule</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:27">hwizamuleka mtumigwa wako yelile yawole muna dileme.<verse eid="ACT 2:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 2:28" />Kunilagusa nzila yoilongoza kuna ugima,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:28">na kwizanimemeza deng'ho kwaviya kwahamwe na niye.’<verse eid="ACT 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 2:29" />“Ndugu zangu, nolonda kuwalongelani funhufunhu kwa mbuli zozimpatile wasaho yetu Daudi. Yeye kadanganika na kawandigwa, leme jake dabahano mbaka diyelo. <verse eid="ACT 2:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 2:30" />Mbali kwaviya Daudi kakala mulotezi wa Mulungu, kavimanya chiya Mulungu chiyamulongele. Mulungu kailaha kulonga kuwa kezamtenda imwe muna welesi wake yakale muna ichigoda cha chifalume fana viya viyakalile Daudi. <verse eid="ACT 2:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 2:31" />Daudi kawona chiya Mulungu chondayamtendele hamwande, ivo kalonga mbuli za kuzilibuka kwa Chilisito Mulopozi viyalongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:31">‘Hezalekigwa kuzimu bule,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:31">wala lukuli lwake haluwola bule.’<verse eid="ACT 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 2:32" />Mulungu kamzilibula ino Yesu, na cheye wose cha wakalangama wa mbuli iyo. <verse eid="ACT 2:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 2:33" />Yesu kenuligwa na kwikigwa ubanzi wa kulume wa Mulungu, Tati yake. Kahokela Muhe Yelile kulawa kumwake fana viyachilaganile. Maabaho kachigalila Muhe iyo, na icho niicho chomuchiwona na kuchihulika sambi. <verse eid="ACT 2:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 2:34" />Kwaviya siyo Daudi bule yoyasoligwe kuhita kuulanga, mbali kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">‘Mndewa kamulongela Mndewa wangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 2:34">kala ubanzi wangu wa kulume,<verse eid="ACT 2:34" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 2:35" />mbaka vondaniwatende wehi wako kuwa chinhu cha kwikila magulu yako.’<verse eid="ACT 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 2:36" />“Lelo wanhu wose wa Isilaeli wavimanye kuwa kweli Mulungu kamtenda ino Yesu yomumuwambile mumsalaba yawe Mndewa na Chilisito Mulopozi.”<verse eid="ACT 2:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 2:37" />Wanhu viwahulike yano, wasomigwa mizoyo yawo wamuuza Petili na watumigwa wamwenga, “Ndugu zetu, chitende choni?” <verse eid="ACT 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 2:38" />Petili kedika, “Chila munhu kolondeka yaleke uhasanyi wake na yabatizigwe kwa zina da Yesu Chilisito, Mulungu keza mulekelelani uhasanyi wenu. Na mweye mwizahokela Muhe Yelile, chitumetume cha Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 2:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 2:39" />Kwaviya chilagano chiya chilaganiligwa kwa ichimu chenu na wanenu na kwa wanhu wose wokala kutali, kwa wanhu wose wotangigwa na Mndewa Mulungu wetu.”<verse eid="ACT 2:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 2:40" />Petili kawasimulila mbuli zimwenga nyingi ng'hani, kalonga, “Muilolopole wenyewo kulawa muna welesi uno wihile.” <verse eid="ACT 2:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 2:41" />Wanhu wengi wazitogola mbuli zake na wabatizigwa, na muna disiku diya wanhu magana malongo matatu wongezeka muna ulung'husesa. <verse eid="ACT 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 2:42" />Wano wose wagendelela kufundizigwa na watumigwa wa Yesu, kukala hamwe chindugu na kuja hamwe na kutosa.<verse eid="ACT 2:42" /></para>
  <para style="s">Viya wahuwila viwakalile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 2:43" />Watumigwa watenda vilaguso na mawewedeko mengi mbaka chila munhu kadumba. <verse eid="ACT 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 2:44" />Wanhu wose womuhuwila Chilisito wagendela kuwa wamwe na kuigolela vinhu vawo. <verse eid="ACT 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 2:45" />Wakala wogula vinhu viwalinavo na waigolela hela fana chila munhu viyalondile. <verse eid="ACT 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 2:46" />Chila siku kwa moyo umwe wagendelela kuiting'hana hamwe muna Ikaye ya Mulungu, waja ndiya hamwe muna zikaye zawo na wadeng'helela ndiya ya Mndewa. <verse eid="ACT 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 2:47" />Wamtogoza Mulungu na wanhu wose wanogeligwa nawo. Chila siku Mndewa kakala kowongezela wanhu wakalile wolopoligwa.<verse eid="ACT 2:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="ACT 3" />
  <para style="s">Petili na Yohana womuhonya mbetembete</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 3:1" />Siku dimwe saa kenda imisi, Petili na Yohana wakala wohita kuna Ikaye ya Mulungu lusita lwa kutambika. <verse eid="ACT 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 3:2" />Lusita ulo wanhu wakala wampapa munhu yakalile mbetembete kulawa kwelekigwa kwake. Chila siku wanhu wakala womwika munhu iyo hana ulwivi lwa Kaye ya Mulungu, lolutangigwe “Lwivi lunogile” muladi yapule chochose kwa waja wakalile wokwingila muna Ikaye ya Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 3:3" />Viyawawone Petili na Yohana wokwingila muna Ikaye ya Mulungu kawapula wamwing'he chinhu chochose. <verse eid="ACT 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 3:4" />Peti na Yohana wambunhulila yameso. Maabaho Petili kamulongela, “Chilole!” <verse eid="ACT 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 3:5" />Nayo kawalola, kalolela kupata chinhu chochose kumwawo. <verse eid="ACT 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 3:6" />Maabaho Petili kamulongela, “Nabule hela wala zahabu, mbali nokwing'ha chiya chinili nacho, kwa zina da Yesu Chilisito wa Nazaleti, wime ugende!” <verse eid="ACT 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 3:7" />Maabaho kamwamha mkono wake wa kulume na kamwinula. Bahobaho magulu na mavindi yake viwa na ludabwa. <verse eid="ACT 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 3:8" />Kazumha, kema kwa magulu yake na kandusa kugenda genda. Maabaho kengila nawo muna Ikaye ya Mulungu kogenda na kozumha zumha na komtogoza Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 3:9" />Wanhu wose wowakalile baho viwamuwonile kogenda na kumtogoza Mulungu, <verse eid="ACT 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 3:10" />viwammanyile kuwa ni yeye yakalile kopula habehi na “Lwivi lunogile” lwa Ikaye ya Mulungu, wazanywa kwa chiya chimulawilile.<verse eid="ACT 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usenga wa Petili muna Ikaye ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 3:11" />Munhu iyo viyakali kohita na Petili na Yohana, wanhu wose wazanywa na wandusa kukimbilila hanhu hatangigwe “Luhelengo lwa Solomoni.” <verse eid="ACT 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 3:12" />Petili viyawone ivo, kawalongela, “Wanhu wa Isilaeli, habali mwokwazanywa kwa chinhu chino? Mbona mochibunhulila meso fana cheye niiyo chimtendile munhu ino yadahe kugenda kwa ludabwa lwetu wenyewo, hebu kwaviya cheye chinoga haulongozi ha Mulungu? <verse eid="ACT 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 3:13" />Mulungu wa Bulahimu na Isaka na Yakobo, Mulungu wa wasaho zetu, kamtunhiza Yesu msang'hani wake. Mbali mweye mumsola muladi yakomigwe, mumwika muna yamakono ya wakulu na mumbela haulongozi ha Pilato, mbaka Pilato viyalondile kumulekele yahite,<verse eid="ACT 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 3:14" />“Kakala Yelile na kanoga, mbali mweye mumulema na mumulamba Pilato yamulekelele munhu mkomaji. <verse eid="ACT 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 3:15" />Mumkoma munhu ija yakalille mwanduso wa ugima, mbali Mulungu kamzilibula na cheye ni wakalangama wa mbuli iyo. <verse eid="ACT 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 3:16" />Ludabwa lwa zina da Yesu ni ulo lumtendile munhu ino yomumuwona na kummanya yahone. Kadihuwila zina da Yesu. Kudihuwila zina da Yesu kumtenda munhu ino yahone kweli fana wanhu wose viwamuwone.<verse eid="ACT 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 3:17" />“Lelo, ndugu zangu Waisilaeli, novimanya kuwa mweye na walangulizi wenu mumtendela yano Yesu kwaviya hamuvimanyile bule. <verse eid="ACT 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 3:18" />Mbali Mulungu kakomeleza chila chiyalongile umwaka kwa nzila ya walotezi wose, kuwa ilondeka Chilisito wake yadununzigwe. <verse eid="ACT 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 3:19" />Samh'samheni na mumbwelele Mulungu, muladi yamulekeleleni uhasanyi wenu. Muhatenda ivo, <verse eid="ACT 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 3:20" />lusita lwa kongezigwa ludabwa muna umuhe lokwiza kulawa kwa Mndewa, nayo kezamtuma Yesu, yeli Chilisito Mkombola, yomsaguliligwe.<verse eid="ACT 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 3:21" />“Kolondeka yakale kuulanga mbaka lusita lwa kutendigwa vinhu vose kaidi lufike, fana viya Mulungu viyalongile kufosela walotezi wake welile wowakalile umwaka.<verse eid="ACT 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 3:22" />“Musa kalonga, ‘Mndewa Mulungu wenu kezamgalilani mulotezi wake fana viya viyanitumile niye, iyo kezalawa kumwenu wenyewo. Molondeka kuhulika chila chinhu chiyomulongelani. <verse eid="ACT 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 3:23" />Munhu yoyose yolema kumuhulika mulotezi iyo wa Mulungu, kezabaguligwa kulawa muna iwanhu wa Mulungu na kezakomigwa.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 3:24" />Walotezi wose wa Mulungu, kwandusila Samweli na waja wose wezile hamwande, iviya walonga mbuli za vinhu vilawilila muna zisiku zino. <verse eid="ACT 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 3:25" />Chilagano cha Mulungu kumwenu kufosela walotezi wake ni kwa ichimu chenu, mweye mwa hanhu ha lagano diyatendile Mulungu na wasaho zenu. Fana viyamulongele Bulahimu, ‘Kufosela welesi wako, nizawatemela mate wanhu wose muna isi yose.’ <verse eid="ACT 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 3:26" />Ivo Mulungu kamsagula msang'hani wake na kamtuma iyo teng'hu kumwenu muladi yamtemeleni mate kwa kumtenda chila munhu yaleke sang'hano zake zihile.”<verse eid="ACT 3:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="ACT 4" />
  <para style="s">Petili na Yohana haulongozi ha dilundo da wakulu wa isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 4:1" />Petili na Yohana viwakalile wang'hali wolonga na wanhu, wakulu wa nhambiko wamwenga na mkulu wa wakalizi wa Ikaye ya Mulungu na Masadukayo wamwenga wafika.<verse eid="ACT 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 4:2" />Wehilwa ng'hani kwaviya watumigwa waja waidi wakala wowafundiza wanhu kuwa Yesu kazilibuka. Iyo yolagusa kuwa wanhu wowadanganike wezazilibuka. <verse eid="ACT 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 4:3" />Ivo wawagwila na waweka mchifungo mbaka siku isondelele, kwaviya ikala chigulogulo. <verse eid="ACT 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 4:4" />Mbali wanhu wengi wowahulike usenga wawo wahuwila. Peta ya walume wowahuwile ikala magana malongo matano.<verse eid="ACT 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 4:5" />Siku isondelele, walangulizi wa Wayahudi na walala na wafundinza Malagilizo waiting'hana uko Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 4:6" />Waiting'hana na mkulu wa nhambiko Anasi na Kayafa na Yohana na Alekizanda na wanhu wamwenga wowakalile wa lukolo lwa mkulu wa nhambiko digogogo. <verse eid="ACT 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 4:7" />Wawemiza watumigwa waja haulongozi hawo na wawauza, “Kwa ludabwa lulihi na kwa zina da yelihi motenda mbuli zino?”<verse eid="ACT 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 4:8" />Petili kamemezigwa Muhe Yelile, kawalongela, “Walangulizi wa wanhu na walala, <verse eid="ACT 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 4:9" />one chihauzigwa diyelo chinhu chinogile chiyatendiligwe mbetembete na viya viyahonyigwe, <verse eid="ACT 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 4:10" />maabaho mweye wose na wanhu wa Isilaeli muvimanye kuwa munhu ino yemile hano haulongozi wenu kahona kwa kufosela ludabwa lwa zina da Yesu Chilisito wa Nazaleti, yomumuwambile mumsalaba na Mulungu kamzilibula. <verse eid="ACT 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 4:11" />Ino iyo ija yolongigwa muna Yamaandiko Yelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">‘Biki dowalemile wazenzi</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:11">sambi diwa mhanda ya mgomba.’<verse eid="ACT 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 4:12" />Yeye muhala yoyodaha kuchilopola, habule munhu imwenga muna isi yose yoching'higwe na Mulungu yoyodaha kuchilopola.”<verse eid="ACT 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 4:13" />Wanhu wa ichitala wazanywa viwawonile ugangamalo wa petili na Yohana, na kuwamanya kuwa ni wanhu hawasomile. Wavimanya kuwa wawo wakala hamwe na Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 4:14" />Mbali hawakalile na mbuli yoyose ya kulonga, kwaviya wamuwona munhu ija yoyahonyigwe kema haja hamwe na Petili na Yohana. <verse eid="ACT 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 4:15" />Wawalongela walawe kunze ya ichitala, maabaho wandusa kuilongela wenyewo. <verse eid="ACT 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 4:16" />Waiuza, “Chiwatende choni wanhu wano?” Wawo wedika, “Chila munhu yokala Yelusalemu kovimanya uzauza dino dowatendile kumwawo, na cheye hachidaha bule kubela. <verse eid="ACT 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 4:17" />Mbali muladi mbuli ino sekeyenele mwa wanhu cholondeka chiwalemese waleke kulonga kaidi na munhu yoyose kwa zina da Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 4:18" />Ivo wawatanga kaidi muna ichiheleto na wawalongela kuwa sekewalonge kaidi wala sekewafundize kwa zina da Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 4:19" />Mbali Petili na Yohana wawedika, “Lamuleni mweye wenyewo kuwa dilihi dinogile kutenda kwa Mulungu, kumtegelezani mweye hebu kumtegeleza Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 4:20" />Kwaviya hachidaha bule kuleka kulonga mbuli ziya zochiziwone na kuzihulika.” <verse eid="ACT 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 4:21" />Wawo viwamalile kuwagoma kaidi, wawalekela na wawaleka wahite. Ikala vidala kuwatagusa kwaviya wanhu wose wakala womtunhiza Mulungu kwa yaja yalawilile. <verse eid="ACT 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 4:22" />Munhu ija yatendiligwe uzauza da kuhonyigwa miyaka yake ikala ifosa malongo mane.<verse eid="ACT 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wahuwila wotosa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 4:23" />Bahobaho Petili na Yohana viwalekeleligwe, wadibwelela bumbila jawo na wawalongela chiya chiwalongeligwe na wakulu wa nhambiko magogogo na walala. <verse eid="ACT 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 4:24" />Wahuwila viwahulike ivo, wose wailumba hamwe na kutosa kwa Mulungu, walonga, “Mkulu na mulumba wa ulanga na isi na bahali na vose viliumo! <verse eid="ACT 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 4:25" />Kulonga kwa Muhe Yelile kufosela wasaho yetu Daudi, msang'hani wako, viyalongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">‘Habali wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi wamema ludoko?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:25">Habali wanhu wopanga mipango ilibule fambulo?<verse eid="ACT 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 4:26" />Wafalume wa isi waisasala goya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">na walangulizi waiting'hana hamwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 4:26">wamuleme Mndewa na wamuleme Chilisito wake.’<verse eid="ACT 4:26" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 4:27" />Kwaviya kweli Helode na Pontio Pilato na wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi na wanhu wa Isilaeli waiting'hana muna dibululu dino kumduwila msang'hani wako Yelile Yesu, youmtendile kuwa Chilisito Mulopozi. <verse eid="ACT 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 4:28" />Waiting'hana muladi watende vinhu viya viuilungile na kupanga kulawa mwanduso kwa udaho wako na malondo yako. <verse eid="ACT 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 4:29" />Lelo Mndewa, kowona viwochitenda chidumbe, uchitogolele cheye wasang'hani wako chilonge usenga wako bila kudumba. <verse eid="ACT 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 4:30" />Golosa mkono wako uhonye, tenda vilaguso va mauzauza na mawewedeko kwa zina da msang'hani wako Yelile Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 4:31" />Viwakomeleze kutambika, hanhu hawaiting'hane hatingisika. Wose wamemezigwa Muhe Yelile na wandusa kugong'onda usenga wa Mulungu bila kudumba.<verse eid="ACT 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wahuwila wakala fana umwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 4:32" />Bumbila da wahuwila wakala na magesa yamwe na moyo umwe. Habule hata imwe yalongile chino cha miyangu hebu chino changu, mbali wose waigolela chila chinhu. <verse eid="ACT 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 4:33" />Watumigwa wagendelela kulonga kwa ludabwa mbuli ya kuzilibuka kwa Mndewa Yesu, nayo Mulungu kaweng'ha unovu wake. <verse eid="ACT 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 4:34" />Habule munhu yoyose muna dibumbila yoyahungukiligwe na chinhu. Wose wakalile na migunda hebu kaye wavichuuza, na wagala zihela kwa watumigwa, <verse eid="ACT 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 4:35" />weka magulu yawo ha watumigwa, nawo wazigola kwa chila munhu fana viilondeke<verse eid="ACT 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 4:36" />Yosefu, Mulawi yalawile Chipulo, watumigwa wamtanga Balinaba, fambulo jake, “Munhu yogela moyo,” <verse eid="ACT 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 4:37" />kachuuza mgunda wake, kasola zihela na kaweng'ha watumigwa.<verse eid="ACT 4:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="ACT 5" />
  <para style="s">Ananiya na Safila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 5:1" />Kukala na munhu imwe yatangigwe Ananiya na mke wake Safila. Nawo iviya wachuuza mgunda wawo. <verse eid="ACT 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 5:2" />Mbali Ananiya kabagula hela zimwenga kafisa, hela zisigale kazigala kwa watumigwa. Mke wake kaimanya mbuli iyo. <verse eid="ACT 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 5:3" />Petili kamulongela, “Ananiya, habali komulekela Lufyende yakulangulize na kukutenda umvwizile Muhe Yelile kwa kufisa hela zimwenga ziupatile kwa kuchuuza mgunda? <verse eid="ACT 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 5:4" />Umgunda viukalile ung'hali hunauchuuza, ukala wako, viukomeleze kuchuuza, zihela zikala zako. Lelo habali kulamula kutenda chinhu icho? Humvwizile munhu bule mbali kumvwizila Mulungu!” <verse eid="ACT 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 5:5" />Bahobaho Ananiya viyahulike ivo, kagwa hasi, kadanganika. Wanhu wose wowahulike mbuli iyo wadumba ng'hani. <verse eid="ACT 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 5:6" />Wabwanga weza, walufumba sanda lukuli lwake na walulava kunze, maabaho waluwanda.<verse eid="ACT 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 5:7" />Masaa matatu hamwande, mke wake kengila, havimanyile bule chinhu chilawilile. <verse eid="ACT 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 5:8" />Petili kamulongela, “Nilongele, zino izo hela zose zimpatile weye na mulume wako kwa kuchuuza mgunda?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:8">Nayo kedika, “Ona, ivo.”<verse eid="ACT 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 5:9" />Petili kamulongela, “Habali weye na mulume wako mulamula kumgeza Muhe wa Mndewa? Walume wowamuwandile mulume wako sambi wabahano hana ulwivi, nawo wezakusola na weye iviya!” <verse eid="ACT 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 5:10" />Bahobaho kagwa hasi hana yamagulu ya Petili na kadanganika. Wabwanga waja viwengile, wamuwona kadanganika, ivo wamulava kunze na wamuwanda habehi na mulume wake. <verse eid="ACT 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 5:11" />Bumbila da wahuwila wa Chilisito jose na wanhu wamwenga wose wowahulike mbuli izo wadumba ng'hani.<verse eid="ACT 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mauzauza na mawewedeko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 5:12" />Vilaguso va mauzauza vingi na mawewedeko vitendigwa na watumigwa kwa wanhu. Wahuwila wose waiting'hana muna Uluhelengo lwa Solomoni. <verse eid="ACT 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 5:13" />Wanhu wakala wowalonga vinogile, hata ivo habule munhu yoyose yeli kunze ya bumbila ijo yagezile kwingila muna dibumbila ijo. <verse eid="ACT 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 5:14" />Mbali wanhu wamuhuwile Mndewa wakala wokongezeka ng'hani, wake kwa walume. <verse eid="ACT 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 5:15" />Kwa ichimu cha mauzauza yoyatendigwe na watumigwa, wanhu wakala woweka watamu muna zinzila na kuwagoneza muna yamakomwa na muna yamalili muladi Petili yahafosa muhavu sisila jake diwadalise wamwenga. <verse eid="ACT 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 5:16" />Lung'husesa lwa wanhu weza kulawa kuna yamabululu yeli habehi na Yelusalemu, wawagala watamu na wanhu wowakalile na vinyamkela, nawo wawahonya wose.<verse eid="ACT 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Watumigwa wogazigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 5:17" />Maabaho mkulu wa nhambiko digogogo na wayage wakalile wa chibumbila cha Masadukayo wa hanhu haja, wawawonela migongo watumigwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 5:18" />Wawagwila watumigwa na waweka muna ichifungo. <verse eid="ACT 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 5:19" />Mbali ichilo msenga wa kuulanga wa Mndewa kavugula ulwivi lwa ichifungo, kawalava watumigwa kunze na kawalongela, <verse eid="ACT 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 5:20" />“Hiteni mkeme muna Ikaye ya Mulungu, mukawalongele wanhu wose mbuli ya ugima uno wa sambi.” <verse eid="ACT 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 5:21" />Watumigwa watogola, vikukunguzuke wengila muna Ikaye ya Mulungu na wandusa kufundiza.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:21">Mkulu wa nhambiko digogogo na wayage wawatanga hamwe wanhu wose wa ichitala na walangulizi wa Wayahudi, maabaho wawatuma wanhu muna ichifungo wawagale watumigwa waja. <verse eid="ACT 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 5:22" />Mbali wakulu viwafikile, hawawafikile bule wasang'hani muna ichifungo. Ivo wabwela kuna Ichitala na walonga, <verse eid="ACT 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 5:23" />“Vichifikile kuna ichifungo, chifika ulwivi luhindigwa na wakalizi wose wokaliza ulwivi. Mbali vichifungule ulwivi, hachifikile munhu yoyose mgati!” <verse eid="ACT 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 5:24" />Wakulu wa nhambiko magogogo na Mkulu wa wakalizi wa Kaye ya Mulungu viwahulike mbuli iyo wazanywa kwa chiya chiwalawilile watumigwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 5:25" />Maabaho munhu kengila mgati na kawalongela, “Tegelezeni! Wanhu womuwekile muna ichifungo wamuna Ikaye ya Mulungu wofundiza!” <verse eid="ACT 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 5:26" />Ivo mkulu wa wakalizi na wayage wahita na wawasola watumigwa. Hawasang'hanile ludabwa, kwaviya wadumba wanhu sekewawatowe na mabwe. <verse eid="ACT 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 5:27" />Wawagala watumigwa na wawemiza haulongozi ha ichitala, mkulu wa nhambiko kawauza,<verse eid="ACT 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 5:28" />“Chimulongelani sekemufundize kwa zina da munhu ino, mbali loleni chiya chimtendile! Mupwililisa mafundizo yenu Yelusalemu yose na molonda kulonga kuwa cheye chimtenda munhu ija yadanganike!” <verse eid="ACT 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 5:29" />Petili na waja watumigwa wamwenga wedika, “Cholondeka chimuhulike Mulungu, siyo wanhu. <verse eid="ACT 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 5:30" />Mulungu wa wasaho zetu kamzilibula Yesu, vimukomeleze kumkoma kwa kumuwamba munaumsalaba. <verse eid="ACT 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 5:31" />Mulungu kamwinula mbaka ubanzi wake wa kulume kuwa Mulangulizi na Mulopozi, kuwatenda wanhu wa Isilaeli wasamhe muladi Mulungu yawalekelele uhasanyi wawo. <verse eid="ACT 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 5:32" />Cheye ni wakalangama wa mbuli zino, cheye na Muhe Yelile, yeli chitumetume cha Mulungu kwa wanhu womuhulika.”<verse eid="ACT 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 5:33" />Wanhu wa ichitala viwahulike ivo, wehilwa ng'hani na walonda wawakome watumigwa. <verse eid="ACT 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 5:34" />Mbali imwe wawo, Mfalisayo yatangigwe Gamaliyeli, yoyakalile Mfundiza Malagilizo na kadumbigwa na wanhu wose, kema muna ichitala. Kawalongela watumigwa wekigwe kunze lusita luguhi. <verse eid="ACT 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 5:35" />Kawalongela wanhu wa ichitala, “Mweye Waisilaeli wayangu, muiteganye kwa chinhu chimuwatendela wanhu wano! <verse eid="ACT 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 5:36" />Umwaka chidogo kukala na munhu imwe zina jake Seuda, kalonga kuwa yeye ni mkulu, na walume magana mane wamsondelela. Mbali kakomigwa na wanhu wake wose wapwililika na bumbila jake jose dimala. <verse eid="ACT 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 5:37" />Maabaho Yuda wa Galilaya kalawilila chipindi cha kupeta wanhu, kalanguliza lung'husesa, mbali na yeye iviya kakomigwa, na wanhu wose wowamsomdelele wapwililika. <verse eid="ACT 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 5:38" />Lelo nowalongela muyepule na wanhu wano kwa kuwa mbuli ino hebu usang'hano uno wahawa ulawa kwa munhu wizabeneka, <verse eid="ACT 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 5:39" />mbali uhawa ulawa kwa Mulungu, mweye hamwizadaha bule kuwatenda wanhu wano waleke, iviya mwizakuwa momulema Mulungu!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 5:39">Wanhu wose wa ichitala wamtogola Gamaliyeli.<verse eid="ACT 5:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 5:40" />Wawatanga watumigwa mgati na wawalanha mibalati na kuwalongela sekewafundize kaidi kwa zina da Yesu, maabaho wawalekelela wahite. <verse eid="ACT 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 5:41" />Watumigwa viwasegele kuichitala wadeng'helela kwaviya wawona walondeka wapate chinyala kwa ichimu cha zina da Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 5:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 5:42" />Chila siku wagendelela kufundiza na kupeta Mbuli Inogile ya Yesu Chilisito Mulopozi muna Ikaye ya Mulungu na muna zikaye za wanhu.<verse eid="ACT 5:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="ACT 6" />
  <para style="s">Watazi saba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 6:1" />Hamwande, wanhu wowamuhuwile Yesu viwakalile wokongezeka, kulawilila kulongelela hagati ya Wayahudi wowolonga Chigiliki na waja wolonga Chiyebulaniya. Waja wolonga Chigiliki walongelela kwaviya wagane wawo wakala wozimizigwa chila siku muna ukugoleligwa ndiya. <verse eid="ACT 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 6:2" />Ivo waja watumigwa longo na waidi wawatanga bumbila jose da wanahina na wawalongela, “Havinogile bule cheye kuleka kupeta Mbuli Inogile ya Mulungu muladi chitende sang'hano ya kugola ndiya. <verse eid="ACT 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 6:3" />Ivo ndugu zetu, saguleni wanhu saba vimwili wowomanyika kuwa wamema Muhe Yelile na weli na ubala, na cheye chizaweng'ha sang'hano iyo. <verse eid="ACT 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 6:4" />Cheye wenyewo chizatosa lusita lose na kutenda sang'hano ya kupeta Mbuli ya Mulungu.”<verse eid="ACT 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 6:5" />Bumbila jose hamwe na watumigwa wamtogoza Mulungu. Ivo Wawasagula Sitefano, munhu yeli na uhuwilo na yamemile Muhe Yelile hamwe na Filipo, Polokolo na Nikanoli na Timona na Palimena na Nikolayo yoyalawile Antiyokiya na munhu yoyengile muna inzila ya kumsondelela Mulungu ya Chiyahudi. <verse eid="ACT 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 6:6" />Waweka haulongozi ha watumigwa, nawo wawatambikila na wawekila makono mchanyha yawo.<verse eid="ACT 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 6:7" />Ivo Mbuli ya Mulungu igendelela kupwililika. Wanahina wongezeka ng'hani uko Yelusalemu, na wakulu wa nhambiko wengi watogola uhuwilo.<verse eid="ACT 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sitefano kogwiligwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 6:8" />Mulungu kamulagusa unovu wake ng'hani Sitefano na kumwing'ha ludabwa, katenda mauzauza makulu na mawewedeko mgati mwa wanhu. <verse eid="ACT 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 6:9" />Maabaho wanhu wamwenga wowakalile wa sinagogi doditangigwa Mahulu na da Wachilene na da Waisikandaliya na wamwenga wawo wa Chilikiya na Asiya, wasegela wadahe kuibishila na Sitefano. <verse eid="ACT 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 6:10" />Mbali Muhe Yelile kamwing'ha Sitefano ubala viyakalile kolonga, hawadahile kuihasanya nayo. <verse eid="ACT 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 6:11" />Ivo wawasongeza wanhu wamwenga walonge, “Chimuhulika Sitefano kolonga mbuli za kuwaliga Musa na Mulungu.” <verse eid="ACT 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 6:12" />Kwa kutenda ivo, wawakong'hela wanhu na walala na wafundiza Malaglizo. Ivo wamgwila Sitefano na wamgala haulongozi ha ichitala. <verse eid="ACT 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 6:13" />Maabaho wawagala wakalangama wa uvwizi wowalongile, “Munhu ino haleka kulonga mbuli zihile kwa Ikaye ya Mulungu na Malagilizo ya Mulungu yoyamwing'hile Musa. <verse eid="ACT 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 6:14" />Chimuhulika kolonga kuwa Yesu ino wa Nazaleti kezabananga Ikaye ya Mulungu na kugalusa vihendo vose vochihokele kulawa kwa Musa!” <verse eid="ACT 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 6:15" />Wanhu wose wakalile muna ichitala wambunhulila meso Sitefano na wawona kuwa chihanga chake chilinga fana chihanga cha msenga wa kuulanga.<verse eid="ACT 6:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="ACT 7" />
  <para style="s">Sitefano kolonga na wanhu wa Ichitala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 7:1" />Mkulu wa nhambiko digogogo kamuuza Sitefano, “Vino Mbuli zino za kweli?”<verse eid="ACT 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 7:2" />Sitefano kedika, “Ndugu zangu na tati zangu, nitegelezeni! Wasaho yetu Bulahimu viyakalile yang'hali hanahita kukala Halani, Mulungu wa utunhizo kamulawila kuna isi ya Mesopotaniya, <verse eid="ACT 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 7:3" />kamulongela, ‘Leka kaye yako na isi yako. Hita kuna isi yondanikulaguse.’ ” <verse eid="ACT 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 7:4" />Ivo kaileka isi yake na kahita kukala kuna isi ya Halani. Tati yake Bulahimu viyadanganike, Mulungu kamulava muna isi ino imukala sambi. <verse eid="ACT 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 7:5" />Mulungu hamwing'hile Bulahimu hata hanhu hamwe muna isi ino hawe hake, hata ivo kamwing'ha uhadi wa kumwing'ha iisi ino iwe yake na welesi wake vikalile siku izo kakala kabule mwana. <verse eid="ACT 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 7:6" />Mulungu kamulongela, “Wanago wezagaligwa kuna isi yoitawaligwa na wanhu wamwenga, uko wezatendigwa watumwa na wezatendigwa vihile kwa miyaka magana mane.” <verse eid="ACT 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 7:7" />Mbali niye nizawatagusa wanhu wa isi yondaisang'hanile kuwatenda mweye watumwa. Maabaho nizawalava wanhu wa welesi wenu muna isi iyo nawo wezanitambikila niye hanhu hano. <verse eid="ACT 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 7:8" />Maabaho Mulungu kamwing'ha Bulahimu lagano da kwingiza ulungwana. Bulahimu kamwingiza ulungwana Isaka siku ya nane hamwande ha kuvumbuka kwake. Na Isaka iviya kamwingiza ulungwana mwanage Yakobo, na Yakobo kawatendela ivo ivo wasaho zetu longo na waidi.<verse eid="ACT 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 7:9" />Waja wasaho zetu wamuwonele migongo Yosefu, wamchuuza yawe mtumwa muna isi ya Misili. Mbali Mulungu kakala hamwe nayo, <verse eid="ACT 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 7:10" />Kamulava muna uzidilwa wake wose. Yosefu viyalawilile yang'hali kulawilila mfalume wa Misili, Mulungu kamwing'ha nzewele na ubala haulongozi ha mfalume wa Misili, nayo kamtenda yawe mtawala wa Misili na kaye yake yose. <verse eid="ACT 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 7:11" />Maabaho kulawilila nzala ng'hulu muna isi ya Misili na Kanani, iwatenda wanhu wazidilwe ng'hani. Wasaho zetu hawadahile bule kupata ndiya yoyose. <verse eid="ACT 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 7:12" />Ivo Yakobo viyahulike kuwa uko Misili kuna ndiya, kawatuma wanage na wasaho zetu wahite uko Misili kwa mwaza wa mwanduso. <verse eid="ACT 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 7:13" />Muna umwanza wekaidi Yosefu kawalongela ndugu zake, na mfalume wa Misili kawamanya ndugu zake. <verse eid="ACT 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 7:14" />Yosefu katuma wanhu kumtanga tatiyake Yakobo na ndugu zake wose kwiza kumwake, wanhu malongo saba na watano weze. <verse eid="ACT 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 7:15" />Ivo Yakobo kahita Misili, uko yeye na wasaho zetu wamwenga wadanganika, <verse eid="ACT 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 7:16" />Mitufi yawo igaligwa mbaka Shekemu, iwandigwa muna dileme diyagulile Bulahimu kulawa kabila da Hamoli kwa chiyasi fulani cha hela.<verse eid="ACT 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 7:17" />Lusita ulo vilufikile lwa Mulungu kufikiza lagano diyamwing'hile Bulahimu, lung'husesa lwa wanhu kuja Misili longezeka ng'hani. <verse eid="ACT 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 7:18" />Kuuhelelo mfalume hammanyile bule Yosefu kandusa kutawala uko Misili. <verse eid="ACT 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 7:19" />Kawatendela vihile wanhu wa isi yetu na kawawonela wasaho zetu, wawawangiliza waweke kunze wana wawo wadoododo wakomigwa. <verse eid="ACT 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 7:20" />Musa kelekigwa siku izo, mwana yanogile ng'hani. Kelekiligwa muna ikaye kwa miyezi mitatu, <verse eid="ACT 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 7:21" />viyalavigwe kunze ya kaye, mndele wa Falao kamsola, kamulela fana mwanage. <verse eid="ACT 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 7:22" />Musa kafundizigwa ubala wose wa Misili, kakala galu wa mbuli na sang'hano<verse eid="ACT 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 7:23" />Musa viyakalile na chimo cha miyaka malongo mane, Musa kalamula kuhita kuwalola ndugu zake Waisilaeli. <verse eid="ACT 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 7:24" />Kamuwona ndugu yake kotendigwa vihile na Mmisili, Musa kahita kumtaza na kumulihila ludoko kwa kumkoma Mmisili ija. <verse eid="ACT 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 7:25" />Kagesa kuwa wanhu wayage wahavimanyile kuwa Mulungu kamtuma yeye kuwakombola, mbali hawavimanyile bule.<verse eid="ACT 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 7:26" />“Siku isondelele kawawona Waisilaeli waidi woitowa, kalonda kuwatenda wakale kwa tindiwalo, kawalongela, ‘Mweye ni wandugu, habali molonda kuitenda vihile wenyewo?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 7:27" />Mbali munhu ija yakalile yomtenda vihile miyage kamsung'ha Musa, kalonga, ‘Vino yelihi yakwikile weye kuwa mtawala na mulamuzi wetu?’ <verse eid="ACT 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 7:28" />‘Kolonda kunikoma niye, fana viya viumkomile Mmisili igolo ifosile. <verse eid="ACT 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 7:29" />Musa viyahulike ivo kakimbila, kahita kukala muna isi ya Midiyani, uko kapata wana waidi.<verse eid="ACT 7:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 7:30" />“Viifosile miyaka malongo mane, msenga wa kuulanga kamulawilila Musa kuna imbago yoikalile yokwaka moto kuja kudibwilingu, habehi na lugongo lwa Sinayi. <verse eid="ACT 7:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 7:31" />Musa kazanywa kwa chiya chiyawone, kahita habehi na imbago muladi kulola goya. Mbali kahulika dizi da Mndewa, <verse eid="ACT 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 7:32" />‘Niye ni Mulungu wa tati zako, Mulungu wa Bulahimu, Isaka na Yakobo.’ Musa kagudema kwa kudumba na hagendelele kulola kaidi. <verse eid="ACT 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 7:33" />Mndewa kamulongela, ‘Vula vilatu vako kwaviya hanhu hano howimile hela. <verse eid="ACT 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 7:34" />Niyawona yehile yowatendiligwa wanhu wangu kuja Misili. Nihulika chililo chawo, na niye niza kuwatenda wailegehe. Ivo izo sambi, nizakutuma Misili.’<verse eid="ACT 7:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 7:35" />“Ino Musa iyo ija wanhu wa Isilaeli wamulemile, viwamulongele, ‘Vino yelihi yakwikile weye kuwa mtawala na mulamuzi wetu?’ Kufosela msenga wa kuulanga ija yoyamulawile Musa muna ichibago chochikalile chokwaka moto kudibwilingu, Mulungu kamtuma iyo Musa yawe mulangulizi na mkombola. <verse eid="ACT 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 7:36" />Kawalanguliza waja wanhu walawe Misili kwa kutenda mauzauza mengi, muna isi ya Misili muna Bahali ya Siliya na muna dibwilingu kwa lusita lwa miyaka malongo mane kudibwilingu. <verse eid="ACT 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 7:37" />Musa iyo yoyawalongele wanhu wa Isilaeli, ‘Mulungu kezamgalilani mulotezi fana niye kulawa muna iwandugu zenu.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 7:38" />Waisilaeli viwaiting'hane hamwe kuja kudibwilingu, Musa kakala uko hamwe na wasaho zetu na msenga wa kuulanga ija yoyalongile na bumbila kuja kuna ulugongo lwa Sinayi, iyo yoyeng'higwe mbuli za ugima yaching'he cheye.<verse eid="ACT 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 7:39" />“Mbali wasaho zetu walema kumuhulika, wamsung'ha kutali na wagesa kuwa wezabwela Misili. <verse eid="ACT 7:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 7:40" />Wamulongela Haluni, ‘Chitendele milungu yonda ichilongoze muna inzila, kwaviya hachimanyile bule chochimulawilile Musa, yoyachilavile Misili.’ <verse eid="ACT 7:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 7:41" />Ivo wasongola nyang'hiti ya dang'ang'a da ng'ombe, waitosela na kuchitendela chihendo chinhu chiwatendile kwa makono yawo wenyewo. <verse eid="ACT 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 7:42" />Lelo Mulungu kagalula kawaleka muladi watosele nhondo za kuulanga fana viyandikigwe muna ichitabu cha walotezi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">‘Mweye wanhu wa Isilaeli!</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">Si niye bule munilavile nhambiko na nhosa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:42">kwa miyaka malongo mane kuja kudibwilingu?<verse eid="ACT 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 7:43" />Mweye muchipape chizewe cha mulungu Moleki,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">na nyang'hiti ya nhondo ya mulungu wenu Lefani,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">nyang'hiti zimtendile izo zimtosela.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:43">Na ivo nizamtumani muhite kutali kufosa Babeli.’<verse eid="ACT 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 7:44" />“Ivo kuja kudibwilingu wasaho zetu wakala na zewe diya da ukalangama ditengenezigwa fana Mulungu viyamulongile Musa yaditende sisila ijo da iviya viyalagusigwe. <verse eid="ACT 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 7:45" />Maabaho wasaho zetu waihokela wenyewo kwa wenyewo mbaka chipindi cha Yoshuwa viyaisolile isi kulawa kwa manyambenyambe wawo Mulungu woyawekile haulongozi ha Wasaho zetu mbaka siku za Daudi. <verse eid="ACT 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 7:46" />Daudi kalondigwa na Mulungu, nayo Daudi kampula Mulungu yamuleke yamzengele kaye iyo Mulungu wa Yakobo. <verse eid="ACT 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 7:47" />Mbali Solomoni iyo yanzengele Mulungu kaye.<verse eid="ACT 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 7:48" />“Mbali Mulungu yeli Uchanyha Ng'hani hakala bule muna zikaye zozizengigwe na wanhu, fana mulotezi wa Mulungu viyolonga,<verse eid="ACT 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 7:49" />Mndewa kolonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">‘Ulanga ni chigoda cha chifalume changu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">na isi ni hanhu ha kwikila magulu yangu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 7:49">Mwizanizengela kaye ilingile vilihi?<verse eid="ACT 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 7:50" />Si niye mwenyewo bule yonivitendile vinhu vino vose?’ ”<verse eid="ACT 7:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 7:51" />Sitefano kagendelela kulonga, “Mweye muli na singo ndala! Magutwi na mizoyo yenu vilinga fana wanhu hawammanyile Mulungu, mweye fana wasaho zenu. Siku zose momulema Muhe Yelile! <verse eid="ACT 7:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 7:52" />Vino kuna mulotezi yoyose wa Mulungu ija wasaho zenu hawamgazile bule? Wawakoma wasenga wa Mulungu, waja umwaka wowalongile mbuli ya kwiza kwake mtumigwa yanogile haulongozi ha Mulungu. Na sambi mweye mumbiduka na mumkoma. <verse eid="ACT 7:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="ACT 7:53" />Mweye iyo muhokele lagilizo da Mulungu dodigaligwe kumwenu na wasenga wa kuulanga mbali hamtendile fana vodilonga.”<verse eid="ACT 7:53" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sitefano kotowigwa na mabwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="ACT 7:54" />Wakulu wa ichitala viwahulike ivo, wamuwonela migongo ng'hani Sitefano na wagegeda meno kwa ludoko. <verse eid="ACT 7:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="ACT 7:55" />Mbali Sitefano kuno kamema Muhe Yelile, kalola kuulanga kwa Mulungu, kawona utunhizo wa Mulungu na Yesu kema ubanzi wa kulume wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 7:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="ACT 7:56" />Kalonga, “Loleni! Nowona kuulanga kwa Mulungu kugubuka na Mwana wa Munhu kema ubanzi wa kulume wa Mulungu!”<verse eid="ACT 7:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="ACT 7:57" />Wanhu wose wakalile muna ichitala chiya wasita magutwi yawo na waguta. Maabaho wose wanzumhila, <verse eid="ACT 7:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="ACT 7:58" />wamulava kunze ya dibulu na wamtowa na mabwe. Wakalangama weka viwalo vawo muladi vikalizigwe na mbwanga imwe yatangigwa Sauli. <verse eid="ACT 7:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="ACT 7:59" />Wagendelela kumtowa na mabwe Sitefano, Sitefano katosa, “Mndewa Yesu uhokele Muhe wangu.”<figure style="fig" file="19 Being Stoned.jpg" size="col" ref="7:59">Munhu yotowigwa mabwe mbaka kudanganika</figure> <verse eid="ACT 7:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="ACT 7:60" />Katumbala mavindi na kulonga kwa dizi kulu, “Mndewa, wano sekeuwapetele uhasanyi uno.” Viyakomeleze kulonga ivo, kadanganika.<verse eid="ACT 7:60" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="ACT 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 8:1" />Sauli nayo kawona vinoga kukomigwa kwa Sitefano.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 8:1">Sauli kadigaza bumbila da wahuwila wa Chilisito</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 8:1">Siku diya, wahuwila wa Chilisito wose wa Chilisito weli Yelusalemu wandusa kugaya ng'hani. Wanhu wose wowamtogole Yesu wapwililikila isi ya Yudeya na Samaliya, ila watumigwa muhala wasigala. <verse eid="ACT 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 8:2" />Wanhu wamwenga wowomulonda Mulungu weza na wamuwanda Sitefano, na wamtendela nhula fuvu na walila ng'hani.<verse eid="ACT 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 8:3" />Mbali Sauli kandusa kudibananga bumbila da wahuwila wa Chilisito, kahita chila kaye, kawalava kunze wahuwila, wanaake na walume na kuwaguma muichifungo.<verse eid="ACT 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli Inogile yopetigwa uko Samaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 8:4" />Wahuwila wowapwililike, wapeta Mbuli Inogile chila hanhu howahitile. <verse eid="ACT 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 8:5" />Filipo kahita kuna dibululu da Samaliya na uko kawapetela wanhu mbuli ya Chilisito. <verse eid="ACT 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 8:6" />Wanhu waiting'hana kutegeleza vinogile usenga wa Filipo na kuwona mauzauza yaja yoyatendile Filipo, wose wahulika goya chiyakalile yolonga. <verse eid="ACT 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 8:7" />Vinyamkela wawalawa wanhu wengi kwa dizi kulu, na wanhu wengi wowaholole na mbetembete wahonyigwa. <verse eid="ACT 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 8:8" />Ivo kukala na deng'ho kulu muna dibululu diya.<verse eid="ACT 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 8:9" />Munhu imwe yoyatangigwe Saimoni kakala uko, yoyatendile uhawi muna isi iyo, na kawazanya wanhu wa bululu da Samaliya. Kalonga yeye ni munhu mkulu. <verse eid="ACT 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 8:10" />Wanhu wose, wenevale na ngayengaye wakala womtegeleza ng'hani na walonga, “Munhu ino ni ludabwa lwa Mulungu yoimanyika ‘ludabwa lukulu.’ ” <verse eid="ACT 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 8:11" />Wamtegeleza kwaviya lusita mwingi kakala kowazanya kwa uhawi wake. <verse eid="ACT 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 8:12" />Mbali wahuwila usenga wa Filipo woulonga Mbuli Inogile ya Ufalume wa Mulungu na zina da Yesu Chilisito wabatizigwa wanaake na walume. <verse eid="ACT 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 8:13" />Saimoni mwenyewo iviya kahuwila na hamwande kabatizigwa, kakala komkoleleza Filipo na kazanywa na mauzauza yoyatendigwe.<verse eid="ACT 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 8:14" />Watumigwa wakalile Yelusalemu, viwahulike kuwa wanhu wa Samaliya waihokela Mbuli inogile ya Mulungu, ivo wawatuma Petili na Yohana kumwawo. <verse eid="ACT 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 8:15" />Viwafikile wawatosela wahuwila wowamuhokele Muhe Yelile. <verse eid="ACT 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 8:16" />Kwaviya chipindi icho Muhe Yelile hakalile yowahumulukila yoyose viweli, wakala wabatizigwe kwa zina da Mndewa Yesu muhala. <verse eid="ACT 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 8:17" />Maabaho Petili na Yohana wawekila makono, nawo wahokela Muhe Yelile.<verse eid="ACT 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 8:18" />Saimoni viyawonile kuwa wanhu weng'higwa Muhe Yelile kwa kwikiligwa makono na watumigwa, kaweng'ha hela Petili na Yohana, <verse eid="ACT 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 8:19" />kawalongela, “Naniye ning'heni udaho muladi munhu yoyose yondanimwikile makono yangu yahokele Muhe Yelile.”<verse eid="ACT 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 8:20" />Mbali Petili kamwidika, “Weye na hela yako hita kuzimu kwaviya kogesa kuwa kodaha kugula chitumetume cha Mulungu kwa hela! <verse eid="ACT 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 8:21" />Kwabule chinhu chochose muna usang'hano wetu, kwaviya moyo wako haunogile haulongozi ha Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 8:22" />Samha magesa yako yehile, maabaho utambike kwa Mndewa, nayo kodaha kukulekelela kwa kuwa na magesa yano. <verse eid="ACT 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 8:23" />Kwaviya nokuwona kuna usungu na kwa muna ichifungo cha wihi.”<verse eid="ACT 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 8:24" />Saimoni kawalongela Petili na Yohana, “Nolamba, nitambikileni kwa Mndewa muladi yano yomuyalongile sekeyanilawilile.”<verse eid="ACT 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 8:25" />Viwakomeleze kuwalongela viwommanya Yesu na kupeta usenga wa Mndewa, Petili na Yohana wabwela Yelusalemu. Viwakalile wang'hali wobwela, wapeta Mbuli Inogile muna ivibululu ya Samaliya.<verse eid="ACT 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Filipo kombatiza mkulu wa Esiyopiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 8:26" />Msenga wa kuulanga wa Mndewa kamulongela Filipo, “Hita ubanzi wa hasi kuna inzila ya kudibwilingu yoihulumuka kulawa Yelusalemu kuhita Gaza.” <verse eid="ACT 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 8:27" />Ivo Filipo kaisasala goya na kandusa kuhita Gaza. Lusita ulo ulo kukala na mkulu imwe wa Esiyopiya, munhu iyo kakala yolawa Yelusalemu kutosa. <verse eid="ACT 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 8:28" />Viyakalile yang'hali kohita ukaye, kakala muna tololi dodibululigwa na vihongwe kosoma chitabu cha Isaya, mulotezi wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 8:29" />Muhe Yelile kamulongela Filipo, “Hita habehi na ditololi ijo na ukale habehi najo.” <verse eid="ACT 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 8:30" />Filipo kakwenhuka habehi ya ditololi ijo na kamuhulika munhu iyo kosoma chitabu cha Isaya, mulotezi wa Mulungu. Baho Filipo kamuuza, “Vino koyamanya yayo yousoma?”<verse eid="ACT 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 8:31" />Munhu iyo kedika, “Nizadahaze kuyamanya one munhu hanifambulile bule?” Kamulongela Filipo yakwele mchanya na kukala hamwe nayo. <verse eid="ACT 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 8:32" />Hanhu ha Yamaandiko Yelile yoyakalile yosoma hakala hano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">“Fana ng'hondolo yogaligwa kuchinjigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">fana mwanang'hondolo viyonyamala viyokanhigwa mazoya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:32">nayo halongile mbuli bule. <verse eid="ACT 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 8:33" />Kagumigwa chinyala na kawoniligwa</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">Habule munhu yodaha kulonga kusonhela welesi wake,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 8:33">Kwaviya ugima wake hano hana isi ufika kuuhelelo.”<verse eid="ACT 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 8:34" />Mkulu iyo kamuuza Filipo, “Nipulile, mulotezi ino wa Mulungu kolonga mbuli za yelihi? Kolonga zake mwenyewo hebu za munhu hebu iviya za imwenga?” <verse eid="ACT 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 8:35" />Maabaho Filipo kandusa kumulongela, kasang'hanila Yamaandiko Yelile yano, kampetela Mbuli Inogile ya Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 8:36" />Viwakalile wang'hali wogendelela muna inzila, wafika hanhu heli na mazi na munhu ija kalonga, “Vino hanhu hano hana chochose cha kumgoma sekenibatizigwe?”<figure style="fig" file="20 Baptism.jpg" size="col" ref="8:36">Munhu yobatizigwa</figure> <verse eid="ACT 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 8:37" />Filipo kalonga, “Wahahuwila kwa moyo wako wose kodaha kubatizigwa.” Nayo kalonga, “Nohuwila kuwa Yesu Chilisito ni Mwana wa Mulungu.” <verse eid="ACT 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 8:38" />Baho mkulu kadimiza diya ditololi na wose waidi wahulumuka muna yamazi, na Filipo kambatiza. <verse eid="ACT 8:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 8:39" />Viwakalile wolawa muna yamazi, Muhe wa Mndewa kamsola Filipo, na mkulu ija hamuwone kaidi mbali kagendelela na mwanza wake kuno kodeng'helela. <verse eid="ACT 8:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 8:40" />Filipo kalawilila uko Azoto na viyakalile kofosa kapeta Mbuli Inogile muna yamabululu yose mbaka kafika Kaisaliya.<verse eid="ACT 8:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="ACT 9" />
  <para style="s">Sauli kokomboligwa</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">Sang'hano 22:6-16</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 9:1" />Siku izo Sauli kaiyoha ng'hani kuwatenda wanahina wa Mndewa wadumbe kwa kuwakoma. Kahita kwa Mkulu wa Nhambiko. <verse eid="ACT 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 9:2" />Kapula yeng'higwe baluwa za utambuliso kuna zikaye za kutosela uko Damasiki muladi yahafika uko yawazahile walume na wanaake wowosondelela nzila ya Mndewa, yawagwile na yawagale Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 9:3" />Mbali viyakalile muna inzila habehi na kufika Damasiki, bahobaho bung'hulo kulawa kuulanga, dimmwemwesela kosekose. <verse eid="ACT 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 9:4" />Kagwa hasi na kuhulika dizi domulongela, “Sauli, Sauli! Habali konigaza?”<verse eid="ACT 9:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 9:5" />Sauli kauza, “Mndewa, weye kwa yelihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:5">Dizi diya dimwidika, “Niye ni Yesu younigaza!” <verse eid="ACT 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 9:6" />“Lelo inuka na wingile muna dibulu, uko kwizalongiligwa chiulondeka kutenda.”<verse eid="ACT 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 9:7" />Wanhu wakalile muna umwanza umwe na Sauli wema haja, wakala wabule da kulonga, wahulika dizi diya mbali munhu yoyalongile hawamuwone. <verse eid="ACT 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 9:8" />Sauli kenuka na viyagubule meso yake hadahile kulola chinhu chochose. Ivo wanhu waja wamulanguliza kwa kumwamha mkono mbaka Damasiki. <verse eid="ACT 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 9:9" />Sauli kakala siku nhatu bila kulola. Lusita ulo lose hadile chinhu wala kung'wa chochose bule.<verse eid="ACT 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 9:10" />Uko Damasiki kukala na mwanahina imwe, zina jake Ananiya. Mndewa kalonga nayo muna yamalaguso, “Ananiya!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:10">Ananiya kedika, “Ona, Mndewa.”<verse eid="ACT 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 9:11" />Mndewa kamulongela, “Isasale uhite kuinzila yoitangigwa Nzila Igoloke, na muna ikaye ya Yuda, mumzahile munhu yotangigwa Sauli kulawa Taliso. Sambi yang'hali kotosa.” <verse eid="ACT 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 9:12" />Muna yamalaguso kamuwona munhu zina jake Ananiya kengila muna ichiheleto na kumwikila makono muladi yapate kuwona kaidi.<verse eid="ACT 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 9:13" />Ananiya kamwidika, “Mndewa nihulika mbuli za munhu iyo kulawa kwa wanhu wengi. Nihulika mengi yehile yoyawatendele wanhu wako welile uko Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 9:14" />Nayo keza hano na udaho kulawa kwa wakulu wa nhambiko yawagwile wose wowokutosela.” <verse eid="ACT 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 9:15" />Mbali Mndewa kamulongela, “Weye hita kwaviya nimsagula yawe chia changu, yagong'onde zina jangu kwa wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi na wafalume na wanhu wa Isilaeli. <verse eid="ACT 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 9:16" />Niye mwenyewo nizamulagusa mengi yoymulonda yagazigwe kwa ichimu cha zina jangu.”<verse eid="ACT 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 9:17" />Ananiya kahita na kengila muna ikaye iyakalile Sauli na kamwikila makono. Kalonga, “Ndugu Sauli, Mndewa kanhuma, Yesu mwenyewo yoyakulawilile muna inzila. Kanhuma muladi upate kuwona kaidi na umemezigwe Muhe Yelile.” <verse eid="ACT 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 9:18" />Bahaja vinhu vilingile fana mabale vilagala kulawa muna yameso yake, nayo kadaha kuwona kaidi. Kenuka na kabatizigwa, <verse eid="ACT 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 9:19" />na viyakomeleze kuja, ludabwa lwake lumbwelela.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="ACT 9:19">Sauli kewapetela wanhu uko Damasiki</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 9:19">Sauli kakala siku ndodo hamwe na wanahina wa Yesu uko Damasiki. <verse eid="ACT 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 9:20" />Bahobaho kandusa kupeta muna zikaye za kutosela kuwa Yesu ni Mwana wa Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 9:21" />Wanhu wose wowamuhulike wazanywa na wamuuza, “Vino munhu ino siyo ija yoyakalile yowakoma wanhu wowamtosela Yesu kuja Yelusalemu? Vino hezile hano kwa lungilo da kuwagwila wanhu na kuwagala kwa wakulu wa nhambiko?”<verse eid="ACT 9:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 9:22" />Mbali Sauli kagendelela kupata ludabwa na kuweng'ha lugano Wayahudi wowokala Damasiki kwa kulagusa kuwa Yesu ni Chilisito.<verse eid="ACT 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 9:23" />Vizifosile siku nyingi, Wayahudi waiting'hana hamwe na wapanga mipango ya kumkoma Sauli, <verse eid="ACT 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 9:24" />mbali Sauli kaihulika mbuli iyo. Ichilo na imisi wamkaliza muna inzila ya kwingilila muna dibululu muladi wamkome. <verse eid="ACT 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 9:25" />Mbali ichilo wanahina wake wamsola, wamuhulumusa muna ichigelo kufosela muna dizonzo dodikalile muna ing'huta.<verse eid="ACT 9:25" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sauli uko Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 9:26" />Sauli viyafikile Yelusalemu, kageza kuilumba na wanahina, mbali wakala wamdumba kwaviya hawatogolile kuwa yeye ni mwanahina. <verse eid="ACT 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 9:27" />Mbali Balinaba kamsola Sauli na kamgala kwa watumigwa. Kawalongela watumigwa viya Sauli viyamuwonile Mndewa muna umwanza wake na kuwa Mndewa kalonga nayo, na viyapetile zina da Yesu bila kudumba kuja Damasiki. <verse eid="ACT 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 9:28" />Sauli kakala hamwe nawo na wahita wose Yelusalemu yose, kapeta mbuli ya Mndewa bila kudumba. <verse eid="ACT 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 9:29" />Kapeta na kuilonga na Wayahudi wowolonga Chigiliki, mbali nawo wageza kumkoma. <verse eid="ACT 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 9:30" />Ndugu viwamanyile imbuli iyo wamsola Sauli mbaka Kaisaliya na wangala Taso. <verse eid="ACT 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 9:31" />Ivo wahuwila wa Chilisto wakala na tindiwalo muna isi yose ya Yudeya na Galilaya na Samaliya. Kwa nhazo ya Muhe Yelile wapata ludabwa lwa kongezeka peta yawo viwagendelele kumuhulika Mndewa.<verse eid="ACT 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Eneya kohonyigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 9:32" />Petili viyakalile kohita chila hanhu, kafika kwa wanhu welile wowokala Lida. <verse eid="ACT 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 9:33" />Uko kamfika munhu imwe yatangigwe Eneya, yagonile mudilili kwa miyaka minane kwa utamu wa kuholola. <verse eid="ACT 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 9:34" />Petili kamulongela, “Eneya, Yesu Chilisito kokuhonya. Inuka, sola lili jako.” Bahobaho Eneya kenuka. <verse eid="ACT 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 9:35" />Wanhu wose wowakalile Lida na Shaloni wamuwona Eneya, nawo wambwelela Mndewa.<verse eid="ACT 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 9:36" />Uko Yopa kukala na mwanahina wa chike yatangigwe Tabita, kwa Chigiliki Dolikasi, fambulo jake “Mtalati” mwanamke iyo kakala kotenda yanogile siku zose na kawataza ngayengaye. <verse eid="ACT 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 9:37" />Muna zisiku izo kaugula na kadanganika. Wasunha lukuli lwake na wawika muna ichiheleto cha kuchanyha. <verse eid="ACT 9:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 9:38" />Lida si hatali ng'hani na Yopa, ivo wanahina viwahulike Petili kauko, wawatuma wanhu waidi kumwake, na wamulamba, “Izo kumwetu himahima” <verse eid="ACT 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 9:39" />Petili kahita nawo, na viyafikila wamgala muna ichiheleto cha kuchanyha, Wagane wose wanzunguluka Petili wolila na kumulagusa makoti na viwalo viyasonile Dolikasi viyakalile yang'hali mgima. <verse eid="ACT 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 9:40" />Petili kawalava wose kunze, maabaho katumbala mavindi na katosa kaluhindukila lukuli lwa mwanamke ija yadanganike, kalonga, “Tabita, inuke!” Maye kabenzula meso yake na viyamuwonile Petili, kenuka na kukala hasi, <verse eid="ACT 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 9:41" />Petili kamwamha na kamwinula. Maabaho kawatanga wanhu welile hamwe na waja iwagane, kamuleka muna yamakono yawo ka mgima. <verse eid="ACT 9:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 9:42" />Mbuli ino imanyika muna yamabululu ya Yopa, na wanhu wengi wamuhuwila Mndewa. <verse eid="ACT 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 9:43" />Petili kakala uko Yopa siku nyingi na munhu imwe yotangigwa Saimoni, munhu yosang'hana mbende.<verse eid="ACT 9:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="ACT 10" />
  <para style="s">Petili na Kolineliyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 10:1" />Uko Kaisaliya kukala na munhu imwe yatangigwe Kolineliyo, mkulu wa wawalangulizi wa chibumbila chimwe cha Walumi chitangigwe “Chibumbila cha wakalizi cha Italiya.” <verse eid="ACT 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 10:2" />Kakala munhu yakalile kondumba Mulungu, yeye na wanhu wa ukaye yake wakala wamtosela Mulungu. Iviya kawataza ng'hani Wanhu weli ngayengaye na kutambika kwa Mulungu siku zose. <verse eid="ACT 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 10:3" />Ikala saa kenda imisi viyawonile malaguso funhu funhu, kamuwona msenga wa kuulanga wa Mulungu komwizila na kamtanga, “Kolineliyo!”<verse eid="ACT 10:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 10:4" />Kolineliyo kamulola msenga wa kuulanga kwa kudumba na kalonga, “Mwenevale, chino choni?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:4">Msenga iyo kedika, “Mulungu kanogeligwa na nhosa yako na sang'hano zako kwa ngayengaye, nayo kezakwidika. <verse eid="ACT 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 10:5" />Sambi watume wanhu uko Yopa wakamtange munhu yotangigwa Saimoni, zina jake dimwenga Petili. <verse eid="ACT 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 10:6" />Kokala muna ikaye ya Saimoni yosang'hana mbende, yoyokala habehi na bahali.” <verse eid="ACT 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 10:7" />Maabaho msenga wa kuulanga iyo kasegela, na Kolineliyo kawatanga wasang'hani wake waidi na mkalizi, mkalizi iyo niija yakalile yondumba Mulungu nayoyokwaminika mwa iwaja wowomsang'hanila. <verse eid="ACT 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 10:8" />Kawalongela yose yoyamulawile na kawatuma Yopa.<verse eid="ACT 10:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 10:9" />Siku isondelele, saa sita imisi wanhu waja viwakalile muna inzila habehi na kufika Yopa, Petili kakwela kuchisuwili muladi yatose. <verse eid="ACT 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 10:10" />Kawona nzala na kalonda ndiya yaje, na ndiya viikalile yosasaligwa kawona malaguso. <verse eid="ACT 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 10:11" />Kawona kuulanga kwa Mulungu kugubuligwa na chinhu fana golole kulu dohumulusigwa muna isi kwa banzi zose nne. <verse eid="ACT 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 10:12" />Mgati ya digolole kukala na chila modeli ya wanyama wose weli na magulu mane, na wowotambala hasi na videge va kuulanga. <verse eid="ACT 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 10:13" />Kahulika dizi domulongela, “Petili, Inuka, uchinje wano na uwaje!”<verse eid="ACT 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 10:14" />Petili kalonga, “Aka, Mndewa! Sinakuja chinhu chochose chambule mwiko hebu hachinasafyigwa.”<verse eid="ACT 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 10:15" />Dizi dimulongela kaidi, “Sekeulonge chinhu chisafyigwe na Mulungu kuwa chambula mwiko.” <verse eid="ACT 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 10:16" />Mbuli iyo ilawilila miyanza mitatu, maabaho golole diya dibwelezigwa kuulanga kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 10:17" />Petili yang'hali kazaganyika na malaguso yano yana fambulo jaki, wanhu waja watumigwe kwa Kolineliyo wafika kuna ikaye ya Saimoni koyakalile, nawo wema kunze ya ulwivi, <verse eid="ACT 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 10:18" />watanga kwa dizi kulu na wauza, “Hano hano mgeni yotangigwa Saimoni Petili?”<verse eid="ACT 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 10:19" />Saimoni yang'hali kokwazanywa na malaguso yayo fambulo jake choni, Muhe Yelile kamulongela, “Petili, hano hana wanhu watatu wokuzahila weye. <verse eid="ACT 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 10:20" />Ivo isasale na uhulumuke, sekeudumbe kuhita nawo kwaviya niwatuma niye.” <verse eid="ACT 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 10:21" />Petili kahumuluka na kawalongela wanhu wawo, “Munhu yomunzahila iyo niye. Habali mwiza?”<verse eid="ACT 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 10:22" />Wamwidika, “Cholawa kwa Kolineliyo, mkulu wa wakalizi, munhu yomdumba Mulungu na kalondigwa na Wayahudi wose. Msenga wa kuulanga wa Mndewa kamulongela yakutange weye ukaye yake muladi yahulike chochose cha kulonga choulinacho.” <verse eid="ACT 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 10:23" />Maabaho Petili kawalongela wanhu wawo wengile muna ikaye muladi wagone kwa siku dimwe</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 10:23">Siku isondelele Petili kaisasala kamala na kandusa kuhita hamwe nawo, na wandugu wengi kulawa Yopa wahita naye. <verse eid="ACT 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 10:24" />Siku de kaidi Petili kafika Kaisaliya, Kolineliyo kakala kowagozela uko, hamwe na ndugu zake na mambwiya zake wa habehi woyawagoneke. <verse eid="ACT 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 10:25" />Petili viyakalile kokwingila muna ikaye, Kolineliyo kalawa kunze kumuhokela, kamtumbalila mavindi na kumwinamina. <verse eid="ACT 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 10:26" />Mbali Petili kamwinula, “Inuka,” kamulongela, “Niye mwenyewo namunhu fana weye.” <verse eid="ACT 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 10:27" />Petili kagendelela kulonga na Kolineliyo viwakalile wokwingila muna ikaye, umo kawafika wanhu wengi waiting'hana hamwe. <verse eid="ACT 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 10:28" />Kawalongela, “Mweye wenyewo movimanya kuwa Muyahudi kalemigwa na malagilizo ya dini yake kukala na munhu yeli siyo Muyahudi hebu kumulaula. Mbali Mulungu kanilagusa sekenimtange munhu yoyose hasafyigwe hebu kambula mwiko. <verse eid="ACT 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 10:29" />Ivo vimunitangile silemile kwiza bule. Lelo nomuuzani, Munitangila choni?”<verse eid="ACT 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 10:30" />Kolineliyo kedika, “Siku mane yafosile saa kenda imisi, nikala muna ikaye yangu notosa. Bahaja munhu yayawale viwalo vizelu chwe kema haulongozi hangu, <verse eid="ACT 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 10:31" />kalonga, ‘Kolineliyo, Mulungu kahulika nhosa zako na hazimiza bule sang'hano yako ya kuwataza ngayengaye. <verse eid="ACT 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 10:32" />Lelo watume wanhu wahite Yopa kumtanga Saimoni zina dimwenga Petili, kokala muna ikaye ya Saimoni yosang'hana mbende, yoyokala habehi na bahali.’ <verse eid="ACT 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 10:33" />Ivo bahaja niwatuma wanhu kumwako, na weye kutenda vinogile kwiza. Lelo cheye wose chabahano haulongozi ha Mulungu, chogozela kuhulika chinhu chochose chiulagilizigwe na Mndewa uchilongele.”<verse eid="ACT 10:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbuli za Petili</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 10:34" />Maabaho Petili kandusa kulonga, “Lelo novimanya kuwa kweli Mulungu habagula. <verse eid="ACT 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 10:35" />Mbali kowatogola wanhu wowomtosela yeye na wowosang'hana yanogile haulongozi hake bila kulola lukolo. <verse eid="ACT 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 10:36" />Mweye movimanya usenga uyatumile Mulungu kwa wanhu wa Isilaeli, kupeta Mbuli Inogile ya tindiwalo kufosela Yesu Chilisito, yeli Mndewa wa wose. <verse eid="ACT 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 10:37" />Mweye movimanya chochiwalawilile muna isi yose ya Yudeya, kwandusila Galilaya Yohana viyakomeleze kuwapetela wanhu na kubatiza. <verse eid="ACT 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 10:38" />Movimanya mbuli za Yesu wa Nazaleti na viya Mulungu viyangidile Muhe Yelile na ludabwa. Kahita chila hanhu, katenda yanogile na kawahonya wanhu wose wakalile wolangulizigwa na Mwihi kwaviya Mulungu kakala nayo. <verse eid="ACT 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 10:39" />Cheye cha wakalangama wa chila chinhu chiyatendile mwa Wayahudi na Yelusalemu. Wamkoma kwa kumuwamba mumsalaba. <verse eid="ACT 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 10:40" />Mbali siku nhatu hamwande ya ifa yake, Mulungu kanzilibuka, na kamtenda yawoneke, <verse eid="ACT 10:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 10:41" />mbali hawoneke na chila munhu, ila kwa waja wakalangama wowasaguligwe na Mulungu, kwa cheye chidile na kung'wa hamwe nayo hamwande ha kuzilibuka kwake. <verse eid="ACT 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 10:42" />Kachilagiliza chiwapetele wanhu Mbuli Inogile na kuwalongela kuwa yeye iyo yasaguligwe na Mulungu yawe mulangulizi wa iwagima na wadanganike. <verse eid="ACT 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 10:43" />Walotezi wose wa Mulungu walonga mbuli zake, walonga kuwa wose wowomuhuwila iyo wezalekeleligwa uhasanyi wawo kwa kufosela udaho wa zina jake.”<verse eid="ACT 10:43" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi wohokela Muhe Yelile</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 10:44" />Petili viyakalile yang'hali kolonga, Muhe Yelile kawahulumukila wanhu wose wowakalile wotegeleza usenga wake. <verse eid="ACT 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 10:45" />Wahuwila wa Chiyahudi wowengizigwe ulungwana wowezile na Petili kulawa Yopa wazanywa kwaviya Mulungu viyawagidile chitumetume chake cha Muhe Yelile wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 10:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 10:46" />Kwaviya wawahulika wolonga ulonzi umwenga na wamtogoza Mulungu. Maabaho Petili kalonga, <verse eid="ACT 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 10:47" />“Wanhu wano wahokela Muhe Yelile fana vichihokele cheye. Vino munhu yoyose kodaha kuwalemesa sekewabatizigwe na mazi?” <verse eid="ACT 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 10:48" />Ivo kawalagiliza wabatizigwe kwa zina da Yesu Chilisito. Maabaho wamulamba yakale nawo kwa siku ndodo.<verse eid="ACT 10:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="ACT 11" />
  <para style="s">Petili kogala usenga kwa wahuwila wa Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 11:1" />Watumigwa na wahuwila wamwenga kulawa Yudeya wahulika kuwa wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi nawo iviya waihokela Mbuli ya Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 11:2" />Ivo Petili viyahitile Yelusalemu, wanhu wowamuhuwile Yesu wowengizigwe ulungwana wamulonga, <verse eid="ACT 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 11:3" />walonga, “Weye kwingila muna zikaye za wanhu hawengizigwe ulungwana na kuja nawo!” <verse eid="ACT 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 11:4" />Baho Petili kandusa kuwalongela ugaluga chila chinhu chilawilile kulawa mwanduso.<verse eid="ACT 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 11:5" />“Nikala muna dibululu da Yopa notosa baho niwona malaguso, niwona chinhu fana golole kulu dohumulusigwa hasi kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu banzi zake zose nne, maabaho diza haja hanikalile <verse eid="ACT 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 11:6" />Nilola mgati, niwona wanyama weli muna isi, weli na magulu mane na wanyama wa mmbago na wanyama wowotambala na videge va kuulanga. <verse eid="ACT 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 11:7" />Maabaho nihulika dizi donilongela, ‘Petili, inuka, uwachinje uwaje!’ <verse eid="ACT 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 11:8" />Niye nidika, ‘Aka, Mndewa! Habule chinhu chochose hachitogoleka hebu chambule mwiko chochingile muna umulomo wangu.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 11:9" />Dizi dilonga kaidi kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu, ‘Chinhu chochose choyachisafyile Mulungu sekeuchitange chambula mwiko,’ <verse eid="ACT 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 11:10" />Mbuli iyo ilawilila miyanza mitatu, kuuhelelo digolole dibwelezigwa kuulanga kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 11:11" />“Wanhu watatu wowatumigwe kumwangu kulawa Kaisaliya wafika muna ikaye yonikalile nokala. <verse eid="ACT 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 11:12" />Muhe kanilongela nihite nawo bila kudumba. Wahuwila wano sita kulawa Yopa wanisondelela niye mbaka Kaisaliya, na wose chingila muna ikaye ya Kolineliyo. <verse eid="ACT 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 11:13" />Kachilongela viya viyamuwonile msenga wa kuulanga yemile muna ikaye, yoyamulongele, ‘Tuma wanhu wamwenga wahite Yopa kwa Saimoni Petili. <verse eid="ACT 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 11:14" />Kezamulongelani mbuli zondazimkombole yeye na lukolo lwako lwose.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 11:15" />Na viyanduse kulonga, Muhe Yelile kamuhulumukila fana viyachihumulukile cheye baho mwanduso. <verse eid="ACT 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 11:16" />Maabaho nikumbuka chiya chiyalongile Mndewa, ‘Yohana kabatiza kwa mazi, mbali mweye mwizabatizigwa kwa Muhe Yelile.’ <verse eid="ACT 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 11:17" />Ivo fana Mulungu kaweng'ha wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi chitume tume fana chiyaching'hile cheye, wochimtogole Mndewa Yesu Chilisito, lelo niye nayelihi mbaka nigeze kumulemesa Mulungu?”<verse eid="ACT 11:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 11:18" />Viwahulike ivo wanyamala na wamtunhiza Mulungu, walonga, “Maabaho Mulungu iviya kaweng'ha wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi nyafasi ya kusamha muladi wawe na ugima!”<verse eid="ACT 11:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wahuwila weli Antiyokiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 11:19" />Wahuwila wamwenga wa Mndewa wapwililika kwa ichimu cha manhesa yoyanduse kulawalila lusita Sitefano viyadanganike. Wamwenga wahita Foinike na Chipulo na Antiyokiya, wopeta usenga uja kwa Wayahudi muhala. <verse eid="ACT 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 11:20" />Mbali wahuwila wamwenga wowalawile Chipulo na Chilene wahita Antiyokiya, na wandusa kulonga na wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi na kupeta Mbuli Inogile ya Mndewa Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 11:21" />Ludabwa lwa Mndewa lukala hamwe nawo, na wanhu wengi wahuwila na wambwelela Mndewa.<verse eid="ACT 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 11:22" />Mbuli izo zihulikika na bumbila da wahuwila wa Chilisto da Yelusalemu, ivo wamtuma Balinaba yahite Antiyokiya. <verse eid="ACT 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 11:23" />Viyafikile na kuwona unovu wa Mulungu kwa wanhu, kadeng'helela na kawalamba wagendelele kumuhuwila Mndewa kwa mizoyo yawo yose. <verse eid="ACT 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 11:24" />Balinaba kakala munhu yanogile, kamema Muhe Yelile na uhuwilo, na wanhu wengi wambwelela Mndewa.<verse eid="ACT 11:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 11:25" />Maabaho Balinaba kahita Taso kumzahila Sauli. <verse eid="ACT 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 11:26" />Viyamfikile, kamgala Antiyokiya, na kwa mwaka mgima Balinaba na Sauli waiting'hana na wahuwila na wawafundiza wanhu wengi. Wanahina watangigwa wahuwila wa Chilisito kwa mwanduso uko Antiyokiya.<verse eid="ACT 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 11:27" />Siku ziya walotezi wengi wa Mulungu weza Antiyokiya kulawa Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 11:28" />Imwe wawo yatangigwe Agabu kema, kalonga kwa udaho wa Muhe Yelile kuwa izalawilila nzala ng'hulu muna isi yose. Na nzala iyo ilawilila muna zisiku za mtawala Chilaudiyo. <verse eid="ACT 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 11:29" />Wanahina walamula kuwa chila munhu fana viyodaha yagale chinhu chochose muladi kuwataza wahuwila wayawe wowokala Yudeya. <verse eid="ACT 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 11:30" />Watenda vino, wawatuma Balinaba na Sauli wagale hela kwa walala wa bumbila da wahuwila.<verse eid="ACT 11:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="ACT 12" />
  <para style="s">Manhesa mengi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 12:1" />Siku ziya mfalume Helode kawagwila wahuwila wamwenga wa bumbila da wahuwila wa Chilisito, na kawagaza. <verse eid="ACT 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 12:2" />Kawalongela wakalizi wamkome kwa panga Yakobo ndugu yake Yohana. <verse eid="ACT 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 12:3" />Viyawonile Wayahudi wanogeligwa na chiya chiyatendile, kagendelela na kahita kumgwila Petili. Yano yalawilila muna zisiku za Didugila da Magate hayanagumigwa Lusu. <verse eid="ACT 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 12:4" />Viyakomeleze kumgwila Petili kamwika mchifungo, muna yamakono ya mabumbila mane ya wakalizi wane wane. Helode kalonda Pasaka ihamala yamulekelele haulongozi ha wanhu. <verse eid="ACT 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 12:5" />Petili viyakalile yang'hali mchifungo, wahuwila wamtosela kwa Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Petili kolekeleligwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 12:6" />Ichilo chiya Helode yang'hali hanamulava Petili kunze haulongozi ha wanhu, Petili kakala kagona hagati ha wakalizi waidi, kazingilizigwa minyololo midi na wakala wokaliza ulwivi lwa ichifungo. <verse eid="ACT 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 12:7" />Bahobaho, msenga wa kuulanga wa Mndewa kalawila, bung'hulo dimwemwesa muna ichiheleto chiya. Msenga wa kuulanga iyo kamtowa Petili mulubavu na kamulamsa. Kalonga, “Hima! Inuka!” Na baho minyololo iwamzingilize muna yamakono ilagala. <verse eid="ACT 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 12:8" />Maabaho msenga wa kuulanga ija kamulongela, “Iyawale viwalo vako na vilatu vako.” Petili katenda ivo. Maabaho kamulongela, “Iyawale koti jako na unisondelele.” <verse eid="ACT 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 12:9" />Petili kamsondelela kunze ya ichifungo, mbali havimanyile bule yoyatendigwe na msenga wa kuulanga yakala yolawilila kweli, ila kagesa kawona malaguso. <verse eid="ACT 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 12:10" />Wafosa chituwo cha mwanduso cha wakalizi na che kaidi, maabaho wafika muna ulwivi lwa zuma lwa kwingilila muna dibululu. Lwivi luwafungukila lwenyewo, nawo walawa kunze. Viwakalile wang'hali wohita muna inzila imwe, bahaja msenga wa kuulanga iyo kamuleka Petili.<verse eid="ACT 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 12:11" />Petili viyavimanyile chochimulawilile, kalonga, “Lelo novimanya kweli kuwa Mndewa kamtuma msenga wake wa kuulanga yanilave muna yamakono ya Helode na kulawa chila chinhu chowachilolele Wayahudi chitendeke.” <verse eid="ACT 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 12:12" />Viyakalile kogesa ivo, kahita kuna ikaye ya Maliya, mami yake Yohana, zina jake dimwenga Maliki. Uko wanhu wengi waiting'hana na kutosa. <verse eid="ACT 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 12:13" />Petili kahodiza ulwivi lwa kunze, na msang'hani yotangigwa Loda keza kumwidika. <verse eid="ACT 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 12:14" />Nayo viyamanyile dizi da Petili, kadeng'helelela ng'hani mbaka kakimbila bila kuvugula ulwivi na kawalongela wanhu kuwa Petili kema kunze ya ulwivi. <verse eid="ACT 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 12:15" />Wamulongela, “Kuna lukwale.” Mbali yeye kakanhamiza kulonga kuwa ikala ivo. Walonga, “Iyo ni msenga wa kuulanga wake!”<verse eid="ACT 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 12:16" />Petili kagendelela kuhodiza na viwavugule na kumuwona, wazanywa. <verse eid="ACT 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 12:17" />Petii kawapungila mkono wanyamale, kawalongela Mndewa viyamulavile muna ichifungo. Maabaho kawalongela wagale mbuli iyo kwa Yakobo na waja wahuwila wamwenga, maabaho kasegela kahita hanhu hamwenga.<verse eid="ACT 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 12:18" />Viifikile imitondo, wakalizi wengilwa na mkangagile kwa chiya chimulawilile Petili. <verse eid="ACT 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 12:19" />Helode kalagiliza wamzahile, mbali hawamuwonile bule. Ivo kawauza waja iwakalizi na kalagiliza wakomigwe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 12:19">Maabaho Helode kasegela Yudeya kahita Kaisaliya, kakala uko lusita ludodo.<verse eid="ACT 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ifa ya Helode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 12:20" />Helodi kawehila ng'hani wanhu wa Tilo na Sidoni, ivo wahita hamwe kumulola. Teng'hu watenda umbwiya na Balasito, yakalile msang'hani yokwaminika muna ikaye ya mfalume muladi yawataze. Maabaho wahita kwa Helode na wampula kuwe na tindiwalo, kwaviya zisi zawo zihuwila isi ya mfalume kupata ndiya.<verse eid="ACT 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 12:21" />Muna isiku yoisaguligwe Helode kayawala viwalo vake va chifalume na kakala muna ichigoda chake cha ufalume, kawalongela wanhu. <verse eid="ACT 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 12:22" />Wanhu walandula madizi, “Dino siyo dizi da munhu, mbali da imwe wa milungu!” <verse eid="ACT 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 12:23" />Bahobaho msenga wa kuulanga wa Mndewa kamgwisa hasi Helode kwaviya hamtunhize Mulungu. Kadigwa na sango na kadanganika.<verse eid="ACT 12:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 12:24" />Mbuli ya Mulungu igendelela na kwenela.<verse eid="ACT 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 12:25" />Balinaba na Sauli viwakomeleze usang'hano wawo, wabwela kulawa Yelusalemu, wamsola Yohana yoyatangigwe Maliki.<verse eid="ACT 12:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="ACT 13" />
  <para style="s">Balinaba na Sauli wosaguligwa na kutumigwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 13:1" />Mgati mwa bumbila da wahuwila wa Chilisito da Antiyokiya kukala na walotezi wa Mulungu na wafundiza, nawo wakala Balinaba, na Saimoni yoyatangigwe Mtitu, na Lukiyo yolawila Chilene, na Sauli, na Manaeni yoyaleligwe na Helode. <verse eid="ACT 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 13:2" />Viwakalile wotosa kwa Mndewa na kufunga kuja, Muhe Yelile kawalongela, “Nibagulileni Balinaba na Sauli kwa ichimu cha sang'hano iniwatangile.”<verse eid="ACT 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 13:3" />Viwakomeleze kufunga na kutosa, wawekila makono na kawaleka wahita.<verse eid="ACT 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uko Chipulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 13:4" />Balinaba na Sauli wagaligwa na Muhe Yelile, wahulumukila Seleukiya, na kulawa uko wengila muna ingalawa mbaka Chipulo. <verse eid="ACT 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 13:5" />Viwafikile Salami, wapeta Mbuli ya Mulungu muna zikaye za kutosela za Wayahudi. Yohana Maliki kakala mtazi wawo.<verse eid="ACT 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 13:6" />Wahita visiwa vose va Pafo, uko wamfika Muyahudi imwe muhawi, mulotezi wa uvwizi yotangigwa Bali Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 13:7" />Munhu iyo kakala mbwiya wa Seligiyo Paulo, mkulu wa ichisiwa, munhu yeli na luti. Seligiyo Paulo kawatanga Balinaba na Sauli wahite kumwake kwaviya kalonda yahulike Mbuli ya Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 13:8" />Mbali iyo imuhawi Bali Yesu, zina jake dimwenga Elima, kalonda yamtende imkulu ija wa ichisiwa yaleke kuhuwila na kaisosokanya nawo. <verse eid="ACT 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 13:9" />Mbali Sauli, zina jake dimwenga Paulo, kuno kamema Muhe Yelile, kambunhulila yameso Elima, <verse eid="ACT 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 13:10" />kalonga, “Weye mwana wa Mwihi! Weye ni mwihi wa chila chinhu chinogile. Kumema uvwizi na ubozi wose, na siku zose huleka bule kuuzeha ukweli wa Mndewa! <verse eid="ACT 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 13:11" />Sambi mkono wa Mndewa wizakwamha, na weye kwizakuwa chipofu na hwizawona bung'hulo da zuwa kwa lusita ludodo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:11">Bahobaho kungugu na ziza vimwizila, na kahita uko na uko kolonda munhu wa kumwamha mkono yamulangulize. <verse eid="ACT 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 13:12" />Mkulu wa ichisiwa viyawonile yaja yalawilile, kahuwila kwaviya kazanywa kwa mafundizo ya mbuli za Mndewa.<verse eid="ACT 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Antiyokiya yili uko Pisidiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 13:13" />Paulo na wayage wang'ola ingalawa kulawa Pafo mbaka Pelige, bululu da Pamfiliya. Uko Yohana Maliki kawaleka, kabwela Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 13:14" />Wagendelela na umwanza kulawa Pelige kuhita Antiyokiya yili uko Pisidiya. Muna Isiku ya Mhumulo wengila mwiikaye ya kutosela na wakala hasi. <verse eid="ACT 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 13:15" />Chitabu cha Malagilizo ya Mulungu yoyamwing'hile Musa na ichitabu cha walotezi wa Mulungu havisomigwa, wakulu wa kaye ya kutosela ya Mulungu watuma usenga, “Wandugu, one muhawa na mbuli ya kuwalongela wanhu wano, walongeleni.” <verse eid="ACT 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 13:16" />Paulo kenuka kenula mkono wake na kandusa kulonga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:16">“Mweye Waisilaeli wayangu na mweye wanhu womumtosela Mulungu! Nitegelezeni!” <verse eid="ACT 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 13:17" />Mulungu wa wanhu wano wa Isilaeli kawasagula wasaho zetu, kuwatemela mate wanhu wawo baho hawakalile wageni muna isi ya Misili, na kwa udaho wake mkulu kawalava muna isi iyo <verse eid="ACT 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 13:18" />na kwa miyaka malongo mane kawafunyila umoyo kudibwilingu. <verse eid="ACT 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 13:19" />Kayabananga makabila saba muna isi ya Kanani na kaweng'ha wanhu wake isi ija iwe yawo. <verse eid="ACT 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 13:20" />Yano yose yakala kwa miyaka magana mane na malongo matano.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 13:20">“Hamwande, Mulungu kaweng'ha walotezi wa Mulungu mbaka muna zisiku za mulotezi wa Mulungu Samweli. <verse eid="ACT 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 13:21" />Maabaho wanhu viwapulile wawe na mfalume, Mulungu kaweng'ha Sauli, mwana wa Kishi wa kabila da Benjamini yawe mfalume wawo kwa chipindi cha miyaka malongo mane. <verse eid="ACT 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 13:22" />Mulungu viyamulavile Sauli, kamtenda Daudi yawe mfalume wawo. Mulungu kalonga mbuli ya Daudi, ‘Nimuwona Daudi, mwana wa Yese, munhu yaunogele umoyo wangu. Yeye kezatenda chila chinhu chonimulonda yachitende.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 13:23" />Kulawa muna welesi wa Daudi, Mulungu kawagalila wanhu wa Isilaeli Mulopozi Yesu, fana viyalongile. <verse eid="ACT 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 13:24" />Yang'hali Yesu hanakwandusa sang'hano yake, Yohana kawapetela wanhu wose wa Isilaeli waleke uhasanyi wawo na wabatizigwe. <verse eid="ACT 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 13:25" />Nayo Yohana viyakalile kokomeleza usang'hano wake, kawalongela wanhu, ‘Mweye mwogesa niye nayelihi? Si niye bule imumgoza. Mbali imwe kokwiza kuchisogo changu, iyo niye sifaya bule hata kwiinama na kufungula nzabi za vilatu vake.’<verse eid="ACT 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 13:26" />“Waisilaeli wayangu, welesi wa Bulahimu, na mweye wanhu wose muli siyo Wayahudi womumtosela Mulungu, mbuli ino ya ulopozi igaligwa kumwetu. <verse eid="ACT 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 13:27" />Wanhu wa Yelusalemu na walangulizi wawo hawavimanyile kuwa Yesu kakala yelihi, na hawavimanyile mbuli za walotezi zowosoma chila Isiku ya Mhumulo. Ivo wamtagusa Yesu fana walotezi viwalongile. <verse eid="ACT 13:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 13:28" />Ingawa hawapatile chimu cha kumtagusa ifa, wamulamba Pilato yamkome. <verse eid="ACT 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 13:29" />Viwakomeleze kutenda chiya chandikigwe muna Yamaandiko Yelile kwa ichimu chake, wamuhulumusa kulawa muna umsalaba na wamwika muna dileme. <verse eid="ACT 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 13:30" />Mbali Mulungu kamzilibula, <verse eid="ACT 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 13:31" />na kwa siku nyingi kakala kowoneka na waja woyengile nawo kulawa Galilaya kuhita Yelusalemu. Wawo sambi ni wakalangama wake kwa wanhu wa Isilaeli. <verse eid="ACT 13:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 13:32" />Na cheye chowapetela Mbuli Inogile, mbuli ija Mulungu iyailagane na wasaho zetu. <verse eid="ACT 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 13:33" />Mulungu kaifikizila kumwetu cheye, iwana wawo chilagano icho kwa kumzilibula Yesu, fana viyandikikwe muna Izabuli yekaidi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:33">‘Weye iyo mwanangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:33">Diyelo niwa Tati yako.’<verse eid="ACT 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 13:34" />Mulungu kamzilibula na hamulekile lukuli lwake luwole muna dileme, Mulungu kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:34">‘Nizakwing'ha balaka zelile na za kweli zoniilagane na Daudi.’ <verse eid="ACT 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 13:35" />Na hanhu hamwenga muna ichitabu cha Zabuli kalonga</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:35">‘Whizamuleka mtumigwa wako Yelile yawole muna dileme.’<verse eid="ACT 13:35" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 13:36" />Kwaviya Daudi viyakomeleze kumsang'hanila Mulungu muna ugima wake, kadanganika na kawandigwa hamwe na wasaho zake, lukuli lwake luwola. <verse eid="ACT 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 13:37" />Mbali Mulungu kamzilibula Yesu, na lukuli lwake haluwolile bule.<verse eid="ACT 13:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 13:38" />“Ivo ndugu zangu nolonda muvimanye kuwa kufosela Yesu, mbuli ya kulekeleligwa uhasanyi yopetigwa kumwenu, <verse eid="ACT 13:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 13:39" />na chila munhu yomuhuwila Yesu kotendigwa yabagule vinhu vose vovimtenda yaleke kuwoneka kanoga haulongozi ha Mulungu kufosela Malagilizo ya Mulungu yoyamwing'hile Musa. <verse eid="ACT 13:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 13:40" />Lelo muiteganye sekemwize kupatigwa na yaja yalongigwe na walotezi wa Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 13:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 13:41" />“ ‘Tegelezeni mweye muli wazeha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">sang'haneni mwage.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">Kwaviya chinitenda sambi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">muna lusita lwenu ni chinhu chili hachihuwila,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:41">hata fana munhu yahawalongela.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 13:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 13:42" />Paulo na Balinaba viwakalile wolawa muna ikaye ya kumpulila Mulungu, wanhu wawalamba weze kulonga kaidi mbuli zino muna Isiku ya Mhumulo imwenga <verse eid="ACT 13:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 13:43" />Mting'hano uwo viumalile, Wayahudi wengi na wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi wowakalile wosondelkela nzila ya kumsondelela Mulungu ya Chiyahudi wawasondelela Paulo na Balinaba. Watumigwa wawo walonga nawo, wawaguma moyo wagendelele kukala muna unovu wa Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 13:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 13:44" />Isiku ya Mhumulo iwinzile, wanhu wose muna dibululu diya weza kutegeleza mbuli ya Mndewa. <verse eid="ACT 13:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="ACT 13:45" />Mbali Wayahudi viwawonile mting'hano, wawona migongo, wailema mbuli ilongigwe na Paulo na wamuliga, <verse eid="ACT 13:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="ACT 13:46" />Mbali Paulo na Balinaba wawedika bila kuwawonela chinyala, “Chilondeka chimulongeleni mweye teng'hu Mbuli ya Mulungu. Mbali kwaviya moilema na kuwona kuwa hamufaya bule kwa ugima wa siku zose. Lelo chomulekani mweye na kuwagalila wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 13:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="ACT 13:47" />Kwaviya Mndewa kachilagiliza vino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">Nikutenda uwe bung'hulo da wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 13:47">muladi wanhu wa isi yose wadahe kukomboligwa.”<verse eid="ACT 13:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="ACT 13:48" />Wanhu siyo Wayahudi viwahulike mbuli iyo wadeng'helela wautogola usenga wa Mndewa, waja wakalile wasaguligwe kupata ugima wa siku zose, wawa na uhuwilo.<verse eid="ACT 13:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="ACT 13:49" />Mbuli ya Mndewa yenela chila hanhu mwiisi ija. <verse eid="ACT 13:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="ACT 13:50" />Mbali Wayahudi wawatenda walume wakalile wolanguliza bululu na walangulizi wa wanaake siyo Wayahudi wowakalile womdumba Mulungu wawakong'hela Paulo na Balinaba na wawawinga kunze ya bululu ijo. <verse eid="ACT 13:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="ACT 13:51" />Watumigwa wakung'huna timbwisi dikalile muna imigulu yawo fana lamulo. Maabaho wahita Ikoniya. <verse eid="ACT 13:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="ACT 13:52" />Mbali wahuwila weli Antiyokiya wakala wamema deng'ho na Muhe Yelile.<verse eid="ACT 13:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="ACT 14" />
  <para style="s">Uko Ikoniya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 14:1" />Uko Ikoniya mbuli zikala fana vizikalile kuja Antiokiya, Paulo na Balinaba wahita muna zikaye za kutosela za Wayahudi walonga kwa ugangamalo mbaka Wayahudi wengi na wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi wahuwila. <verse eid="ACT 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 14:2" />Mbali Wayahudi weli hawahuwila wawasongeza wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi wawaleme wanhu wohuwila. <verse eid="ACT 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 14:3" />Paulo na Balinaba wakala lusita mwingi, walonga kwa ugangamalo mbuli ya Mndewa, iyo kalagusa kuwa usenga wa unovu wa Mulungu ukala kweli kwa kuweng'ha ludabwa lwa kutenda mauzauza na mawewedeko. <verse eid="ACT 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 14:4" />Wanhu wa isi ija waibagula, wamwenga wakala ubanzi wa Wayahudi na wamwenga ubanzi wa watumigwa.<verse eid="ACT 14:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 14:5" />Maabaho wanhu wamwenga weli siyo Wayahudi na Wayahudi, hamwe na walangulizi wawo, wailungila kuwatendela vihile watumigwa na kuwatowa na mabwe. <verse eid="ACT 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 14:6" />Watumigwa viwaimanyile mbuli iyo wakimbilila Lisitila na Delibe, isi ya Lukaniya na muna zisi zili habehi. <verse eid="ACT 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 14:7" />Uko wagendelela kupeta Mbuli Inogile.<verse eid="ACT 14:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo na Balinaba uko Lusitila na Delibe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 14:8" />Uko Lisitila kukala na munhu imwe yakalile mbetembete kwandusila kwelekigwa kwake na hadahile kugenda. <verse eid="ACT 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 14:9" />Kamtegeleza Paulo viyakalile yolonga, Paulo kamuwona kana uhuwilo wa kuhonyigwa, ivo kambunhulila yameso <verse eid="ACT 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 14:10" />na kamulandulila dizi, “Ima kwa magulu yako!” Bahaja munhu ija kazumha na kandusa kugenda. <verse eid="ACT 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 14:11" />Lung'husesa lwa wanhu viwawonile chiyatendile Paulo, wandusa kulandula madizi yawo kwa ulonzi wa Chilukoniya, “Milungu iza kumwetu muna ivihanga fana va wanhu!” <verse eid="ACT 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 14:12" />Balinaba katangigwa Zeu, na Paulo kwaviya yeye iyo yakalile mulangulizi wa kulonga katangigwa Helime, <verse eid="ACT 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 14:13" />mkulu wa nhambiko wa imwe wa milungu yatangigwe Zeu, kaye yake ya kutosela ikala kunze mwa dibululu, kagala ng'ombe na maluwa kuna ulwivi lwa bululu kwaviya yeye na mting'hano walonda walave nhosa kwa watumigwa.<verse eid="ACT 14:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 14:14" />Mbali watumigwa Paulo na Balinaba viwahulike ivo, wavidega viwalo vawo na wakimbila muna ulung'husesa lwa wanhu na waguta nyangi, <verse eid="ACT 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 14:15" />“Habali motenda ivo? Cheye iviya cha wanhu fana mweye. Chongalilani Mbuli Inogile muladi muleke mbuli zili si chinhu na mumuhindukile Mulungu yeli na ugima, yalumbile ulanga na isi na bahali na vinhu vose vili muno. <verse eid="ACT 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 14:16" />Umwaka Mulungu kawalekela wanhu wose watende viwolonda. <verse eid="ACT 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 14:17" />Kalagusa kuwa kabahano kwa yanogile yoyatendile viyatendile, kaweng'ha mvula kulawa kuulanga na mavuno kwa lusita lwake, kaweng'ha ndiya nyingi na kuwadeng'heleza mizoyo yenu.” <verse eid="ACT 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 14:18" />Ingawa watumigwa walonga ivo, ikala vidala kuwalemesa wanhu waleke kuwatambikila wawo.<verse eid="ACT 14:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 14:19" />Wayahudi wamwenga kulawa Antiyokiya na Ikoniya wawatenda wanhu wamtende vihile Paulo, wamtowa na mabwe na wambulula mbaka kunze ya dibululu, wagesa kadanganika. <verse eid="ACT 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 14:20" />Mbali wanahina viwamzunguluke, kenuka na kabwela kaidi muna dibulu. Siku isondelele yeye na Balinaba wahita Delibe.<verse eid="ACT 14:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kubwela Antiyokiya yili uko Siliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 14:21" />Paulo na Balinaba wapeta Mbuli Inogile uko Delibe na wapata wanahina wengi. Maabaho wabwela Lisitila na Ikoniya na Antiyokiya. <verse eid="ACT 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 14:22" />Wawagangamiza wanahina mizoyo yawo wa mabululu yayo na wawalamba wakale muna uhuwilo. Wawafundiza, “Cholondeka chifosele muna yamanhesa mengi muladi kwingila muna Ufalume wa Mulungu.” <verse eid="ACT 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 14:23" />Paulo na Balinaba viwakomeleze kuwasagulila walala muna chila bumbila da wahuwila wa Chilisito na kutambika hamwe na kufunga waweka muna yamakono ya Mndewa wowamuhuwile. <verse eid="ACT 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 14:24" />Maabaho Paulo na Balinaba wahita kufosela muna iisi ya Pisidiya, wafika Pamfiliya. <verse eid="ACT 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 14:25" />Kuja Pelige wapeta Mbuli Inogile na maabaho wahita Ataliya.<verse eid="ACT 14:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 14:26" />Kulawa Ataliya, wengila muna ingalawa, wabwela Antiyokiya. Hanhu howapuliligwe unovu wa Mulungu kwa sang'hano ija yowaikomeleze sambi. <verse eid="ACT 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 14:27" />Viwafikile Antiyokiya, waiting'hana hamwe na wanhu wa bumbila wa wahuwila wa Chilisito, wawalongela vinhu vose viyatendile Mulungu hamwe nawo, na viyawavugulile ulwivi lwa uhuwilo wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 14:28" />Na wakala uko kwa lusita mwingi hamwe na wanahina.<verse eid="ACT 14:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="ACT 15" />
  <para style="s">Mting'hano uko Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 15:1" />Wanhu wamwenga weza Antiyokiya kulawa Yudeya na wandusa kuwafundiza wahuwila, “One hamwingile ulungwana fana Malagilizo ya Mulungu yoyamwing'hile Musa viyolonga, hamudaha bule kulopoligwa.” <verse eid="ACT 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 15:2" />Mbuli ino iwatenda Paulo na Balinaba waihasanye nawo. Ivo Paulo na Balinaba wasaguligwa hamwe na wahuwila wamwenga wa Antiyokiya wahite Yelusalemu kuwalola watumigwa na walala kwa ichimu cha mbuli iyo.<verse eid="ACT 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 15:3" />Wagaligwa na wahuwila, na viwakalile wohita kufosela Foinike na Samaliya, wawalongela mbuli za kukomboligwa kwa wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi. Mbuli ino iwadeng'heleza ng'hani wahuwila wose. <verse eid="ACT 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 15:4" />Viwafikile Yelusalemu wahokiligwa na wanhu wohuwila na watumigwa na walala, nawo wawalongela yose Mulungu yoyatendile kufosela wawo. <verse eid="ACT 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 15:5" />Mbali wanhu wamwenga wahuwile kulawa muna dibumbila da Mafalisayo wema na walonga, “Wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi wolondeka wamhe Malagilizo ya Mulungu yoyamwing'hile Musa.”<verse eid="ACT 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 15:6" />Watumigwa na walala waiting'hana hamwe muladi walonganye mbuza iyo. <verse eid="ACT 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 15:7" />Viwakomeleze kulonganya, Petili kema na kalonga, “Ndugu zangu, movimanya kuwa umwaka Mulungu kanisagula kumwenu niwapetele Mbuli Inogile wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi, muladi wahulike na wahuwile. <verse eid="ACT 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 15:8" />Mulungu yomanya magesa ya chila munhu kalagusa kuwa kawatogola wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi kwa kuweng'ha Muhe Yelile fana viya viyachitendele cheye. <verse eid="ACT 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 15:9" />Hatendile ubagulo wowose hagati yetu cheye na wawo, kawalekelela uhasanyi wawo kwaviya wamuhuwila. <verse eid="ACT 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 15:10" />Lelo habali sambi momgeza Mulungu kwa kuwatwika mbahasha zizamile wanhu waja womuhuwila Yesu, mbahasha ziya cheye wala wasaho zetu hachidaha kwinula? <verse eid="ACT 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 15:11" />Bule! Chohuwila na kukomboligwa kwa unovu wa Mndewa Yesu, fana viya viweli wawo.”<verse eid="ACT 15:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 15:12" />Bumbila jose dikala hupi dowategeleza Balinaba na Paulo viwosimulila mauzauza na mawewedeko yoyatendile Mulungu kwa wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi kufosela wawo. <verse eid="ACT 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 15:13" />Viwakomeleze kulonga, Yakobo kandusa kulonga, “Ndugu zangu nitegelezeni! <verse eid="ACT 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 15:14" />Saimoni kachilongela viya Mulungu viyawatendele wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi baho mwanduso, kawasagula wamwenga wawo wawe wanhu wake. <verse eid="ACT 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 15:15" />Mbuli zino zilinga fana mbuli za walotezi wa Mulungu, fana Maandiko Yelile viyolonga.<verse eid="ACT 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 15:16" />“Mndewa kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">‘Zihamala mbuli zino nizabwela</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">na nizazenga kaidi ufalume wa Daudi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">Nizazenga kaidi mahame yake</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:16">na nizaugangamiza kaidi.<verse eid="ACT 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 15:17" />Na ivo wanhu wose wasigale wamzahile Mndewa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 15:17">wanhu wose weli siyo Wayahudi woniwatangile wawe wangu.<verse eid="ACT 15:17" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 15:18" />Ivo viyalongile Mndewa, yatendile mbuli ino imanyike kulawa umwaka.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 15:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 15:19" />Yakobo kagendelela kulonga, “Lelo niye nolamula vino, chileke kuwagaza wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi wowamuhindukile Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 15:20" />Mbali chiwagalile baluwa kuwalongela sekewaje ndiya zambule mwiko kwa kutambikila nyang'hiti za milungu, wayepule na uashelati na sekewaje ng'onyo jojose dibobotoligwe na sekewang'we damu. <verse eid="ACT 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 15:21" />Kwaviya kulawa umwaka Malagilizo ya Mulungu yoyamwing'hile Musa yakala yosomigwa muna zikaye za kutosela chila Isiku ya Mhumulo, na mbuli zake zipetigwa chila bululu.”<verse eid="ACT 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Usenga kwa wahuwila weli siyo Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 15:22" />Maabaho watumigwa na walala hamwe na wahuwila wose, walamula kusagula wanhu mgati mmwawo wa kuwagala Antiyokiya hamwe na Paulo na Balinaba. Wawasagula Yuda yatangigwe Balisaba na Sila. Wawo wakala walangulizi mgati mwa wahuwila. <verse eid="ACT 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 15:23" />Watuma usenga uno,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 15:23">“Ndugu zetu wose muli siyo Wayahudi womukala Antiyokiya na Siliya na Chilikiya, cheye watumigwa na walala ndugu zenu, chomulamsani. <verse eid="ACT 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 15:24" />Kwaviya chihulika kuwa wanhu wengi walawile kumwetu wawagaza kwa kuyagiza mizoyo yenu kwa mbuli zawo, mbali hachiwatumile bule. <verse eid="ACT 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 15:25" />Ivo chose chiitogolela kuwasagula wanhu wamwenga na kuwatuma kumwenu hamwe na mambwiya zetu Balinaba na Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 15:26" />Wawo waulava ugima wawo kwa ichimu cha zina da Mndewa wetu Yesu Chilisito. <verse eid="ACT 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 15:27" />Lelo chiwatuma Yuda na Sila kumwenu. Wawo wezalonga wenyewo chiya chochiwandikile. <verse eid="ACT 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 15:28" />Chiwona vinoga kwa Muhe Yelile na kwa cheye chileke kumtwikani mbahasha zizamile kufosa yano yomulondeka kuyamanya. <verse eid="ACT 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 15:29" />Lelo muyepule na vinhu vitambikiligwe nyang'hiti. Sekemuje damu, sekemuje nyama zifidigwe na sekemutende uashelati. Muhayepula na yayo motenda yanogile.”<verse eid="ACT 15:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 15:30" />Ivo waileka na wahita Antiyokiya, uko wawatanga wahuwila wose na waweng'ha usenga uwo. <verse eid="ACT 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 15:31" />Wanhu viwasomile usenga uwo, wadeng'helela ng'hani kwaviya usenga uja uwaguma moyo. <verse eid="ACT 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 15:32" />Maabaho Yuda na Sila kwaviya wawo wenyewo wakala walotezi wa Mulungu, walonga mengi kuwaguma moyo na kuweng'ha nguvu wahuwila. <verse eid="ACT 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 15:33" />Viwakomeleze kukala uko, wanhu wowahuwile wa Antiokiya wawalaga, wawalondela tindiwalo, maabaho wabwela Yelusalemu kwa waja wakalile wawatumile. <verse eid="ACT 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 15:34" />Mbali Sila kawona vinoga kukala uko. <verse eid="ACT 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 15:35" />Paulo na Balinaba wasigala uko Antiyokiya, wawo na wanhu wamwenga wengi wafundiza na wapeta Mbuli Inogile ya Mndewa.<verse eid="ACT 15:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo na Balinaba woigola</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 15:36" />Vizifosile siku nyingi, Paulo kamulongela Balinaba, “Haya chibwele kuchisogo chikawalaule wanhu wohuwila muna yamabululu yose yochipetile Mbuli Inogile ya Mndewa na kulola viwogendelela.” <verse eid="ACT 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 15:37" />Balinaba kalonda kumsola Yohana yotangigwa Maliki wahite nayo, <verse eid="ACT 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 15:38" />mbali Paulo hagesile kuwa vinoga kumsola Yohana, kwaviya halondile kukala nawo mbaka uhelelo wa sang'hano yawo, mbali Yohana kabwela na kawaleka Pamfiliya. <verse eid="ACT 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 15:39" />Maabaho waihasanya ng'hani mbaka waigola. Balinaba kamsola Maliki wahita Chipulo. <verse eid="ACT 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 15:40" />Mbali Paulo kamsagula Sila na wahuwila wa hanhu baho viwakomeleze kumwika muna unovu wa Mndewa, kasegela. <verse eid="ACT 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 15:41" />Kafosela Siliya na Chilikiya, kuwaguma moyo wahuwila.<verse eid="ACT 15:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="ACT 16" />
  <para style="s">Timoseyo koilumba na Paulo na Sila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 16:1" />Paulo kafika Delibe na Lisitila, uko kukala na munhu imwe yomuhuwila Yesu. Munhu iyo katangigwa Timoseyo. Mami yake kakala Muyahudi yoyamuhuwile Mndewa, mbali tati yake kakala siyo Muyahudi. <verse eid="ACT 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 16:2" />Wahuwila wose wa Lisitila na Ikoniya wamulongela yanogile Timoseyo. <verse eid="ACT 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 16:3" />Paulo kalonda yamsole Timoseyo yahite nayo, ivo kamwingiza ulungwana kwaviya Wayahudi wakalile isi ija wavimanya kuwa tati yake Timoseyo kakala Mgiliki. <verse eid="ACT 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 16:4" />Na viwakalile wang'hali wofosa muna yamabululu, waweng'ha wanhu waja malagilizo yoyalavigwe na watumigwa na walala wa Yelusalemu, wawalongela wayamhe. <verse eid="ACT 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 16:5" />Ivo wahuwila wongezeka kuwa na nguvu muna uhuwilo na wanhu wongezeka chila siku.<verse eid="ACT 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malaguso ya Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 16:6" />Wafosa muna isi ya Filigiya na Galatiya kwaviya Muhe Yelile kawalemesa sekewapete usenga muna zisi za Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 16:7" />Viwafikile hana imhaka na Misiya, walonda wahite Bisiniya, mbali Muhe wa Yesu kawalemesa. <verse eid="ACT 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 16:8" />Wafosela Misiya, wahulumukila Tulowa, <verse eid="ACT 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 16:9" />Chilo chiya Paulo kawona malaguso ya munhu wa Makedoniya kema, kamulamba, kalonga, “Izo Mekodoniya uchitaze!” <verse eid="ACT 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 16:10" />Paulo viyakomeleze kuwona malaguso, baho chiisasala kuhita Makedoniya, kwaviya chiwona kuwa Mulungu kachitanga chikawapetele Mbuli Inogile wanhu wa uko.<verse eid="ACT 16:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Lidiya kokomboka uko Filipi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 16:11" />Kulawa Tulowa chikwela ngalawa mbaka Sametilake, siku diwinzile chifika Neapoli. <verse eid="ACT 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 16:12" />Kulawa uko chihita isi ya Filipi, bululu kulu dili muna isi ya Makedoniya, hanhu heli na mtawala wa Chilumi. Chikala muna dibululu dino kwa siku nyingi. <verse eid="ACT 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 16:13" />Muna Isiku ya Mhumulo chilawa kunze ya dibululu na chihita kuna ulwanda, hanhu haja chigesa hana hanhu ha Wayahudi kuiting'hana hamwe kutosa. Chikala hasi na chilonga na wanaake wowaiting'hane haja. <verse eid="ACT 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 16:14" />Mgati mwa iwaja wowachihulike kukala na mwanamke imwe yomdumba Mulungu. Zina jake Lidiya, mwanamke iyo kolawa muna dibululu da Siyatila. Iyo kakala kochuuza viwalo vidung'hu va hela nyingi. Mndewa kafungula moyo wake na kahokela yaja yoyalongile Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 16:15" />Yeye na wanhu wa kaye yake viwakomeleze kubatizigwa kachilamba chihite ukaye yake, kalonga, “One muniwona niye nomuhuwila Mndewa, izoni mukale ukaye yangu.” Na kachilamba ng'hani chihite.<verse eid="ACT 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo na Sila wokwikigwa muna ichifungo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 16:16" />Siku dimwe vichikalile chohita hanhu ha nhambiko, mndele imwe yakalile na chinyamkela wa kulagula kaiting'hana na cheye. Kakala kawapatila wenevale wake hela nyingi kwa ulaguzi wake. <verse eid="ACT 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 16:17" />Kamuinza Paulo na cheye kuno koguta nyangi, “Wanhu wano ni wasang'hani wa Mulungu mkulu yeli uchanyha! Womulongelani viya vondamukomboligwe!” <verse eid="ACT 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 16:18" />Katenda ivo kwa siku nyingi mbali Paulo havilondile, kamuhindukila na kamulongela iyo, “Kwa zina da Yesu Chilisito, nokulongela mulawe munhu ino!” Bahobaho chinyamkela kamulawa munhu ija.<verse eid="ACT 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 16:19" />Wenevale wa mndele ija viwawonile lolelo da kupata sente dimala, wawagwila Paulo na Sila na wawabulula mbaka waugulila vinhu haulongozi ha iwakulu. <verse eid="ACT 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 16:20" />Wawagala haulongozi ha wakulu wa Chilumi na walonga, “Wanhu wano ni Wayahudi na wotenda ndwagi muna dibululu jetu. <verse eid="ACT 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 16:21" />Wofundiza vihendo vawo viya havilondeka na malagilizo yetu, cheye ni wakaya wa Loma na hachidaha bule kutogola vihendo vino.”<verse eid="ACT 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 16:22" />Lung'husesa lwa wanhu wailumba na kuwalema Paulo na Sila.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 16:22">Maabaho wakulu wawahambula iviwalo Paulo na Sila, na walagiliza walanhigwe mibalati. <verse eid="ACT 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 16:23" />Viwakomeleze kuwalanha wawaguma muna ichifungo, mkalizi wa chifungo kalagiliza wakalizigwe ng'hani. <verse eid="ACT 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 16:24" />Nayo viyapatile malagilizo yayo, kawaguma muna ichifungo cha mgati, kawafunga migulu yawo na chibawo.<figure style="fig" file="21 Feet in Stocks.jpg" size="col" ref="16:24">Wanhu waidi wafungigwe migulu yawo kwa chibawo</figure><verse eid="ACT 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 16:25" />Ichilo chikulu Paulo na Sila wakala wotosa na kwimba nyila za kumtogoza Mulungu kuno wafungigwe wamwenga wakala wotegeleza. <verse eid="ACT 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 16:26" />Bahobaho kulawila nyukwa nyukwa kulu da isi, mbaka mhanda za ichifungo zitingisigwa na zinyivi zivuguka na minyololo yawo ihagaya. <verse eid="ACT 16:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 16:27" />Mkalizi wa ichifungo viyalamke na kuwona zinyivi za ichifungo zivuguligwa, kagesa kuwa wafungwa wose wakala wakimbila. Ivo kasomola zele jake kalonda kuikoma mwenyewo. <verse eid="ACT 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 16:28" />Mbali Paulo kalonga kwa dizi kulu, “Sekeuikome mwenyewo! Wose chabahano!”<verse eid="ACT 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 16:29" />Mkalizi wa ichifungo kapula yagaliligwe chitasa, kakimbilila kuna ichiheleto, katumbala mavindi haulongozi ha Paulo na Sila kuno kogudemeka.<verse eid="ACT 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 16:30" />Maabaho kawalava kunze kawauza, “Wenevale, nolondeka nitende choni muladi nilopoligwe!” <verse eid="ACT 16:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 16:31" />Wamwidika, “Muhuwile Mndewa Yesu, na kwizakomboka weye hamwe na kaye yako.” <verse eid="ACT 16:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 16:32" />Maabaho wampetela mbuli ya Mndewa, yeye hamwe na wanhu wamwenga wose muna ikaye yake. <verse eid="ACT 16:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 16:33" />Ichilo chiya imkalizi wa chifungo kawasola Paulo na Sila na kawasunha vilonda vawo, na bahobaho yeye na wanhu wa kaye yake wabatizigwa. <verse eid="ACT 16:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 16:34" />Maabaho kawasola Paulo na Sila kawagala kuna ikaye yake na kaweng'ha ndiya waje. Yeye na wanhu wa kaye yake wadeng'helela kwaviya lelo womuhuwila Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 16:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 16:35" />Imitondo yake wakulu wa Loma wawatuma wakulu wa wawakalizi kwa wakalizi wa chifungo na kawalongela, “Walekeni wanhu waja wahite.” <verse eid="ACT 16:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 16:36" />Ija imkalizi wa chifungo kamulongela Paulo, “Wakulu wa Loma walagiliza weye na Sila mulekeliligwe. Lelo modaha kusegela, hiteni kwa tindiwalo.” <verse eid="ACT 16:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 16:37" />Mbali Paulo kamulongela mkulu wa wakalizi, “Wachilanha mibalati haulongozi ha wanhu wose bila ya kuchitagusa, ingawa cheye ni Waloma. Maabaho wachika muna ichifungo. Lelo wolonda wachilave chinyele nyele. Aka! Leka weze wachilave wenyewo.”<verse eid="ACT 16:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 16:38" />Wakulu wa wakalizi wawalongela wakulu wa Loma, na viwahulike kuwa Paulo na Sila wakala wanhu wa Loma, wadumba ng'hani. <verse eid="ACT 16:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 16:39" />Ivo weza na kuwalamba, maabaho wawalava kunze ya ichifungo na kawalamba wasegela muna dibululu diya. <verse eid="ACT 16:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 16:40" />Paulo na Sila viwalawile muna ichifungo na kuhita kuna ikaye ya Lidiya. Uko waiting'hana na wahuwila, wawalongela mbuli za kuwaguma moyo, maabaho wasegela.<verse eid="ACT 16:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="ACT 17" />
  <para style="s">Uko Sesalonike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 17:1" />Paulo na Sila wafosela Amfipoli na Apoloniya wahita mbaka Sesalonike, uko kukala na kaye ya kutosela ya Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 17:2" />Fana chihendo chake, Paulo kahita kuna ikaye ija ya kumpulila Mulungu. Kalonga na wanhu kwa siku za Mhumulo matatu, kwa kusang'hanila Maandiko Yelile, <verse eid="ACT 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 17:3" />kawalongela na kawafambulila Yamaandiko Yelile na kawalongela kuwa Chilisito Mulopozi kolondeka yagazigwe na kuzilibuka. Paulo kalonga, “Yesu ino yoniwapetela mbuli zake, niiyo Chilisito Mulopozi.” <verse eid="ACT 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 17:4" />Wayahudi wamwenga wahuwila na wailumba na Paulo na Sila, na bumbila kulu da Wagiliki wowamdumbile Mulungu na wanaake wamwenga walangulizi iviya wahuwila.<verse eid="ACT 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 17:5" />Mbali Wayahudi wawawonela migongo, wasola wanhu welibule usang'hano, watenda chibumbila na wandusa ndwagi muna dibululu jose waizila kaye ya Yasoni wohuwila kuwapata umo na Paulo na Sila muladi wawagale haiwanhu. <verse eid="ACT 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 17:6" />Mbali viwawapuwile, wawagwila Yasoni na wahuwila wamwenga na wawagala haulongozi ha walangulizi wa dibululu na walandula madizi, “Paulo na Sila wagala magayo chila hanhu! Sambi weza muna dibululu jetu. <verse eid="ACT 17:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 17:7" />Na Yasoni kawahokela ukaye yake. Wose walema kutenda chiyalagilize mfalume wa Loma na walonga hambwe kuna mfalume imwenga, zina jake Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 17:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 17:8" />Wakulu wa isi na wanhu wamwenga viwahulike ivo wehilwa ng'hani. <verse eid="ACT 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 17:9" />Wakulu wawo wawatoza faini Yasoni na wayage, maabaho wawaleka wasegela.<verse eid="ACT 17:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uko Beleya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 17:10" />Ichilo vichingile wahuwila wawatuma Paulo na Sila uko Beleya. Viwafikile uko, wahita mwiikaye ya kutosela ya Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 17:11" />Wanhu wa Beleya wakala wotegeleza goya kuwafosa wanhu wa Sesalonike. Wauhokela usenga uja wa Mulungu kwa deng'ho, na chila siku wakala woyapekula Yamaandiko Yelile muladi wawone fana Paulo kolonga kweli. <verse eid="ACT 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 17:12" />Wayahudi wengi wahuwila na wanaake wengi wa Chiyunani weli na udaho na walume wengi wa Chiyunani iviya wahuwila.<verse eid="ACT 17:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 17:13" />Mbali Wayahudi wa Sesalonike viwahulike Paulo kopeta Mbuli ya Mulungu uko Beleya iviya, wahita uko na wandusa kuwakong'hela wanhu na ndwagi. <verse eid="ACT 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 17:14" />Bahobaho wahuwila wamgala Paulo mhwani. Mbali Sila na Timoseyo wasigala uko Beleya. <verse eid="ACT 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 17:15" />Wanhu wowamsolile Paulo, wahita nayo mbaka Asene. Maabaho wabwela mbaka Beleya wakala na malagilizo kulawa kwa Paulo kuwa Sila na Timoseyo sekewakalame kumsondelela Paulo.<verse eid="ACT 17:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Uko Asene</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 17:16" />Paulo viyakalile yowagoza Sila na Timoseyo uko Asene, kehilwa ng'hani muna umoyo wake viyawonile bululu diya dimema nyang'hiti za milungu. <verse eid="ACT 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 17:17" />Ivo kakala mwiikaye ya kutosela kakala yolonga na Wayahudi na wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi wowomtosela Mulungu, na chila siku kakala kowasimulila wanhu wakalile muumwingi. <verse eid="ACT 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 17:18" />Wamwenga wowainzile mafundizo ya Epikulo na Sitoiki waibishila nayo.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 17:18">Wamwenga walonga, “Kolonda kulonga choni ino mbozi?” Wamwenga wedika, “Yowoneka fana kopeta mbuli ya milungu imwenga.” Walonga ivo kwaviya Paulo kakala kopeta mbuli ya Yesu na mbuli ya uzilibuko, <verse eid="ACT 17:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 17:19" />Ivo wamsola Paulo, wamgala haulongozi ha ichitala cha bululu da Aleopoko na walonga, “Cholonda kuvimanya mafundizo yako ya sambi yolonga choni. <verse eid="ACT 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 17:20" />Mbuli zimwenga zochihulike kolonga ni za uzonza kumwetu, na cholonda kuvimanya fambulo da mbuli zino.” <verse eid="ACT 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 17:21" />Wanhu wose wa Asene na wageni wowokala umo wasang'hanila lusita lwawo lwose kulonga na huhulika chinhu cha sambi.<verse eid="ACT 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 17:22" />Paulo kema haulongozi ha ichitala cha bululu na kalonga, “Nowona kuwa chila munhu wa Asene komzahila Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 17:23" />Kwaviya vinikalile nofosa na kulola goya hanhu homutosela, niwona chilingo chandikigwa, ‘Kwa Mulungu hamanyika.’ Lelo niye nowapetela mbuli za iyo imumtosela bila kummanya.<verse eid="ACT 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 17:24" />“Mulungu yalumbile isi na ulanga na vinhu vose vili muno ni Mndewa wa ulanga na isi, hakala muna zikaye za imwe wa milungu zozizengigwe na wanhu. <verse eid="ACT 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 17:25" />Iviya hasang'hanilwa kwa makono ya wanhu, fana viya kolonda chochose, kwaviya yeye mwenyewo koweng'ha wanhu wose ugima na muhe na vinhu vose. <verse eid="ACT 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 17:26" />Kulawa kwa munhu imwe, kalumba wanhu wa chila isi na kawatenda wakale muna isi yose. Kalamula kulawa umwaka, zuwaki na kulihi kuwakalile wanhu wawo. <verse eid="ACT 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 17:27" />Katenda vino muladi wanhu wamzahile na wamsondelele hata kwa kumdalisa yapete kudalisigwa. Mulungu heli kutali na cheye bule. <verse eid="ACT 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 17:28" />Fana munhu imwe viyalongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 17:28">‘Mgati yake yeye chokala na chogenda na kuwa na ugima wetu.’</para>
  <para style="m" vid="ACT 17:28">Fana imwe wenu imtunga wila viyalongile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 17:28">‘Cheye wose ni welesi wake.’<verse eid="ACT 17:28" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 17:29" />Ivo kwaviya cheye chawana wa Mulungu, hachilondeka kulonga kuwa Mulungu kalinga fana zahabu hebu hela hebu dibwe, vinhu vitendigwa goya kwa ubala wa wanhu. <verse eid="ACT 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 17:30" />Mulungu katenda fana viya halola lusita luja wanhu viwakalile hawammanyile, mbali sambi kowalongela wanhu wose chila hanhu waleke uhasanyi wawo. <verse eid="ACT 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 17:31" />Kwaviya Mulungu keka siku yonda yawataguse wanhu wa isi yose viilondeka kwa munhu ija iyamsagule. Mulungu kalagusa yano yose kwa kumzilibula iyo!” <verse eid="ACT 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 17:32" />Viwahulike Paulo kolonga mbuli ya kuzilibuka, wamwenga wamzeha, mbali wamwenga walonga, “Cholonda chihulike kaidi mbuli ino.” <verse eid="ACT 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 17:33" />Ivo Paulo kasegela kuna umting'hano. <verse eid="ACT 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 17:34" />Wanhu wamwenga wamsondelela na wahuwila, imwe wawo kakala Dionisiyo, munhu wa chitala. Uko iviya kukala na mwanamke yatangigwe Damalisi na wanhu wamwenga.<verse eid="ACT 17:34" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="ACT 18" />
  <para style="s">Uko Kolimso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 18:1" />Maabaho Paulo kasegela Asene kahita Kolimso. <verse eid="ACT 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 18:2" />Uko Kolimso kamting'hana Muyahudi imwe yotangigwa Akila, yoyelekigwe na Ponto, yoyezile na muke wake Pilisika kulawa Italiya siku ziya, kwaviya mtawala Chilaudiyo kawalagiliza Wayahudi wose walawe Loma. Ivo Paulo kahita kuwalola, <verse eid="ACT 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 18:3" />na kakala na kusang'hana nawo, kwaviya yeye kakala kosona mahema fana wawo. <verse eid="ACT 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 18:4" />Chila Isiku ya Mhumulo kakala kolonga na wanhu muna ikaye ya kutosela, kageza kuwakwenhula Wayahudi na Wagiliki.<verse eid="ACT 18:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 18:5" />Sila na Timoseyo viwafikile kulawa Makedoniya, Paulo kasang'hanila lusita lwake lwose kuwapetela Wayahudi kuwa Yesu iyo Chilisito Mulopozi. <verse eid="ACT 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 18:6" />Viwaibishile nayo na kumuliga, kalagusa kuwa hatogole kwa kukung'hunha viwalo vake na kuwalongela, “Mwahaga, manye wenyewo! Niye namwabule, kwandusila sambi nizahita kwa wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi.” <verse eid="ACT 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 18:7" />Maabaho Paulo kasegela, kahita kukala muna ikaye ya munhu yeli siyo Muyahudi, zina jake Tito Yusito, munhu yomtambikila Mulungu, kaye yake ikala habehi na kaye ya kutosela. <verse eid="ACT 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 18:8" />Chilisipo, yakalile mkulu wa kaye ya kutosela ya Mulungu, kamuhuwila Mndewa, hamwe na kaye yake yose. Wanhu wamwenga wengi uko Kolinso wahulika usenga, wahuwila na wabatizigwa.<verse eid="ACT 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 18:9" />Chilo chimwe Mndewa kamulongela Paulo muna yamalaguso, “Sekeudumbe, gendelela kupeta na wala sekeunyamale, <verse eid="ACT 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 18:10" />kwaviya niye nahamwe na weye. Habule munhu yodaha kukulumiza na kukubananga, kwaviya niye nina wanhu wengi muna dibululu dino.” <verse eid="ACT 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 18:11" />Paulo kakala uko lusita lwa mwaka umwe na miezi sita, kowafundiza wanhu mbuli ya Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 18:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 18:12" />Galiyo viyakalile mkulu wa Akaya, Wayahudi waiting'hana hamwe, wamgwila Paulo na wamgala kuna ichitala. <verse eid="ACT 18:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 18:13" />Walonga, “Munhu ino kowatenda wanhu wamtosele Mulungu bila kusondelela Malagilizo ya Mulungu yoyamwing'hile Musa!”<verse eid="ACT 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 18:14" />Paulo viyalondile kulonga, Galiyo kawalongela Wayahudi, “One iwile mbuli ya ubamanyi hebu ya wihi, nihadahile kumtegelezani. <verse eid="ACT 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 18:15" />Mbali kwaviya mbuli zino na mazina ya malagilizo ni venu mweye, lamuleni mweye wenyewo. Niye sizakuwa mulamuzi wa mbuli zino!” <verse eid="ACT 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 18:16" />Maabaho kawalava kunze ya ichitala. <verse eid="ACT 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 18:17" />Wawo wose wamgwila Sositene, mkulu wa kaye ya kutosela ya Mulungu, na wamtowa haulongozi ha ichitala. Mbali Galiyo hagesile mbuli iyo hata chidogo.<verse eid="ACT 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kobwela Antiyokiya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 18:18" />Paulo kakala yang'hali na waja wanhu wahuwile uko Kolimso kwa siku nyingi, kahita na Pilisika na Akila mbaka Siliya. Yang'hali hanasegela Kemkeliya, kawegula mvili zake kwa chimu cha chilagano chiyekile. <verse eid="ACT 18:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 18:19" />Wafika Efeso, uko Paulo kawaleka Pilisila na Akila. Kengila mwiikaye ya kutosela na kalonga na Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 18:20" />Baho wamulamba yakale lusita lutali, mbali yeye hatogole bule. <verse eid="ACT 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 18:21" />Mbali viyakalile kosegela, kawalongela, “One Mulungu yahalonda nizakwiza kumwenu kaidi.” Maabaho kakwela muna ingalawa kasegela Efeso. <verse eid="ACT 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 18:22" />Viyafikile Kaisaliya, kahita Yelusalemu na kuwalamusa wahuwila, maabaho kahita Antiyokiya.<verse eid="ACT 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 18:23" />Kakala uko lusita ludodo, maabaho kagendelela na umwanza kwa kufosela mgati mwa isi ya Galatiya na Filigiya kuno kowaguma moyo wanhu waja wowamsondelele Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Apolo uko Efeso na Kolimso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 18:24" />Chipindi icho Muyahudi imwe yotangigwa Apolo, mwelekwa wa Waisikandaliya, kafika Efeso. Iyo kakala munhu yeli na udaho na yamanyile vinogile Yamaandiko Yelile. <verse eid="ACT 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 18:25" />Munhu iyo kakala kafundizigwa nzila ya Mndewa na kwaviya muhe wake ukala wodinhila, kandusa kulonga na kufundiza kwa unovu mbuli za Yesu, mbali kammanya Yohana na viya viyakalile kowabatiza wanhu. <verse eid="ACT 18:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 18:26" />Kandusa kulonga bila kudumba mwiikaye ya kutosela. Pilisika na Akila viwamuhulike, wamsola ukaye yawo na wamfambulila vinogile Nzila ya Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 18:27" />Apolo viyalondile kuhita Akaya, wahuwila wa Efeso wamtaza kwa kuwandikila usenga wahuwila wa Akaya wamuhokele. Nayo viyafikile uko kawataza ng'hani waja wowakalile wahuwila kwa unovu wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 18:28" />Kwaviya kawahuma ng'hani Wayahudi haulongozi ha wanhu wose, kalagusa kulawa muna Yamaandiko Yelile kuwa Yesu ni Chilisito Mulopozi.<verse eid="ACT 18:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="ACT 19" />
  <para style="s">Paulo uko Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 19:1" />Apolo viyakalile Kolimso, Paulo kafosa zisi zili muna ivilima na kafika Efeso. Uko kawafika wanhu wamwenga wowamsondelele Yesu, <verse eid="ACT 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 19:2" />kawauza, “Vino vimuwile wahuwila mumuhokela Muhe Yelile?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:2">Wamwidika, “Aka, hata kuhulika kuwa kuna Muhe Yelile hachinahulika bule.”<verse eid="ACT 19:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 19:3" />Paulo kawauza, “Lelo mubatizigwa ubatizo ulihi?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 19:3">Wamwidika, “Ubatizo uyabatize Yohana.”<verse eid="ACT 19:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 19:4" />Paulo kalonga, “Ubatizo uyabatize Yohana ukala kwa ichimu cha wanhu waja wasamhile uhasanyi wawo, na kawalongela wanhu wa Isilaeli wamuhuwile munhu ija yokwiza kuchisogo chake, niiyo Yesu.”<verse eid="ACT 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 19:5" />Viwahulike ivo, wabatizigwa kwa zina da Mndewa Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 19:6" />Paulo viyawekile makono yake, Muhe Yelile kawahumulukila, wandusa kulonga ulonzi umwenga na kulotela. <verse eid="ACT 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 19:7" />Wakala walume longo na waidi.<verse eid="ACT 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 19:8" />Paulo kengila mwiikaye ya kutosela na kulonga na wanhu bila kudumba kwa lusita lwa miyezi mitatu, kageza kuwakwesa weze muna Ufalume wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 19:9" />Mbali wamwenga wakala na mizoyo midala ivo hawatogole bule, na wailonga vihile mbuli ya Mndewa. Ivo Paulo kawaleka na kawasola wowahuwile na kulonga nawo chila siku muna ikaye ya kufundizila ya munhu imwe yatangigwe Tilano. <verse eid="ACT 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 19:10" />Mbuli zino zigendelela kwa lusita lwa miyaka midi, muladi wanhu wose wokala muna ikaye ya isi ya Asiya, Wayahudi na wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi, wahulike mbuli ya Mndewa.<verse eid="ACT 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wana wa Sikewa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 19:11" />Mulungu katenda mauzauza makulu kufosela Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 19:12" />Hata vitambala na viwalo vovilawile mulukuli va sang'hano voyayawale kavigala kwa watamu, na watamu wawo wahonyigwa mitamu yawo na vinyamkela viwalawa. <verse eid="ACT 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 19:13" />Wayahudi wamwenga waja wakalile wolava vinyamkela wahita uko na uko wogeza kusang'hanila zina da Yesu. Wawalongela waja wakumbigwe na vinyamkela, “Nowalongela kwa zina da Yesu, ija yopetigwa na Paulo.” <verse eid="ACT 19:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 19:14" />Kukala na ndugu saba wa tata imwe, Muyahudi yatangigwe Sikewa mkulu wa nhambiko, watenda ivo.<verse eid="ACT 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 19:15" />Mbali chinyamkela kawalongela, “Yesu nimmanya na Paulo nimmanya, mbali mweye wawo welihi?” <verse eid="ACT 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 19:16" />Maabaho munhu ija yakalile na chinyamkela kawazumhila wose kawadaha kawahuma ludabwa na wawo wana wa Sikewa wakimbila kunze mwa kaye ija wakala mwazi na wakala na vilonda.<verse eid="ACT 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 19:17" />Wayahudi wose na wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi wakalile Efeso wahulika mbuli ino, wose wadumba ng'hani, na zina da Mndewa Yesu ding'higwa nhogolwa ng'hulu. <verse eid="ACT 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 19:18" />Wanhu wengi wowahuwile weza, wasamha sang'hano zawo zihile haulongozi ha wanhu. <verse eid="ACT 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 19:19" />Wanhu wamwenga wakalile wotenda uhawi wavigala vitabu vawo na wavilunguza haulongozi ha wanhu. Viwapetile bei ya vitabu ivo, wawona yodaha kufika hela magana magana matano. <verse eid="ACT 19:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 19:20" />Ivo mbuli ya Mndewa yenela na kuwa na ludabwa lukulu.<verse eid="ACT 19:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tibwilitibwili uko Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 19:21" />Vinhu vino vivikomelezeke, Paulo kalamula yahite Yelusalemu kafosela Makedoniya na Akaya, kalonga, “Nihafika uko, iviya nolondigwa nihite Loma.” <verse eid="ACT 19:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 19:22" />Ivo kawatuma waidi wa watumigwa wake, Timoseyo na Elasito wahite Makedoniya, yeye mwenyewo kakala kuna mkowa wa Asiya.<verse eid="ACT 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 19:23" />Siku izo uko Efeso kulawilila tibwilitibwili kulu kwa ichimu cha Nzila ya Mndewa. <verse eid="ACT 19:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 19:24" />Kukala na munhu imwe zina jake Demetiliyo, iyo kakala mfuwa hela yoyakalile kotenda vikaye vya hela vya nyang'hiti vya Alitemi. Sang'hano iyo iwatenda Demeteliyo na wayage kuwagalila wahunzi faida nyingi. <verse eid="ACT 19:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 19:25" />Demeteliyo kawatanga wose hamwe na wanhu wamwenga wakalile na sang'hano ilingile fana ivo na kawalongela, “Walume, movimanya kuwa chopata hela nyingi muna isang'hano ino. <verse eid="ACT 19:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 19:26" />Lelo modaha kuwona na kuhulika mweye wenyewo yaja yoyotenda Paulo. Kawakong'hela na kuwahindula wanhu watogole kuwa milungu itendigwa na wanhu siyo milungu hata chidogo, siyo Efeso muhala mbali mikowa yose ya Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 19:27" />Ivo kuna ng'hondo kuwa sang'hano yetu izakuwa na zina dihile. Siyo ivo muhala, mbali mbuli iyo yodaha kuitenda mwiikaye ya Alitemi imwe wa milungu kuwa siyo chinhu cha mana na ukulu wake wizabanangika. Alitemi iyo imwe wa milungu kotoseligwa muna umkowa wa Asiya na muna zisi zose.”<verse eid="ACT 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 19:28" />Viwahulike mbuli izo wasomigwa mizoyo yawo na wandusa kulandula madizi, “Mkulu ni Alitemi wa Efeso!” <verse eid="ACT 19:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 19:29" />Bululu jose dimema tibwilitibwili. Wanhu wawagwila Gayo na Alisitaliko, wakaya wa Makedoniya wowakalile muna umwanza hamwe na Paulo, wakimbila nawo mbaka hanhu ha miting'hano. <verse eid="ACT 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 19:30" />Paulo kalonda yahite haulongozi ha lung'husesa, mbali wahuwila wamulemesa. <verse eid="ACT 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 19:31" />Wakulu wamwenga wa isi ya Asiya, wakalile mbwiya zake Paulo, wamtumila usenga wamulamba sekeyahite hanhu ha miting'hano. <verse eid="ACT 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 19:32" />Lung'husesa lukala lwehuka, wanhu wamwenga wakala wolonga chinhu chino na wamwenga wolonga chinhu chiya, kwaviya wanhu wamwenga hawavimanyile waiting'hanila choni. <verse eid="ACT 19:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 19:33" />Wayahudi wamwenga wamgala Alekizanda haulongozi ha wanhu, na wanhu wamwenga walandula madizi yawo. Nayo kawafunyiza wanhu wanyamale, muladi yaigombele haulongozi ha wanhu. <verse eid="ACT 19:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 19:34" />Mbali viwamanyile kuwa yeye kakala Muyahudi, wose walandula madizi yawo hamwe kwa masaa maidi, “Alitemi wa Efeso ni Mkulu!”<verse eid="ACT 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 19:35" />Kalani wa bululu viyadahile kuwanyamaliza iwanhu, “Mweye wanhu wa Efeso,” vino mweye hamuvimanyile kuwa bululu da Efeso ni mkalizi wa kaye ya Alitemi imwe wa milungu na chinyago chake chilagala kulawa kuulanga. <verse eid="ACT 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 19:36" />Habule munhu yodaha kubela vinhu vino. Ivo molondeka munyamale na muleke kutenda chinhu chochose himahima. <verse eid="ACT 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 19:37" />Muwagala walume wano hano ingawa hawabawile vinhu va kaye ya mulungu hebu kamuliga mulungu wetu wa chike. <verse eid="ACT 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 19:38" />One Demetiliyo na wasang'hani wayage wana mbuli na munhu wowose, vitala na wasemi wabaho. Wodaha kugala ulonzi wawo uko. <verse eid="ACT 19:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 19:39" />Mbali one muhalonda mbuli yoyose muna zimbuli zingine, yezasang'hanigwa muna bumbila haswa. <verse eid="ACT 19:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 19:40" />Kwaviya vino vitendeka diyelo kuna ng'hondo ya kuwa wezachilongela chigala ndwagi, chabule chimu chochose cha ndwagi ino na hachidaha kulonga mbuli yoyose yili na fambulo kwa kutenda vino. <verse eid="ACT 19:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 19:41" />Viyakomeleze kulonga vino, kadilongela bumbila dihite.<verse eid="ACT 19:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="ACT 20" />
  <para style="s">Paulo kohita Makedoniya na Ugiliki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 20:1" />Hengelehengele diya da Efeso vidimalile, Paulo kawatanga hamwe wanhu waja wowamsondelele kawagangamiza imizoyo na kawalaga. Hamala baho kawaleka na kahita Makedoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 20:2" />Kahita kufosela zisi ziya na kawagangamiza wanhu mizoyo kwa mbuli nyingi. Maabaho kafika Akaya, <verse eid="ACT 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 20:3" />uko kakala miyezi mitatu. Kakala yoisasala kuhita Siliya mbali katola kuwa wauko Wayahudi wolonda kumtendela yehile, ivo kalamula kubwela kufosela Makedoniya. <verse eid="ACT 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 20:4" />Sopatilo mwana wa Pilo kulawa Beleya, wahita nayo, ivo Alisitaliko na Sekundo kulawa Sesalonike, maabaho Gayo kulawa Delibe, Tukiko na Tilofimo na Timoseyo kulawa muna umkowa wa Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 20:5" />Wanhu wawo wachilongolela na kuchigozela kuja Tulowa, <verse eid="ACT 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 20:6" />Vichikomeleze Dugila da Magate hayanagumigwa Lusu, chikwela ngalawa kulawa Filipi, na siku nhatu hamwande chifika Tulowa. Uko chikala siku saba.<verse eid="ACT 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwanza wa uhelelo wa Paulo kuja Tulowa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 20:7" />Siku ya mwanduso ya juma, chiiting'hana muladi chije ndiya hamwe. Paulo kalonga na wanhu mbaka chilo chikulu, kwaviya kasegela siku isondelele. <verse eid="ACT 20:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 20:8" />Vitasa vingi vikala vokwaka muna ichiheleto cha uchanyha kochikalile chiiting'hana. <verse eid="ACT 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 20:9" />Mbwanga imwe yatangigwe Eutiko kakala yakalile muna dizonzo, Paulo viyakalile kolonga, Eutiko kakukila na kagona, mbaka kuuhelelo kazidilwa na nhongo na kagwa kulawa muna ichiheleto cha tatu cha uchanyha mbaka hasi. Viwahitile kumwinula wamfika kadanganika. <verse eid="ACT 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 20:10" />Mbali Paulo kahulumuka hasi, kamgwila na kamtumbalila mavindi. Kalonga, “Sekemudumbe, yang'hali mgima!” <verse eid="ACT 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 20:11" />Maabaho kakwela kaidi kuna dilingo, kamogola gate kaja. Viyakomeleze kulonga nawo kwa lusita lutali, mbaka habehi na imitondo, Paulo kasegela. <verse eid="ACT 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 20:12" />Wamsola imbwanga ija ukaye kuno mgima na wadeng'helela ng'hani.<verse eid="ACT 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulawa Tuloya kuhita Mileto.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 20:13" />Cheye chikwela muna ingalawa chilongolela kuhita Aso, uko chahamsolile Paulo. Kachilongela chitende vino, kwaviya yeye kakala kohita uko kwa kufosela isi inyalile. <verse eid="ACT 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 20:14" />Viyachifikile uko Aso, chimkweza muna ingalawa na chihita Mitilene. <verse eid="ACT 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 20:15" />Kulawa uko chandusa mwanza na siku isondelele chifika Kio. Siku dekaidi chimiza ingalawa Samo na siku isondelele chifika Mileto.<verse eid="ACT 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 20:16" />Paulo kakala na kalamula kugendelela na mwanza bila kufosela Efeso, muladi sekeyakalame muna umkowa wa Asiya. Kakala na himahima da kufika Yelusalemu muna isiku ya Pentekosite, one ihadahika.<verse eid="ACT 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kowatanga walala wa Efeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 20:17" />Kulawa Mileto Paulo katuma usenga uko Efeso wakawatange walala wa bumbila da wahuwila wa Chilisito muladi waiting'hane nayo. <verse eid="ACT 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 20:18" />Viwafikile, kawalongela, “Mweye movimanya viya vinikalile na mweye siku zose kwandusila zuwa diya da mwanduso vinifikile Asiya. <verse eid="ACT 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 20:19" />Movimanya viya vinimsang'hanile Mndewa kwa unyendanyenda mkulu, masozi na magezo yamhatile kwa ichimu cha wihi wa Wayahudi. <verse eid="ACT 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 20:20" />Movimanya kuwa silemile hata chidogo kuwapetela hanze hanze na muna zikaye zenu na kuwafundiza chochose chondachiwataze. <verse eid="ACT 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 20:21" />Niwalongela wose Wayahudi na wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi wasamhe uhasanyi wawo kwa Mulungu na wamuhuwile Mndewa wetu Yesu.<verse eid="ACT 20:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 20:22" />“Sivimanyile chondachinilawilile Yelusalemu, mbali nomuhulika Muhe wa Mulungu na nohita uko. <verse eid="ACT 20:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 20:23" />Na lelo nomuhulika Muhe Yelile konilongela kuwa manhesa na vifungo vonigozela chila isi. <verse eid="ACT 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 20:24" />Mbali siwona ugima wangu kuwa chinhu bule, ila nolonda kukomeleza sang'hano iyaning'hile Mndewa Yesu niitende, sang'hano ya kupetela Mbuli Inogile ya unovu wa Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 20:25" />“Nifosa kumwenu kupeta mbuli ya Ufalume wa Mulungu. Na lelo novimanya habule munhu yoyose kumwenu yondayaniwone kaidi. <verse eid="ACT 20:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 20:26" />Ivo diyelo nowalongelani kweli, munhu yoyose kumwenu yahaga, manye wenyewo. Niye namwabule! <verse eid="ACT 20:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 20:27" />Kwaviya silekile bule kuwalongela lungilo da Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 20:28" />Muiteganye mweye wenyewo na muwatiganye lung'husesa lwose luja Muhe Yelile yamwikileni muwe wemilizi wake mgati mmwake, mudidime bumbila da wahuwila wa Mulungu woyawatendile wawe wake kwa kufosela damu ya Mwanage. <verse eid="ACT 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 20:29" />Novimanya niye nihasegela, mbwizi wezakwiza kumwenu na hawezadiwonela ubazi dibumbila. <verse eid="ACT 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 20:30" />Lusita lokwiza walume wamwenga kulawa muna dibumbila jenu wenyewo vondawamulongeleni mbuli za uvwizi muladi kuwagiza waja wowamsondelela Yesu na kuwatenda wawasondelele wawo muhala. <verse eid="ACT 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 20:31" />Ivo kaleni meso na mukumbuke kuwa kwa masozi yangu, nimfundiza chila munhu imisi na ichilo kwa lusita lwa miyaka mitatu.<verse eid="ACT 20:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 20:32" />“Sambi nomwikani muna ukalizi wa Mulungu na usenga wa unovu wake, yoyodaha kuwagangamizani na kumwing'hani balaka zoyawekile wanhu wowasafyigwe. <verse eid="ACT 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 20:33" />Silondile bule hela hebu viwalo va munhu yoyose. <verse eid="ACT 20:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 20:34" />Mweye wenyewo movimanya kuwa nitenda usang'hano kwa makono yangu mwenyewo muladi kupata vinhu vonilonda mwenyewo na wayangu. <verse eid="ACT 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 20:35" />Muna zimbuli zose niwalagusa kuwa kwa kuzamha sang'hano zino molondeka kuwataza nyondenyonde na kuzikumbuka mbuli za Mndewa Yesu viya viyalongile mweyewo, ‘Vinoga kulava kufosa kuhokela.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 20:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 20:36" />Paulo viyakomeleze kulonga ivo, katumbala mavindi hamwe nawo na watosa. <verse eid="ACT 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 20:37" />Wose walila, wamuhagatila na wamnonela, maabaho wamulaga. <verse eid="ACT 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 20:38" />Mbuli ino iwalumiza ng'hani kwaviya Paulo kawalongela, “Hamwizaniwona kaidi bule.” Maabaho wahita nayo mbaka kuna ingalawa.<verse eid="ACT 20:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="ACT 21" />
  <para style="s">Paulo kohita Yelusalemu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 21:1" />Chiwalaga na chisegela. Chikwela ngalawa chihita dimwe kwa dimwe mbaka Kosi, siku isondelele chifika Lode, na kulawa uko chihita Patala. <verse eid="ACT 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 21:2" />Uko chifika ngalawa ikalile yohita Foinike, ivo chikwela na chisegela. <verse eid="ACT 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 21:3" />Na vichiiwone Chipulo, chileka ubanzi wa kumoso chigendelela na mwanza mbaka Siliya, na chihulumukila Tilo kwaviya uko ngalawa yetu kondaihulumuse imizigo. <verse eid="ACT 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 21:4" />Uko chiwafika wanhu wowamsondelele Yesu, chikala nawo kwa lusita lwa siku saba. Kwa ludabwa lwa Muhe Yelile, wamulongela Paulo sekeyahite Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 21:5" />Mbali chipindi chetu cha kukala nawo vichikomelezeke, chisegela na chigendelelela na mwanza wetu. Wose hamwe na wake zawo na wana, wahita na cheye kunze ya bululu, na baho chitumbala mavindi chitambika. <verse eid="ACT 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 21:6" />Vichikomeleze kuwalaga wanhu wose, chikwela muna ingalawa, nawo wabwela ukaye yawo.<verse eid="ACT 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 21:7" />Chigendelela na mwanza wetu kulawa Tilo kuhita Tolemayi, uko chiwalamsa wahuwila wayetu na chikala nawo zuwa dimwe. <verse eid="ACT 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 21:8" />Siku isondelele chihita Kaisaliya na chihita muna ikaye ya Filipo, mpetelaji. Yeye kakala imwe mwa iwaja saba wasaguligwe kuwa watazi kuja Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 21:9" />Munhu ino kakala na wali wane hawanasoligwa wowakalile wogong'onda usenga wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 21:10" />Vichikalile uko siku nyingi mulotezi wa Mulungu yatangigwe Agabu, keza kulawa Yudeya. <verse eid="ACT 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 21:11" />Viyafikile kausola mkwiji wa Paulo na kaizinga muna yamakono na muna yamagulu na kalonga, “Muhe Yelile kolonga, Wayahudi kuja Yelusalemu wezamfunga fana vino munhu yeli na mkwiji uno, na kumguma muna yamakono ya wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi.”<verse eid="ACT 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 21:12" />Vichihulike yayo, cheye na wanhu wamwenga wakalile baho chimulamba Paulo sekeyahite Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 21:13" />Mbali Paulo kedika, “Habali molila na kunitenda niwe na lugano? Niisasala siyo kwa kufungigwa muhala, mbali hata kudanganikila Yelusalemu kwa ichimu cha Mndewa Yesu!”<verse eid="ACT 21:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 21:14" />Viyalemile kuchitegeleza, chimuleka na chilonga, “Yoyolonda Mndewa yatendeke.” <verse eid="ACT 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 21:15" />Vichikomeleze, chisasala vinhu vetu na chisegela Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 21:16" />Wanhu wamwenga wowamsondelele Yesu wowalawile Kaisaliya wahita hamwe na cheye wachigala kuna ikaye ya Mnasoni. Mnasoni kakala munhu wa Chipulo, nayo kakala muhuwila kwa siku nyingi.<verse eid="ACT 21:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo komulaula Yakobo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 21:17" />Vichifikile Yelusalemu, wahuwila wachihokela kwa ndeng'helelo. <verse eid="ACT 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 21:18" />Siku isondelele Paulo kahita hamwe na cheye kumulola Yakobo na walala wose wa bumbila da wahuwila wa Chilisito wakalile baho. <verse eid="ACT 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 21:19" />Paulo kawalamsa na kawalongela dimwe kwa dimwe mbuli zose ziyatendile Mulungu kwa wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi kufosela sang'hano yake. <verse eid="ACT 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 21:20" />Viwahulike yayo, wose wamtunhiza Mulungu. Maabaho walonga, “Ndugu yetu Paulo, kodaha kuwona viya Wayahudi wengi viwawile wahuwila, na viya wose viwokwamha Malagilizo ya Mulungu yoyamwing'hile Musa.<verse eid="ACT 21:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 21:21" />“Walongeligwa kuwa weye kowafundiza Wayahudi wose wowokala muna isi ya wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi waleke Malagilizo ya Mulungu yoyamwing'hile Musa, kuwalongela sekewawengize ulungwana wana wawo wala sekewawinze vihendo vetu. <verse eid="ACT 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 21:22" />Wanhu wano wezahulika kuwa weye kwa hano, lelo chitendeze? <verse eid="ACT 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 21:23" />Vino ivo vochilonda weye utende. Hano hana wanhu wane wekile chilagano. <verse eid="ACT 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 21:24" />Ilumbe nawo, isafye hamwe nawo na uwalihile muladi waweguligwe mvili zawo. Wanhu wose wezavimanya kuwa mbuli zowalongiligwe kukusonhela weye zabule fambulo jojose, na kuwa mwenyewo ung'hali kukala kwa kusondelela Malagilizo ya Mulungu yoyamwing'hile Musa. <verse eid="ACT 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 21:25" />Kwa mbuli ya wanhu waja weli siyo Wayahudi wowahuwile, chiwagalila usenga na chiwalongela mbuli zichisagule, kuwa sekewaje chochose chochitoseligwe nyang'hiti, sekewaje damu na sekewaje nyama ya ng'onyo dibobotoligwe na wayepule na uashelati.”<verse eid="ACT 21:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 21:26" />Siku isondelele Paulo kawasola waja iwanhu katenda nhambiko ya kuisafya hamwe nawo maabaho kengila muna Ikaye ya Mulungu kulava nhume kwa mbuli ya uhelelo wa siku za kuisafya na kwa mbuli ya nhosa yonda ilavigwe kwa ichimu cha chila imwe wawo.<verse eid="ACT 21:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kogwiligwa muna Ikaye ya Mulungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 21:27" />Siku saba viyakalile habehi na kukomelezeka, Wayahudi walawile muna umkowa wa Asiya wamuwona Paulo muna Ikaye ya Mulungu. Wawatenda wanhu wose wamwihile Paulo na wamgwila. <verse eid="ACT 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 21:28" />Walandula madizi yawo na walonga, “Mweye walume wa Isilaeli! Chitazeni! Ino niiyo munhu yofundiza wanhu chila hanhu waleke kuwasondelela wanhu wa Isilaeli na Malagilizo ya Mulungu yoyamwing'hile Musa na Kaye ino ya Mulungu. Na sambi kawengiza wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi muna Ikaye ya Mulungu, na kahatenda hanhu hano helile hambule mwiko.” <verse eid="ACT 21:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 21:29" />Walonga ivo kwaviya wamuwona Tilofimo kulawa Efeso hamwe na Paulo muna dibululu, na wagesa kuwa Paulo kamwingiza muna Ikaye ya Mulungu.<verse eid="ACT 21:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 21:30" />Bululu jose jenela hengelehengele na wanhu weza kulawa banzi zose na wamgwila Paulo na wambulula na wamulava kunze ya Kaye ya Mulungu na bahobaho zinyivi za Ikaye ya Mulungu zihindigwa. <verse eid="ACT 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 21:31" />Wakala wogeza kumkoma Paulo, mbali zinhume zimfikila imkulu wa wakalizi wa Chilumi kuwa Yelusalemu yose ikala imema hengelehengele. <verse eid="ACT 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 21:32" />Bahobaho imkulu wa wakalizi, kawasola wakalizi na imkulu na kudihitila diya dibumbila da wanhu. Viwamuwone imkulu wa wakalizi, wakalizi waleka kumtowa Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 21:33" />Mkulu wa wakalizi kamuhitila Paulo na kumgwila na kulagiliza yatatalizigwe minyololo midi. Maabaho kauza, “Munhu ino iyo yelihi, na katenda choni?” <verse eid="ACT 21:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 21:34" />Wanhu wamwenga muna ulung'husesa luja walonga vino na wamwenga walonga vimwenga, mkulu iyo hadahile bule kuhulika goya kwaviya kukakala na gubu, ivo kalagiliza Paulo yagaligwe kuna imhongono. <verse eid="ACT 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 21:35" />Paulo viyafikile muna ichidando, wakalizi wamsola kwaviya wanhu wakala wotenda hengelehengele <verse eid="ACT 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 21:36" />Lung'husesa lumsondelela na wanhu wagendelela kulandula madizi yawo, “Mkome iyo!”<verse eid="ACT 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo koigombela mwenyewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 21:37" />Wakalizi viwakalile womgala Paulo muna imhongono, kamuuza mkulu wa wakalizi, “Nodaha kulonga mbuli kumwako?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 21:37">Imkulu kamuuza, “Vino kodaha kulonga Chigiliki?” <verse eid="ACT 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 21:38" />“Hambwe weye kwa Mmisili ija yanduse kuwatenda wanhu magana malongo mane wagombe siku zino na kuwalongoza kudibwilingu?” <verse eid="ACT 21:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 21:39" />Paulo kedika, “Bule! Niye ni Muyahudi mwelekwa wa Taliso, muna isi ya Chilikiya, isi imanyika ng'hani. Nokulamba nileke nilonge na wanhu.” <verse eid="ACT 21:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 21:40" />Mkulu ija kamulekela yalonge, ivo Paulo kema hachanyha ha ichidando, kawapungila mkono muladi wanhu wanyamale. Viwanyamale, Paulo kalonga nawo kwa Chiyebulaniya.<verse eid="ACT 21:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="ACT 22" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 22:1" />“Ndugu zangu na tati zangu, nitegelezeni, viniigombela mwenyewo haulongozi wenu.” <verse eid="ACT 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 22:2" />Viwahulike kolonga nawo kwa Chiyebulaniya, wanyamala hupi, na Paulo kagendelela kulonga,<verse eid="ACT 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 22:3" />“Niye ni Muyahudi, mwelekwa wa Taso muna isi ya Chilikiya, mbali nikulila muna dibululu dino da Yelusalemu fana mwanahina wa Gamaliyeli. Nifundizigwa kwamha Malagilizo ya wasaho zetu na nikala noiyoha kumuhulika Mulungu fana mweye wose muli hano diyelo. <verse eid="ACT 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 22:4" />Niwagaza wanhu wowosondelela nzila ino. Niwagwila wose wanaake na walume, na niwasa muna ichifungo. <verse eid="ACT 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 22:5" />Mkulu wa nhambiko digogogo na chitala chose cha walala walangulizi wa bumbila da wahuwila wa Chilisito wodaha kulava ukalangama kuwa nolonga kweli. Waning'ha usenga nigale kwa Wayahudi wa Damasiki, ivo nihita uko na kuwagala wanhu Yelusalemu muladi watagusigwe.<verse eid="ACT 22:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kolonga mbuli ya ukombola wake</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Sang'hano 9:1-19</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 26:12-18">26:12-18</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 22:6" />“Vinikalile muna umwanza habehi kufika na Damasiki, Lusita lwa imisi sinhukila bung'hulo kulu kulawa kuulanga dilawilila dinimwemwesela banzi zose. <verse eid="ACT 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 22:7" />Nigwa hasi na nihulika dizi donilongela, ‘Sauli, Sauli! Habali konigaza?’ <verse eid="ACT 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 22:8" />Niuza, ‘Mndewa, weye kwa yelihi?’ Mndewa kamwidika, ‘Niye niiyo Yesu wa Nazaleti, weye younigaza.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 22:9" />Waja wayangu wadiwona bung'hulo diya, mbali hawahulike dizi da munhu yakalile yolonga na niye. <verse eid="ACT 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 22:10" />Niuza, ‘Mndewa, nitende choni?’ Na Mndewa kanilongela, ‘Inuka uhite Damasiki, uko kwizalongiligwa chila chinhu Mulungu chiyokulonda utende.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 22:11" />Nikala chipofu kwa ichimu cha bung'hulo diya, ivo wayangu wanisola kwa makono na wanilongoza Damasiki.<verse eid="ACT 22:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 22:12" />“Kuna dibululu ijo kukala na munhu imwe yotangigwa Ananiya, munhu wa dini yoyokwamha Malagilizo yetu na kowahulika Wayahudi wose wokala uko. <verse eid="ACT 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 22:13" />Kema habehi yangu na kalonga, ‘Ndugu yangu Sauli, uwone kaidi!’ Bahobaho niwona kaidi. <verse eid="ACT 22:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 22:14" />Maabaho Ananiya kalonga, ‘Mulungu wa wasaho zetu kakusagula weye umanye udaho wake, umuwone mtumigwa wake wa yanogile haulongozi ha Mulungu na umuhulike viyolonga kwa dizi jake. <verse eid="ACT 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 22:15" />Kwaviya kwizakuwa mkalangama wake kumulongela chila munhu chiya chiuwone na chiuhulike. <verse eid="ACT 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 22:16" />Lelo kogozela choni? Inuka na ubatizigwe na kwizalekeleligwa uhasanyi wako kwa kumtosela yeye.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kotangigwa kuwapetela wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 22:17" />“Nibwela Yelusalemu, na vinikalile notambika muna Ikaye ya Mulungu, niwona malaguso, <verse eid="ACT 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 22:18" />nimuwona Mndewa kanilongela, ‘Sambi segela Yelusalemu himahima kwaviya wanhu wa hano hawezatogola ukalangama wako kusonhela niye.’ <verse eid="ACT 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 22:19" />Nimwidika, ‘Mndewa, wawo wavimanya kuwa niye nihita kuna zikaye za kutosela na kuwagwila na kuwatowa wose wokuhuwila weye. <verse eid="ACT 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 22:20" />Mkalangama wenu Sitefano viyakomigwe niye nikala uko, nitogola kukomigwa kwake, na nikala nokaliza viwalo va waja wamkomile.’<verse eid="ACT 22:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 22:21" />“Mndewa kanilongela, ‘Hita, kwaviya nizakutuma kutali kwa wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi.’ ” <verse eid="ACT 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 22:22" />Wanhu wamtegeleza Paulo mbaka kalonga vino, maabaho wandusa kulandula madizi yawo, “Mkome iyo! Hafaya bule kuwa mgima!” <verse eid="ACT 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 22:23" />Wagendelela kulosokalosoka kuno woyatingisa makoti yawo na kwasa timbwisi kuchanyha. <verse eid="ACT 22:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 22:24" />Mkulu wa wakalizi kawalagiliza wanhu wake wamgale Paulo mgati muna imhongono, maabaho kalagiliza wamuuze kwa kumtowa mibalati, muladi yavimanye habali wanhu womulandulila madizi. <verse eid="ACT 22:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 22:25" />Mbali viwakalile womfunga muladi wamulanhe mibalati, Paulo kamulongela mkulu imwe wa wakalizi yoyemile habehi, “Vino vinoga kumwenu kumulanha mibalati mkaya wa Loma yang'hali hanatagusigwa?”<verse eid="ACT 22:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 22:26" />Imkulu viyahulike vino, kahita kwa mkulu wa wakalizi na kamuuza, “Kotenda choni? Munhu ija ni mkaya wa Loma!” <verse eid="ACT 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 22:27" />Ivo mkulu wa wakalizi kamuhitila Paulo na kumulongela, “Nilongele, vino weye kwa mkaya wa Loma?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:27">Paulo kamwandika, “Ona.” <verse eid="ACT 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 22:28" />Mkulu wa wakalizi kalonga, “Niye niwa mkaya kwa kuliha hela nyingi.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 22:28">Paulo kamwidika, “Niye mkaya wa Loma kwa kwelekwa.”<verse eid="ACT 22:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 22:29" />Mbali waja wowakalile wamala kumsepa Paulo, lusita ulo wakimbila. Mbaka ija mkulu wa wakalizi kadumba, viyavimanyile kuwa Paulo ni mkaya wa Loma na kawa kamala kumfunga minyololo.<verse eid="ACT 22:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo haulongozi wa ichitala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 22:30" />Siku isondelele mkulu wa wakalizi kalonda yavimanye masitaka haswa ya Wayahudi yowamtendile Paulo, ivo kamfungula Paulo iminyololo na kalonga wakulu wose wa nhambiko watende lundo. Maabaho kamgala Paulo kuna ichitala na kamwimiza haulongozi wawo.<verse eid="ACT 22:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="ACT 23" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 23:1" />Paulo kawabunhulila yameso wanhu wa ichitala na kalonga, “Ndugu zangu Waisilaeli! Nimsang'hanila Mulungu kwa moyo unogile mbaka diyelo.” <verse eid="ACT 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 23:2" />Mkulu wa nhambiko digogogo Ananiya kawalagiliza waja wakalile wema habehi na Paulo wamtowe muna umulomo wake. <verse eid="ACT 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 23:3" />Maabaho Paulo kamulongela, “Mulungu kezakutowa, weye mdelenya! Kukala baho unitaguse niye kwa Malagilizo ya Mulungu yoyamwing'hile Musa, kuno weye mwenyewo koyabena Malagilizo yayo kwa kulagiliza nitowigwe!”<verse eid="ACT 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 23:4" />Wanhu wakalile wema habehi na Paulo walonga, “Weye komuliga Mkulu wa nhambiko wa Mulungu!” <verse eid="ACT 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 23:5" />Paulo kedika, “Ndugu zangu, sivimanyile bule kuwa yeye ni mkulu wa nhambiko dogogogo, kwaviya Yamaandiko Yelile yolonga, ‘Uleke kulonga vihile kwa imtawala wa wanhu wako.’ ” <verse eid="ACT 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 23:6" />Maabaho Paulo viyavimanyile wanhu wakalile baho wengi wakala Masadukayo na wamwenga Mafalisayo, kalonga, “Ndugu zangu, niye ni Mfalisayo na mwana wa mafalisayo. Niye notagusigwa kwaviya nololela kuwa wanhu wadanganike wezazilibuka!” <verse eid="ACT 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 23:7" />Viyalongile vino, Masadukayo na Mafalisayo wandusa kwiihasanya, na bumbila diigola. <verse eid="ACT 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 23:8" />Masadukayo wolonga kuwa wanhu wadanganike hawezazilibuka bule na kuwa habule wasenga wa kuulanga wala viumbe vimwenga va kuulanga, mbali Mafalisayo wotogola yayo yose matatu. <verse eid="ACT 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 23:9" />Nyangi zongezeka na wafundiza Malagilizo wamwenga wa chibumbila cha Mafalisayo wema na kulava mifundo yawo kwa ludabwa, “Hachiwona chinhu chochose chihile mwa munhu ino! Yodahika msenga wa kuulanga wa Mndewa hebu chiumbe cha kuulanga chilonga nayo.”<verse eid="ACT 23:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 23:10" />Hengelehengele dikala kulu ng'hani, na ija imkulu wa wakalizi kadumba kuwa wanhu wahamtowile Paulo vihande vihande. Ivo kalagiliza wakalizi wahulumuke na wamsole kwa nguvu kulawa muna yamakono yawo, maabaho wangala muna imhongono. <verse eid="ACT 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 23:11" />Chilo chisondelele Mndewa kema habehi na Paulo na kulonga “Sekeudumbe! Fana viuwalongele wanhu mbuli zangu hano Yelusalemu, iviya kolondeka uwalongele wanhu uko Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 23:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wayahudi wozahila nzila ya kumkoma Paulo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 23:12" />Viuchile Wayahudi waiting'hana hamwe waidumwe na walagana sekewaje wala sekewang'we chinhu chochose mbaka vondawamkome Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 23:13" />Wanhu watendile ivo wakala wengi kufosa malongo mane. <verse eid="ACT 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 23:14" />Maabaho wahita kwa wakulu wa nhambiko na walala, walonga, “Chiilaha kuwa hachizakuja wala hachizakung'wa chinhu chochose mbaka vondachimkome Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 23:15" />Lelo mweye wanhu wa chitala mumulambe mkulu wa wakalizi yamgale Paulo kumwenu, mutende fana molonda kuvimanya vinogile mbuli zake. Cheye chiitanda kumkoma hata yang'hali hanafika hano.”<verse eid="ACT 23:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 23:16" />Mbali mwihwa wa Paulo kahulika mpango uwo, Ivo kahita muna imhongono na kamulongela Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 23:17" />Maabaho Paulo kamtanga imwe wa wakulu wa wakalizi na kamulongela, “Mgale mbwanga ino kwa mkulu wa wakalizi, kana chinhu cha kumulongela.” <verse eid="ACT 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 23:18" />Mkulu wa wakalizi kamsola mbwanga ija, kangala kwa imkulu, kamulongela, “Paulo kanitanga na kanilamba ningale mbwanga ino kumwako, kwaviya kana chinhu cha kukulongela.”<verse eid="ACT 23:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 23:19" />Mkulu wa wakalizi kamwamha mkono mbwanga ija, kamkwenhusa hamgwazo na hatali na kamuuza, “Kolonda kunilongela choni?” <verse eid="ACT 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 23:20" />Kamulongela, “Walangulizi wa Wayahudi waitogolela wakupule igolo ungale Paulo kuna ichitala, wotenda fana wolonda wamanye vinogile mbuli zake. <verse eid="ACT 23:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 23:21" />Mbali weye sekeutogole, kwaviya hana wanhu kufosa malongo mane waisasala kumzumhila wailaha hawezakuja chinhu chochose wala hawezakung'wa chinhu chochose mbaka vondawamkome Paulo. Sambi wakala goya wogozela ulamuzi wako.”<verse eid="ACT 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 23:22" />Mkulu wa wakalizi kamulongela mbwanga iyo, “Sekeumulongele munhu yoyose kuwa kunilongela mbuli ino.” Maabaho kamuleka yasegele.<verse eid="ACT 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kogaligwa Kaisaliya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 23:23" />Maabaho mkulu wa wakalizi kawatanga wakalizi waidi, kawalongela, “Wasasaleni wakalizi magana maidi na wowokwela falasi malongo saba na wakalizi weli na migoha magana maidi, na muisasale kuhita Kaisaliya ing'hali kufika saa tatu ichilo. <verse eid="ACT 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 23:24" />Sasaleni falasi kwa ichimu cha Paulo na mungale vinogile kwa Felisi, mkulu wa mkowa.” <verse eid="ACT 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 23:25" />Maabaho imkulu wa wakalizi kandika usenga fana vino.<verse eid="ACT 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 23:26" />“Kwa mwenevale Felisi mkulu wa mkowa, niye Chilaudiyo Lisiya, nokulamsa. <verse eid="ACT 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 23:27" />Wayahudi wamgwila munhu ino na walonda kumkoma. Nivimanya kuwa kakala mkaya wa Loma, ivo nihita na wakalizi wangu na nimkombola. <verse eid="ACT 23:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 23:28" />Nilonda kuvimanya chimu chiwamtagusile, ivo nihulumuka muna ichitala chawo. <verse eid="ACT 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 23:29" />Nivimanya kuwa masitaka yenyewo yosonhela ubishi kwa mbuli ya hanhu hamwenga ha malagilizo yawo, ivo siwonile kuwa katenda chochose chihile chochimulonda yakomigwe hebu yafungigwe muna ichifungo. <verse eid="ACT 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 23:30" />Viinilongiligwe kuwa Wayahudi wotenda npango wa kumkoma, nilamula kumgala kumwako. Iviya niwalagiliza wowamtaguse walonge masitaka haulongozi hako.” <verse eid="ACT 23:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 23:31" />Ivo wakalizi wamsola Paulo fana viwalagilizigwe. Ichilo chiya chiya wangala Paulo mbaka Antipatili.<verse eid="ACT 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 23:32" />Siku isondelele wakalizi wa migulu wabwela muna imhongono, wawaleka waja wakalizi wakwela falasi, wagendelelela na umwanza hamwe na Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 23:33" />Wamsola mbaka Kaisaliya na wamgolela usenga imkulu iyo wa mkowa na wamwika Paulo haukalizi wake. <verse eid="ACT 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 23:34" />Mkulu iyo kasoma usenga na kamuuza Paulo, kolawa isi ilihi? Viyavimanyile kuwa kalawa mkowa wa Chilikiya, <verse eid="ACT 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 23:35" />kalonga, “Nizakutegeleza vondaweze waja wowakusitaki.” Maabaho kalagiliza Paulo yakalizigwe muna ikaye ya ufalume ya Helode.<verse eid="ACT 23:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="ACT 24" />
  <para style="s">Paulo kuna ichitala cha Felisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 24:1" />Siku tano hamwande, Mkulu wa Nhambiko ya Mulungu, Ananiya kahita Kaisaliya hamwe na walala wamwenga na munhu imwe yamanyile Malagilizo ya Mulungu yoyamwing'hile Musa. Munhu iyo katangigwa Telitulo. Wema haulongozi wa Felisi, wamulongela mbuli za Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 24:2" />Paulo katangigwa mgati, Telitulo kandusa kulonga hana ichitala ha Felisi.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:2">“Mwenevale, chideng'helela tindiwalo ng'hani muna ulangulizi wako, na vinhu vingi vovilondigwa vitendigwa kwa ichimu cha isi yetu. <verse eid="ACT 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 24:3" />Ivo choyahokela yano chila hanhu na kwa lusita lose, na kukutogola kwa ukulu. <verse eid="ACT 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 24:4" />Silonda bule kwagiza ng'hani lusita lwako, kwa ivo nokulamba uwe nyendanyenda na uchitegeleze chidogo. <verse eid="ACT 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 24:5" />Chimuwona munhu ino msovu na chandusilo cha hengelehengele mgati mwa Wayahudi wose muna isi yose, maabaho ni mulangulizi wa bumbila ditangigwa Wanazalayo. <verse eid="ACT 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 24:6" />Kaidi kageza kuitenda Kaye ya Mulungu yambule mwiko, chingwila na chimtagusa kuilinga na malagilizo yetu. <verse eid="ACT 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 24:7" />Mbali Lisiya, mkulu wa walangulizi keza na kamsola kwa nguvu muna yamakono yetu. <verse eid="ACT 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 24:8" />One wahamuuza munhu ino, weye mwenyewo kodaha kuifunza kulawa kumwake vinhu viya vovitendile chimtaguse.” <verse eid="ACT 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 24:9" />Wayahudi wayatogola masitaka yayo na walonga kuwa yayo yose yakala kweli.<verse eid="ACT 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo koigombela haulongozi ha Felisi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 24:10" />Mkulu wa mkowa kamfunyiza Paulo yalonge, na Paulo kalonga,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 24:10">“Novimanya kuwa kukala msemi wa isi ino kwa miyaka mingi, nodeng'helela kuigombela mwenyewo haulongozi wako. <verse eid="ACT 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 24:11" />Kodaha kuvimanya weye mwenyewo, kuwa hazifosile siku longo na mbili kulawa vinihitile Yelusalemu kutosa. <verse eid="ACT 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 24:12" />Wayahudi hawanivikile noiuzagiza na wanhu wowose, hawanivikile nowasongeza wanhu muna Ikaye ya Mulungu hebu muna zikaye za kutosela hebu hanhu hamwenga hohose muna dibululu jawo. <verse eid="ACT 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 24:13" />Wala hawadaha bule kulagusa chochose cha malongelezo yawo. <verse eid="ACT 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 24:14" />Chinhu chinitogola haulongozi wako ni chino, niye nomtosela Mulungu wa wasaho zetu kwa nzila ziwalongile kuwa za uvwizi. Iviya notogola mbuli zose zozandikigwe muna ivitabu va Malagilizo ya Mulungu yoyamwing'hile Musa na vitabu va walotezi wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 24:15" />Niye nomulolela Mulungu fana wawo viwomulolela, kuwa wanhu wose wadanganike wezazilibuka, wehile na wanogile. <verse eid="ACT 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 24:16" />Ivo siku zose noiyoha kutenda yanogile haulongozi ha Mulungu na wanhu.<verse eid="ACT 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 24:17" />“Nisegela Yelusalemu miyaka mingi, lelo nibwela muladi niwataze ndugu zangu na kulava sadaka. <verse eid="ACT 24:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 24:18" />Lusita vinikalile notenda yayo ivo wanifika muna Ikaye ya Mulungu vinikalile notenda nhosa ija ya kuisafya. Hakukalile na bumbila da wanhu wala hengelehengele. <verse eid="ACT 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 24:19" />Mbali kukala na Wayahudi wamwenga kulawa mkowa wa Asiya, wawo niiyo wolondeka kuwa haulongozi wako kulava masitaka yawo one wana chochose cha kulonga kusonhela niye. <verse eid="ACT 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 24:20" />Hebu wano wenyewo nawalonge dihile dilihi dowadiwawonile kumwangu viya vinimile haulongozi ha ichitala, <verse eid="ACT 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 24:21" />ila nilonga chinhu chimwe muhala haulongozi hawo, ‘Notagusigwa kwaviya nohuwila kuwa wanhu wadanganike wezazilibuka.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 24:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 24:22" />Maabaho Felisi, yamanyile goya mbuli za Nzila ija, kemiza imbuli iyo. Kalonga, “Lisiya mkulu wa wakalizi vondayeze, nizalamula mbuli yenu.” <verse eid="ACT 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 24:23" />Kamulagiliza ija imkulu wa wakalizi kuwa yamkalize Paulo, mbali yailegehe chidogo muladi wambwiya zake wamsang'hanile chiya choyolonda.<verse eid="ACT 24:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo haulongozi ha Felisi na Dulusila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 24:24" />Vizifosile siku ndodo Felisi keza na mke wake yatangigwe Dulusila, yakalile Muyahudi. Kalagiliza Paulo yatangigwe na kamtegeleza viyakalile kolonga mbuli za kumuhuwila Yesu Chilisito. <verse eid="ACT 24:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 24:25" />Mbali Paulo viyakalile kogendelela kulonga mbuli ya kunoga haulongozi wa Mulungu, na kuwa na kulinganya, na mbuli za isiku ya nhaguso dodikwiza, Felisi kadumba na kalonga, “Leka teng'hu, sambi kodaha kuhita, nihailegeha nizakutanga kaidi.” <verse eid="ACT 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 24:26" />Lusita ulo ulo kakala yololela kuwa Paulo kezamwing'ha hela, na kwa ichimu chino, kamtanga miyanza mingi na kulonga nayo.<verse eid="ACT 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 24:27" />Viifosile miyaka midi, Polikiyo Fesito kamuhokela Felisi kutawala, kawa mkulu wa mkowa. Mbali kwaviya Felisi kalonda yawadeng'heleze Wayahudi, kamuleka Paulo muna ichifungo.<verse eid="ACT 24:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="ACT 25" />
  <para style="s">Paulo kopula lufani kwa Mkulu wa Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 25:1" />Vizifosile siku tatu Fesito kufika muna umkowa, kasegela kulawa Kaisaliya, kahita Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 25:2" />Mkulu wa Nhambiko ya Mulungu na walangulizi wa Wayahudi wagala masitaka ya Paulo. Wamulamba Fesito <verse eid="ACT 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 25:3" />yawadeng'heleze kwa kumgala Paulo Yelusalemu, kwaviya wakala wailungile kumkoma yang'hali muna inzila. <verse eid="ACT 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 25:4" />Fesito kewedika, “Paulo kezasigala muna ichifungo kuja Kaisaliya na niye mwenyewo nizahita uko lusita ludodo lukwiza. <verse eid="ACT 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 25:5" />Walekeni walangulizi wenu wahite uko Kaisaliya hamwe na niye, walave masitaka yawo hachanya yake one katenda chochose chihile.”<verse eid="ACT 25:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 25:6" />Fesito kakala nawo zaidi ya siku nane hebu longo hamwe nawo, maabaho kahita Kaisaliya. Siku isondelele kakala hasi kuna ichitala cha nhaguso na kalagiliza Paulo yengizigwe mgati. <verse eid="ACT 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 25:7" />Paulo viyafikile, Wayahudi wezile kulawa Yelusalemu wema habehi yake na wandusa kulava malongelezo mengi yazamile, hawayadahile kuyalagusa kuwa kweli. <verse eid="ACT 25:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 25:8" />Mbali Paulo kaigombela mwenyewo, “Sibanange mbuli hachanyha ha Yamalagilizo ya Wayahudi hebu hachanyha ha kaye ya Mulungu hebu hachanyha ha mfalume wa isi ya Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 25:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 25:9" />Mbali Fesito kalonda yawadeng'heleze Wayahudi, ivo kamuuza Paulo, “Vino kodaha kuhita Yelusalemu muladi ugezigwe haulongozi hangu kwa masitaka yano?”<verse eid="ACT 25:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 25:10" />Paulo kamwidika, “Niye nokwima hano haichitala cha mfalume wa isi ya Loma, nolondeka nilongelezigwa hano. Sitendile bule chinhu chihile chochose kwa Wayahudi fana weye mwenyewo viuyamanya yano vinogile. <verse eid="ACT 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 25:11" />One nahabananga na kutenda chinhu chihile chochinilonda nikomigwe, silema bule. Mbali one kuna shitaka da uvwizi kwasakanya muna yamakono yawo. Nolamba mfalume wa isi ya Loma yanitegeleze.”<verse eid="ACT 25:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 25:12" />Maabaho Fesito viyakomeleze kulonga na wanhu wa chitala, kedika, “Kolonda kuhita kwa Mkulu wa Loma, haya kwizahita kwa mfalume wa isi ya Loma!”<verse eid="ACT 25:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo haulongozi wa Agilipa na Benike</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 25:13" />Vizifosile siku ndodo, mfalume Agilipa na Benike weza Kaisaliya kumulamsa Fesito. <verse eid="ACT 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 25:14" />Viwakalile uko kwa siku nyingi, Fesito kamulongela mfalume mbuli za Paulo, kalonga, “Kabahano munhu imwe yalekigwe muna ichifungo na Felisi, <verse eid="ACT 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 25:15" />na vinihitile Yelusalemu wakulu wa nhambiko wa Chiyahudi na walala wamulongeleza na wanilamba nimtaguse. <verse eid="ACT 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 25:16" />Mbali niye niwedika kuwa siyo chihendo cha Waloma kumulava munhu yatagusigwe, yang'hali msitaka hanaiting'hana na msitaki wake na kutogoliligwa kwiigombela kwa yamasitaka yayo. <verse eid="ACT 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 25:17" />Viwezile hano hamwe na niye, sikalame bule mbali siku isondelele nikala muna ichitala na kulagiliza munhu ino yagaligwe mgati. <verse eid="ACT 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 25:18" />Watagusa wake wema, mbali hawalavile malongelezo yehile fana vinigesile. <verse eid="ACT 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 25:19" />Mbali wakala na mbuza zimwenga muna inzila ya kumsondelela Mulungu yawo wenyewo na muna zimbuli za munhu imwe yatangigwe Yesu, yoyakalile kadanganika, mbali Paulo kagong'onda kuwa ngima. <verse eid="ACT 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 25:20" />Sidimanyile dakutenda kusonhela mbuli iyo, ivo nimuuza Paulo fana kolonda kuhita kwinhaguso kuichitala kuja Yelusalemu, kwa ichimu cha malongelezo yayo. <verse eid="ACT 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 25:21" />Mbali Paulo kakanha lufaa, kalamba yakalizigwe na yamuleke mfalume wa isi ya Loma yalamule mbuli iyo. Ivo nilagiliza yakalizigwe mbaka vondaningale kwa mfalume wa isi ya Loma.” <verse eid="ACT 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 25:22" />Agilipa kamulongela Fesito, “Niye mwenyewo nolonda nimtegeleze munhu ino.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="ACT 25:22">Fesito kamwidika, “Kwizamtegeleza igolo.”<verse eid="ACT 25:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 25:23" />Siku isondelele Agilipa na Benike weza kwa ng'henze, wengila hanhu ha kutegelezela mbuli, hamwe na wakulu wa wakalizi na walangulizi wa dibululu. Fesito kalagiliza Paulo yagaligwe hanhu baho.<verse eid="ACT 25:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 25:24" />Fesito kalonga, “Mfalume Agilipa na wose mwili hano hamwe na cheye, momuwona munhu ino. Kaye yose ya Wayahudi, hano na kuja Yelusalemu wanilamba kwa kuguta nyangi kuwa halondeka kuwa mgima kaidi. <verse eid="ACT 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 25:25" />Mbali niye siwonile kuwa katenda jojose dihile dodimtenda yakomigwe. Paulo mwenyewo kakanha lufaa kwa Mkulu wa Loma, nilamula kumgala Loma. <verse eid="ACT 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 25:26" />Mbali niye kwa mbuli yake nabule chinhu cha kweli cha kumwandikila Imkulu. Ivo nimgala hano haulongozi wako weye mfalume Agilipa, muladi uhakomeleza kulola goya nidahe kuwa na chinhu cha kwandika. <verse eid="ACT 25:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 25:27" />Kwaviya nogesa havinogile bule kumgala mfungwa bila kulagusa chiyabanange.”<verse eid="ACT 25:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 25" />
  <chapter number="26" style="c" sid="ACT 26" />
  <para style="s">Paulo koigombela haulongozi ha Agilipa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 26:1" />Maabaho Agilipa kamulongela Paulo, “Sambi kodaha kuigombela mwenyewo.” Baho Paulo kagolosa mkono wake kaigombela, na kandusa kulonga,<verse eid="ACT 26:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 26:2" />“Mfalume Agilipa! Noiwona nina ndondokela diyelo kwima haulongozi hako muladi niigombele mwenyewo kwa masitaka yose yowonivwizila Wayahudi, <verse eid="ACT 26:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 26:3" />kwaviya weye kuvimanya vihendo vose va Wayahudi na kuihasanya kwawo. Ivo nokulamba unitegeleze kwa kunifunyila umoyo.<verse eid="ACT 26:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 26:4" />“Kwaviya Wayahudi wose wavimanya ugima wangu kwandusila vinikalie mbwanga, kulawa mwanduso muna isi yangu na uko Yelusalemu. <verse eid="ACT 26:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 26:5" />Wavimanya kwa lusita lutali, na wodaha kumgong'ondela fana wahalonda kuwa kwandusila mwanduso nikala Falisayo nyamhile dini yetu. <verse eid="ACT 26:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 26:6" />Lelo sambi nokwima hano nigezigwe kwa ichimu cha lolelo donilinajo muna ichilagano chiya Mulungu choyekile na wasaho zetu. <verse eid="ACT 26:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 26:7" />Chilagano icho niicho chiya chochiloleligwa na makabila longo na maidi ya isi yetu, womtosela Mulungu vinogile imisi na ichilo, mwenevale mfalume, Wayahudi wonishitaka kwa ichimu cha uhuwilo uwo. <verse eid="ACT 26:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 26:8" />Lelo habali mweye hamuhuwila kuwa haidahika Mulungu kuwazilibula wanhu?<verse eid="ACT 26:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 26:9" />“Niye mwenyewo niwona kuwa nolondeka nitende yose ihadahika hata kudilema zina da Yesu wa Nazaleti. <verse eid="ACT 26:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 26:10" />Vino ivo nitendile uko Yelusalemu. Kwa udaho wa wakulu wa nhambiko niweka wanhu wa Mulungu wengi muna ichifungo, nawo viwatagusigwe kukomigwa, niye nitogola. <verse eid="ACT 26:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 26:11" />Miyanza mingi niwatagusa muna zikaye za kutosela na nigeza kuwatenda waulige uhuwilo wawo, nikala nowehila ng'hani mbaka nihita muna yamabululu ya wageni kuwagaza.”<verse eid="ACT 26:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kolonga viyakomboke</para>
  <para style="r">(<ref loc="ACT 9:1-19">Sang'hano 9:1-19</ref>, <ref loc="ACT 22:6-16">22:6-16</ref>)</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 26:12" />“Kwa lungilo ijo nihita Damasiki kwa udaho na malagilizo kulawa kwa Wakulu wa nhambiko. <verse eid="ACT 26:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 26:13" />Saa sita imisi niwona bung'hulo kulawa kuulanga dofosa bung'hulo da zuwa, dinimwemwesa niye na wayangu wochikalile wose muna umwanza chila ubanzi. <verse eid="ACT 26:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 26:14" />Chose chigwa hasi, niye nihulika dizi donilongela kwa Chiyebulaniya, ‘Sauli, Sauli! Habali konigaza? Vidala kumwako kutowa lubiki lusongoke.’ <verse eid="ACT 26:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 26:15" />Niye niuza, ‘Weye kwa yelihi Mndewa?’ Na Mndewa kanidika, ‘Niye ni Yesu weye younigaza.’ <verse eid="ACT 26:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 26:16" />Mbali inuka na wime kwa migulu yako. Nikulawila kukusagula uwe msang'hani na makalangama wangu. Walongele wanhu wamwenga yaja youyawone diyelo na yaja yondanikulagusile hamwande. <verse eid="ACT 26:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 26:17" />Nizakukombola kulawa kwa wanhu wa Isilaeli na kulawa kwa wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi wondanikutume kumwawo, <verse eid="ACT 26:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 26:18" />uwagubule yameso yawo na kuwatendeza walawe muna diziza na kwingila muna dibung'hulo, walawe muna uudaho wa Lufyende, wamuhindukile Mulungu, muladi kwa uhuwilo wawo walekeleligwe uhasanyi wawo na kusola nyafasi yawo muna wanhu iwaja wowasaguligwe na Mulungu.”<verse eid="ACT 26:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo kolonga mbuli ya Usang'hano wake</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 26:19" />“Ivo Mfalume Agilipa siyalemile bule malaguso kulawa kuulanga kwa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 26:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 26:20" />Teng'hu nipetela Damasiki na Yelusalemu na maabaho muna isi yose ya Yudeya na kwa wanhu weli Wayahudi, niwapetela kuwa wolondeka wasamhe uhasanyi wawo na wambwelele Mulungu na kutenda mbuli zozilagusa kuwa wasamha. <verse eid="ACT 26:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 26:21" />Kwa ichimu icho Wayahudi wanigwila vinikalile muna Ikaye ya Mulungu, na wageza kunikoma. <verse eid="ACT 26:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 26:22" />Mbali Mulungu kanitaza mbaka diyelo, na ivo nokwima hano kulava ukalangama wangu kwa wose, kwa wakulu na wadodo. Silonga chinhu chimwenga bule, mbali nolonga yaja walotezi na Musa yowalongile kuwa yezalawilila, <verse eid="ACT 26:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 26:23" />kuwa Chilisito Mkombola kolondeka yagazigwe na yawe wa mwanduso kuzilibuka, muladi yagong'onde mbuli ya bung'hulo da ulopozi kwa Wayahudi na kwa wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi.”<verse eid="ACT 26:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 26:24" />Paulo viyakalile koigombela, Fesito kalandula dizi jake, “Paulo kuna lukwale! Kusoma ng'hani kukutenda uwe na lukwale!”<verse eid="ACT 26:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 26:25" />Paulo kamwidika, “Mwenevale Fesito, nabule lukwale! Chinilonga ni ukweli muhala. <verse eid="ACT 26:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 26:26" />Mfalume Agilipa nodaha kulonga na weye bila ludumbo, kwaviya kuzimanya mbuli zino. Novimanya kuwa yoyalawilile yomanyika kumwako kwaviya mbuli haitendeke kuna yamafiso bule. <verse eid="ACT 26:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 26:27" />Mfalume Agilipa, vino kowahuwila walotezi wa Mulungu? Novimanya kowahuwila!”<verse eid="ACT 26:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 26:28" />Agilipa kamulongela Paulo, “Vino kogesa kwa lusita luno ludodo kwizanitenda niye niwe nomuhuwila Chilisito?” <verse eid="ACT 26:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 26:29" />Paulo kedika, “Iwe kwa lusita lutali hebu luguhi, nhosa yangu kwa Mulungu ni kuwa weye na wamwenga wose wowonihulika niye diyelo mudahe kuwa fana niye, mbali bila minyololo ino!” <verse eid="ACT 26:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 26:30" />Maabaho Mfalume Agilipa na mkulu wa mkowa na Benike na wamwenga wose wenuka, <verse eid="ACT 26:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 26:31" />na viwasegela wailongela wenyewo, “Munhu ino hatendile chochose chochimulonda yatagusigwe ifa hebu chifungo.” <verse eid="ACT 26:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 26:32" />Agilipa kamulongela Fesito, “Munhu ino yahadahile kulekeleligwa one halondile kukanha lufani kwa mfalume wa isi ya Loma.”<verse eid="ACT 26:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 26" />
  <chapter number="27" style="c" sid="ACT 27" />
  <para style="s">Paulo kogaligwa Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 27:1" />Viilamuligwe kuwa chihite Italiya, Paulo na wafungigwa wamwenga wekigwa muna yamakono ya Yuliyo, yoyakalile mkulu wa wakalizi wa chibumbila chitangigwe “Chibumbila cha wakalizi cha Agusito.” <verse eid="ACT 27:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 27:2" />Chikwela meli ilawile Adilamito ikalile muna mwanza na kufosela bandali zimwenga za mkowa wa Asiya, chandusa mwanza. Alisitaliko mkaya wa Makedoniya kulawa Sesalonike yoyakalile hamwe na cheye. <verse eid="ACT 27:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 27:3" />Siku isondelele chifika Sidoni, Yuliyo kamtendela vinogile Paulo na kamtogolela yahite na kuwalola mbwiya zake, wamwing'he vinhu viyolonda. <verse eid="ACT 27:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 27:4" />Kulawa uko chigendelela na umwanza, na kwaviya beho dikala dobuma kwa nguvu dochizila kuulongozi, chifosela ubanzi wa Chipulo uko beho hadikalile kulu. <verse eid="ACT 27:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 27:5" />Chiloka ibahali ya Chilikiya na Pamfiliya, chifika Mila bululu da Likiya.<verse eid="ACT 27:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 27:6" />Uko mkulu ija kaifika ngalawa ya Alekisandilila ikalile yohita Italiya, ivo kachikweza umo. <verse eid="ACT 27:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 27:7" />Chigendelela na umwanza ugaluga kwa siku nyingi, kwa manhesa makulu chifika habehi na Nido. Kwaviya vulavumbi dikala dochigoma, chifosela ubanzi wa hasi ya chisiwa cha Chilete, habehi na Salimone. Uko vulavumbi hadiwile kulu. <verse eid="ACT 27:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 27:8" />Chifosa mhwani kwa manhesa makulu, maabaho chifika hanhu hatangigwe Bandali Inogile, habehi na bululu da Leseya.<verse eid="ACT 27:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 27:9" />Na vilufosile lusita mwingi, na siku ya kufunga ikala ifosile, lelo ikala ng'hondo ng'hani kufosa na ngalawa, ivo Paulo kawazuma <verse eid="ACT 27:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 27:10" />“Walume, nowona mwanza wetu wizakuwa muna ihatali. Chizakwagiza vinhu, siyo mbahasha muhala mbali na ugima wetu iviya.” <verse eid="ACT 27:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 27:11" />Mbali mkulu wa wakalizi kanogelwa na chiya chiyalongile mwene ngalawa na mwendeshaji wa ngalawa, na siyo chiya chiyalongile Paulo. <verse eid="ACT 27:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 27:12" />Bandali ija ikala haifaya kukala chipindi cha chihuhwe, wanhu wengi walamula chisegela uko na chihita Fonike one ihadahika, na chikala uko kwa siku zose ya chihuhwe. Foinike ni bandali ya Chilete ilola ubanzi wa kuchanyha wa ulawilo wa zuwa, na uko wahadahile kukala lusita lwa chihuhwe.<verse eid="ACT 27:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Vulavumbi kulu muna ibahali</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 27:13" />Vulavumbi da kusi jandusa kubuna nawo wagesa kuwa wapata chiwalondile kupata, ivo wandusa kusegela, wendesa ngalawa mbaka habehi na mhwani ya Chilete. <verse eid="ACT 27:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 27:14" />Mbali hamwande chidogo, dibeho kulu ng'hani ditangigwa “Beho da kuchanyha ya ulawilo wa zuwa” jandusa kubuna kulawa muna ichisiwa. <verse eid="ACT 27:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 27:15" />Ngalawa ikala yotowigwa na beho na hachidahile bule kuihasanya na beho. Ivo chiileka ingalawa isoligwe na beho. <verse eid="ACT 27:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 27:16" />Vichikalile chofosa habehi na ichisiwa chidodo chitangigwa Kauda, chidaha kwimiza ingalawa ndodo ya ingalawa ng'hulu ng'hani, mbali kwa manhesa. <verse eid="ACT 27:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 27:17" />Wanhu wakwega ingalawa ndodo, waizingiliza ingalawa ng'hulu ng'hani kwa mizabi. Wadumba kuwa wahadahile kunamata muna ingema ya mhwani ya Libiya, wahulumusa matanga na waileka ingalawa isoligwe na mbeho. <verse eid="ACT 27:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 27:18" />Beho digendelela kubuma na siku isondelele wandusa kwasa kunze mibahasha ikalile muna ingalawa. <verse eid="ACT 27:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 27:19" />Zuwa deketatu wandusa kwasa via va ngalawa kwa makono yawo wenyewo muna yamazi. <verse eid="ACT 27:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 27:20" />Kwa siku nyingi hachidahile kuwona zuwa hebu nhondo, na beho kulu digendelela kubuma. Kuuhelelo chikala chabule lolelo da kulopoligwa.<verse eid="ACT 27:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 27:21" />Viwakalile lusita mwingimengi bila ya kuja, Paulo kema hagati yawo na kalonga, “Walume, molondeka munitegeleze niye na muleke kulawa Chilete, one mutendile ivo chihayepule na manhesa yano na hasala zose. <verse eid="ACT 27:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 27:22" />Mbali lelo nomulambani, sekemufe moyo! Habule hata imwe wenu yondayagize ugima wake, mbali ngalawa muhala niiyo yondayagize. <verse eid="ACT 27:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 27:23" />Kwaviya chilo chifosile Mulungu yonimuhuwila na kumtosela kamtuma msenga wake wa kuulanga kumwangu, <verse eid="ACT 27:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 27:24" />kanilongela, ‘Paulo, sekeudumbe! Kolondeka wime haulongozi ha Mfalume wa Loma. Na kwa ichimu chako Mulungu kezakombola ugima wa chila munhu muna ingalawa.’ <verse eid="ACT 27:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 27:25" />Ivo walume, sangalaleni! Kwaviya nomuhuwila Mulungu kuwa izakuwa fana vinimulongeleni. <verse eid="ACT 27:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 27:26" />Mbali chizagaligwa mbaka kuna ichisiwa chimwenga.”<verse eid="ACT 27:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 27:27" />Chilo cha longo na nne, chikala chosoligwa uko na uko muna ibahali ya Adiliya. Chilo chikulu wanhu wa ingalawa wagesa kuwa wahabehi na isi inyalile. <verse eid="ACT 27:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 27:28" />Ivo walonda utali wa wingilo wa bahali kwa kuhulumusa luzabi lufungigwe chinhu chititu, wapata utali na nzela malongo mane, hamwande chidogo watenda ivo kaidi, wapata utali wa nzela malongo matatu <verse eid="ACT 27:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 27:29" />Wadumba ngalawa sekeyangame muna yamabwe, ivo wahumulusa nanga nne kuna ichisogo cha ingalawa, na watosa uche hima hima. <verse eid="ACT 27:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 27:30" />Wanhu wa ingalawa ng'hulu ng'hani walonda kuibanga na kuileka ingalawa ija. Ivo viwakomeleze kutelemusa ingalawa ndodo muna yamazi, waivwizila kuwa wohita kutelemusa nanga ubanzi wa ulongozi. <verse eid="ACT 27:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 27:31" />Mbali Paulo kamulongela mkulu wa wakalizi na wakalizi wake, “One wanhu wa ingalawa wahalawa muna ingalawa, hamwizakomboligwa bule.”<verse eid="ACT 27:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="ACT 27:32" />Ivo wakalizi wakanha zinzabi za ingalawa ng'hulu ng'hani, na waileka izalame muna ibahali. <verse eid="ACT 27:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="ACT 27:33" />Vikukalile habehi na kukunguzuka, Paulo kawalamba wose waje, “Kwa siku longo na nne mukala modumba, na hamudile chinhu chochose.” <verse eid="ACT 27:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="ACT 27:34" />Nomulambani muje ndiya, moilonda muladi muwe wagima. Kwaviya hata mvili imwe muna yamatwi yenu haizakwaga. <verse eid="ACT 27:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="ACT 27:35" />Viyakomeleze kulonga vino, Paulo kasola gate, kamtogoza Mulungu haulongozi hawo wose, kadimogola na kandusa kuja. <verse eid="ACT 27:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="ACT 27:36" />Ivo wose wagumigwa moyo, na chila munhu kaja ndiya. <verse eid="ACT 27:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="ACT 27:37" />Wanhu wose chikalile muna ingalawa chikala magana maidi na malongo saba na sita. <verse eid="ACT 27:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="ACT 27:38" />Chila munhu viyegute, wahunguza mbahasha kulawa muna imeli na kwasa uhemba muna ibahali<verse eid="ACT 27:38" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ngalawa ng'hulu ng'hani yobeneka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="ACT 27:39" />Viuchile, wanhu wa ngalawa hawavimanyile isi ija ila wadiwona Bwilingu, waitogolela kuisigamiza ingalawa uko one yahadahika. <verse eid="ACT 27:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="ACT 27:40" />Ivo wakanha nanga na kuzileka muibahali, lusita ulwo ulwo wazifungula nzabi zozikalile ziwamha usukani, maabaho wajamha tanga dimwe haulongozi kwamha dibeho wagendelelela kumhwani. <verse eid="ACT 27:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="ACT 27:41" />Ngalawa ifika hanhu heli na nzila mbili za mazi ya bahali, ngalawa ikwama. Hanhu haulongozi ha imeli hakala hadidimile muna umsanga haidahile bule kusegela, na kuchisogo kwandusa kubeneka kwaichimu cha ludabwa lwa mawingu.<verse eid="ACT 27:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="ACT 27:42" />Wakalizi wailunga kuwakoma wafungwa, muladi sekewagendelele mbaka mhwani na kukimbila. <verse eid="ACT 27:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="ACT 27:43" />Mbali Mkulu wa wakalizi kalonda kumkombola Paulo, kawalemesa sekewatende fana viwailungile, kawalagiliza waja wadahile kogelela wazumhe mwanduso mwiibahali, wafike isi inyalile, <verse eid="ACT 27:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="ACT 27:44" />wamwenga wasigale, wakwela muna zimbawo na wamwenga uhachanyha ya via va ngalawa. Ivo wanhu wose wafika kuna isi inyalile.<verse eid="ACT 27:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 27" />
  <chapter number="28" style="c" sid="ACT 28" />
  <para style="s">Kuna ichisiwa cha Melita</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="ACT 28:1" />Vichifikile mhwani chiifunza kuwa chisiwa chiya chotangigwa Melita. <verse eid="ACT 28:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="ACT 28:2" />Wakaya wa haja wakala mbwiya zetu, wakong'ha moto na wachihokela, kwaviya mvula ikala yotonya na kukala na mbeho. <verse eid="ACT 28:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="ACT 28:3" />Paulo kadondola mzigo mdodo wa ngodi na kuwika muna umoto, zoka dilawa kwa ichimu cha uja umoto na dimzingiliza muna umkono. <verse eid="ACT 28:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="ACT 28:4" />Wakaya viwawonile zoka dotinga muna umkono wa Paulo, wailongela, “Yodahika munhu ino kakoma, ingawa kakomboka muna ibahali, mbali yelibule ubagulo haizamuleka yagendelele kuwa mgima.” <verse eid="ACT 28:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="ACT 28:5" />Mbali Paulo kadikung'husila dizoka muna umoto bila kulumigwa hohose. <verse eid="ACT 28:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="ACT 28:6" />Wakala wogozela yalulumuke hebu yagwe na bahobaho yadanganike. Mbali viwagozele kwa lusita lutali na hawawonile chinhu chochose chimulawilile, wabidula magesa yawo na walonga, “Ino ni imwe wa milungu!”<verse eid="ACT 28:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="ACT 28:7" />Habehi na hanhu haja hakala na migunda ya Pubuliyo, mkulu wa chisiwa chiya. Kachihokela vinogile chikala wageni wake kwa siku nhatu, <verse eid="ACT 28:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="ACT 28:8" />Mbali tati yake Pubuliyo kakala kagona muna dikomwa mtamu na kohala damu. Paulo kumuwona, na viyakomeleze kutosa, keka makono yake muna iditwi jake na kumuhonya. <verse eid="ACT 28:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="ACT 28:9" />Viyalawilile yayo, wanhu wamwenga wowakalile na vitamu muna ichisiwa icho weza na wahonyigwa. <verse eid="ACT 28:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="ACT 28:10" />Waching'ha vitumetume vingi, na vichanduse kaidi umwanza, weka muna ingalawa vinhu vovichilondile muna umwanza.<verse eid="ACT 28:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwanza wa kulawa Melita kuhita Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="ACT 28:11" />Viifose miezi mitatu, chandusa mwanza kwa ngalawa ng'hulu ng'hani ya Alekisandaliya, na yalama yake ni, “Ndugu Mbasa.” Ingalawa iyo ikala igela nanga muna ichisiwa lusita lwose lwa chihuhwe. <verse eid="ACT 28:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="ACT 28:12" />Vichifikile bululu da Silakusa chikala haja kwa siku nhatu. <verse eid="ACT 28:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="ACT 28:13" />Kulawa haja chihita na chifika muna dibulu da Legiomu. Siku isondelele beho dibuma kulawa kusi, na zuwa disondelele chifika bululu da Puteoli. <verse eid="ACT 28:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="ACT 28:14" />Uko chiwafika wahuwila wamwenga wachilamba chikale nawo siku saba na ivo chihita isi ya Loma. <verse eid="ACT 28:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="ACT 28:15" />Wahuwila uko isi ya Loma viwahulike kusonhela cheye, weza hanhu ha Apiyo, na miyanza mitatu kaiting'hana na cheye. Paulo viyawawonile, kamtogoza Mulungu na kageligwa moyo.<verse eid="ACT 28:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Paulo uko Loma</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="ACT 28:16" />Vichifikile isi ya Loma, Paulo kalekeleligwa kukala yaidumwe na mkalizi imwe wa kumkaliza.<verse eid="ACT 28:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="ACT 28:17" />Vizifosile siku nhatu hamwande, Paulo kawatanga hamwe walanguliza wa Chiyahudi. Viwaiting'hane, kawalongela, “Ndugu zangu Waisilaeli, ingawa sitendile chinhu chihile mwa wanhu wetu hebu vihendo viya vochihokele kwa wasaho zetu, nikala mfungwa uko Yelusalemu na kufungigwa kugaligwa mbaka isi ya Loma. <verse eid="ACT 28:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="ACT 28:18" />Viwakomeleze kuniuza, Walumi walonda kunilekelela kwaviya hawanifikile na chinhu chihile chochose chochilonda nikomigwe. <verse eid="ACT 28:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="ACT 28:19" />Mbali Wayahudi viwalemile, niwangilizigwa nikanhe lufaa kwa mfalume wa isi ya Loma, ingawa nabule mbuli ya kuwasitaka wanhu wangu. <verse eid="ACT 28:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="ACT 28:20" />Lekamana nimulambani niwawone na kulonga na mweye, kwaviya nifungigwa minyololo kwa ichimu cha chiya chowochilolela wanhu wa Isilaeli.”<verse eid="ACT 28:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="ACT 28:21" />Wawo wamulongela, “Cheye hachizahokela usenga wowose kulawa Yudeya kusonhela weye, hebu habule ndugu yoyose kulawa kuja yezile na mbuli ya sambi hebu yalongile chinhu chihile kusonhela weye. <verse eid="ACT 28:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="ACT 28:22" />Mbali cholonda kuhulika magesa yako, kwaviya chivimanya kuwa chila hanhu wanhu wolonga vihile kusonhela bumbila jako.”<verse eid="ACT 28:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="ACT 28:23" />Wapanga zuwa da kuiting'hana na Paulo, na wanhu wengi weza hanhu hoyakalile Paulo. Kwandusila imitondo mbaka ichigulogulo kawafambulila usenga wake kusonhela Ufalume wa Mulungu, kasang'hanila Malagilizo ya Mulungu yoyamwing'hile Musa na maandiko ya walotezi wa Mulungu, kageza kuwakwesa wamtogole Yesu. <verse eid="ACT 28:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="ACT 28:24" />Wanhu wamwenga wayahuwila yaja yoyalongigwe, na wamwenga hawayahuwile. <verse eid="ACT 28:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="ACT 28:25" />Viwakalile hawaitogolela, wasegela. Mbali Paulo kalonga, “Muhe Yelile kalonga vinogile na tati zetu kufosela mulomo wa Isaya, mulotezi wa Mulungu. <verse eid="ACT 28:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="ACT 28:26" />Mulungu kalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">‘Hita na uwalongele wanhu wano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">Mwizategeleza na kutegeleza, mbali hamwizavimanya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:26">Mwizalola na kulola, mbali hamwizawona.<verse eid="ACT 28:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="ACT 28:27" />Kwaviya mizoyo ya wanhu wano ni midala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">na magutwi yawo wayasita,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">na meso yawo wafinya.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">Bule ivo, meso yawo yezadaha kuwona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">magutwi yawo yezadaha kuhulika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">nzewele zawo zizadaha kuvimanya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">wodaha kunibwelela niye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="ACT 28:27">na niye nizadaha kuwahonya.’ ”<verse eid="ACT 28:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="ACT 28:28" />Maabaho Paulo kalonga, “Muvimanye kuwa mbuli ya Mulungu ya ulopozi ugaligwa kwa wanhu weli siyo Wayahudi. Nawo wezaitegeleza!” <verse eid="ACT 28:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="ACT 28:29" />Paulo viyakomeze kulonga vino, Wayahudi wasegela, waiswela wenyewo kwa wenyewo. <verse eid="ACT 28:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="ACT 28:30" />Kwa miyaka midi Paulo kakala kaye yoyapangile yeye mwenyewo na kakala kowahokela wanhu wose wowezile kumulola. <verse eid="ACT 28:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="ACT 28:31" />Kapeta mbuli ya Ufalume wa Mulungu na kafundiza mbuli ya Mndewa Yesu Chilisito, kalonga kwa ugangamalo na kwa kuilegeha.<verse eid="ACT 28:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="ACT 28" />
</usx>